s://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/og/ml_og_3ef3aba4-2c49-41b9-a35e-098bcf23d13f.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"16\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\"}]]\ne:null\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1b:I[46593,[\"8310\",\"static/chunks/0e5ce63c-d67f03f91dead517.js\",\"2851\",\"static/chunks/2851-61d9018319534ee1.js\",\"4438\",\"static/chunks/4438-0fb3c9541d5ce099.js\",\"7648\",\"static/chunks/7648-c4b8eb71997b90ca.js\",\"4250\",\"static/chunks/4250-8a0abad63387369e.js\",\"6157\",\"static/chunks/6157-9d53a04c19c89a6d.js\",\"6133\",\"static/chunks/6133-73a677684b91003f.js\",\"2230\",\"static/chunks/2230-d9ad88410855d08b.js\",\"1974\",\"static/chunks/1974-eff7f5319f06cf2b.js\",\"9027\",\"static/chunks/9027-9127ac059b60baed.js\",\"4340\",\"static/chunks/4340-d3ae12c83e35337f.js\",\"8822\",\"static/chunks/8822-3abbbd2992405ca5.js\",\"8925\",\"static/chunks/8925-be31378ddebe7ed1.js\",\"2552\",\"static/chunks/2552-db829515c948c8bf.js\",\"1312\",\"static/chunks/1312-38b71b2dfb0e337c.js\",\"6306\",\"static/chunks/6306-64dbb410686c2eb1.js\",\"3425\",\"static/chunks/3425-a2c85b0c2a6b5c23.js\",\"4929\",\"static/chunks/4929-b190b8d3901448fd.js\",\"803\",\"static/chunks/803-1ef4757aa8cd0b97.js\",\"2069\",\"static/chunks/2069-e5bb11b0d7d17345.js\",\"8537\",\"static/chunks/8537-672d323429f6c990.js\",\"7362\",\"static/chunks/7362-7018eb9828f2678a.js\",\"1058\",\"static/chunks/1058-24aa9d9723275af3.js\",\"6115\",\"static/chunks/6115-5ae485a35e2016ea.js\",\"1931\",\"static/chunks/app/page-cf69583f0cad81e6.js\"],\"default\"]\n1c:T624,This web-based generation platform gives creators flexible access to the complete Seedance model ecosystem, spanning Seedance 1.5, Seedance 2.0 Mini, and the flagship Seedance 2.5. Designed for scalable visual production, the service allows users to generate tailored video content based on required speed, scene complexity, and rendering resolution.\n\nArriving in late July as a major upgrade over Seedance 2.0, Seedance 2.5 significantly elevates AI video production standards. The flagship model supports continuous 30-second video generation alongside 4K resolution output, delivering unprecedented visual clarity, temporal consistency, and detailed rendering. To maximize creative control, Seedance 2.5 incorporates multi-modal media input processing. Creators can combine text prompts with multiple refere"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"nce images, video clips, and audio files to direct subtle character performance, complex camera movements, and scene narrative flow.\n\nThe platform supports both text-to-video and image-to-video creation across diverse commercial and artistic applications—including commercial product ads, high-engagement social videos, cinematic storyboarding, and concept design. Visitors can test prompt structures, evaluate real Seedance 2.5 sample videos and demo examples, and compare performance directly against earlier model iterations. Whether you are benchmarking Seedance 2.5 prompts, reviewing visual motion fidelity, or monitoring official release-date and availability updates, this service provides an end-to-end workflow for high-definition AI video synthesis.1d:T40b,My Recomy turns word-of-mouth into income. You recommend a place you trust, someone books through your link and spends there, and you get paid. When that same customer comes back, you get paid again — the model rewards retention, not just the first visit.\n\nBusinesses gain a performance-based acquisition channel: they pay a commission only on real, validated consumption, decide the commission they offer, and can start on a free plan. From one panel they manage collaborations with ambassadors, traceable bookings, challenges with rewards, their own loyalty program, invoicing, daily closings, team access and reports.\n\nAmbassadors work from their phone: they choose the businesses they trust, share their link or QR, track every booking and commission in real time, and get paid automatically every week through Stripe Connect.\n\nCustomers book through someone they trust, can pay from the app — including splitting the bill — and earn loyalty points redeemable at each business.\n\nOperating across Europe and the United States.1e:T66f,Cheaper Inference lets engineering teams cut AI inference spend by routing requests to discounted models from multiple providers through a single OpenAI-compatible API. Keep your existing `/v1/chat/completions` integrations, swap the b"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ase URL and API key, and instantly access a live marketplace of text, image, and video models at significantly reduced per‑token rates.\n\nBrowse a transparent catalog that shows **real-time capacity**, **effective discounts**, and **24-hour usage** across providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Meta, DeepSeek, and more. You can compare input and output token pricing, inspect current activity, and select models per request without paying any routing surcharge or exceeding direct list prices.\n\nCheaper Inference is designed for teams that care about both cost and data controls. The marketplace records only usage and billing metadata, never prompt or response bodies, and offers **zero-data-retention** routes plus pass-through cache controls when supported by the upstream model. Every request is visible in your history, so finance and engineering can audit usage and optimize workloads.\n\nKey advantages include:\n\n- **Up to 60% savings** on AI model inference costs\n- **OpenAI SDK compatibility** with minimal configuration changes\n- **Usage-based billing** starting from $5 with no monthly commitment\n- **Capacity selling** for providers to monetize unused inference resources\n\nWhether you’re shipping an LLM-heavy product, experimenting with new models, or managing large-scale workloads, Cheaper Inference helps you lower per-request costs while maintaining observability and clear data boundaries.1f:T499,page-mascot adds a playful, interactive character to the top of your site that reacts to visitors in real time. Built with React, this mascot tracks the reader’s cursor, follows their movements, and even **blinks when poked**, creating a subtle but memorable moment of delight that keeps users engaged longer.\n\nChoose from **fifty-two hand-drawn mascots** or have a custom character generated via an agent skill tailored to your brand’s personality. Whether you run a blog, documentation hub, product landing page, or portfolio, page-mascot gives your layout a distinctive visual hook that stands out from generic hero image"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"s.\n\nBy integrating this character into your layout, you can:\n\n- **Increase on-page interaction** with responsive character motion\n- **Reinforce brand identity** through a consistent, recognizable mascot\n- **Guide visitor attention** toward key content areas by aligning mascot gaze and movement\n\nImplementation is straightforward for React developers, making it easy to drop a character into your header or sticky banner. With page-mascot, your pages gain a unique, character-driven experience that feels alive, personal, and instantly recognizable.20:T4f2,Jev Playground on Beam lets you experiment with open-source Jev-style decision models like **Laya, SemIf, Kev, NanoJev, and Jevlike** through an interactive, API-ready environment. Send a real-world state, define structured questions, and instantly receive **calibrated probability distributions** that guide routing, triage, and policy decisions.\n\nBuilt for engineers and product teams, the playground mirrors the exact JSON contract you use in production. Design decision schemas, preview responses, and then **copy the ready-made curl, Python, or JavaScript snippets** to integrate with Beam’s OpenAI-compatible endpoints. This cuts friction from prototype to deployment, ensuring that what you test in the browser behaves identically in your backend.\n\nUse Jev Playground to:\n\n- **Model operational decisions** such as support routing, risk assessment, or workflow branching\n- **Standardize structured outputs** with typed questions and criteria definitions\n- **Validate probability calibration** before wiring models into user-facing flows\n\nBy combining open decision models with a consistent invocation format, Jev Playground helps you replace brittle rule systems with transparent, probabilistic decision logic that’s easier to iterate, monitor, and scale.21:T576,Squad gives you AI teammates that plug directly into your existing workflows, log into your business tools, and autonomously execute recurring tasks on schedule. Instead of juggling inboxes, spreadsheets, and project "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"boards, you assign missions to named AI coworkers like Tessa or Milo and watch them move work from \"queued\" to \"done\" while keeping you in the loop.\n\nSquad connects to the AI plans you already pay for—such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, SuperGrok, Copilot, and more—so you can **stack multiple accounts**, **allocate different models per teammate**, and **set intelligent fallbacks** that keep work running even when one account hits its limits. This means higher throughput with no surprise per-task charges.\n\nYour AI teammates sign in across tools like Slack, Notion, Gmail, Stripe, Airtable, Sheets, HubSpot, and calendars to carry a single job from app to app until it’s finished. They can draft client replies, prepare payroll, compare vendor quotes, update content calendars, and surface decisions that need your approval.\n\nUse Squad to:\n\n- **Automate multi-step business workflows** across messaging, docs, CRM, and billing\n- **Delegate routine knowledge work** to specialized AI teammates with the right model\n- **Scale capacity instantly** by adding more AI accounts instead of hiring\n- **Maintain control** with queues, reviews, and clear visibility into every mission22:T48a,On.design is an invite-only community built for professional designers who want to share work, grow their reputation, and connect with independent studios. Instead of getting lost in generic feeds, members curate thoughtful profiles that highlight their process, personality, and visual craft.\n\nWithin the community, designers can showcase case studies, publish in-progress explorations, and receive feedback from peers who deeply understand interaction, branding, and product design. Independent studios can discover fresh talent, evaluate portfolios quickly, and build trusted relationships with specialists across visual, UX, and motion disciplines.\n\nOn.design emphasizes quality over volume, with a focus on meaningful connections and long-term collaborations. Members benefit from:\n\n- **Profile-driven discovery** that surfaces distinctive voices and sty"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"les\n- **Curated exposure** to independent studios and creative teams\n- **Peer recognition** through shared work, comments, and endorsements\n\nWhether you’re an emerging designer refining your portfolio or a studio scouting collaborators, On.design creates a focused space to design, together — again.23:T4c7,quicker.chat is a unified inbox for Mac that brings every direct message into one distraction-free workspace. Instead of bouncing between Instagram, X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp, and email, you can review and respond from a single, organized timeline that adapts to your priorities.\n\nPowered by intelligent filtering and AI assistance, quicker.chat automatically separates high-signal conversations from low-value noise. **Important clients, leads, and collaborators stay visible**, while promotional clutter and low-priority threads fade into the background. The app also drafts replies in your natural tone, helping you clear backlogs without sounding robotic or off-brand.\n\nUse quicker.chat to:\n\n- **Centralize scattered DMs** from multiple social channels into one Mac inbox\n- **Auto-prioritize conversations** so you never miss critical messages\n- **Generate on-brand responses** that match your own writing style\n- **Shorten response times** while keeping context across channels\n\nWhether you manage a personal brand, a busy creator account, or customer conversations across several networks, quicker.chat turns chaotic messaging into a streamlined, manageable workflow that keeps you responsive, consistent, and in control.24:T584,Social SDK is a strongly typed TypeScript toolkit for building reliable, cross-network social publishing directly into your product. Instead of a single vague success flag, it returns a granular outcome per destination, including precise states like **published**, **processing**, or **failed**, plus the underlying reason. That means no more guessing which networks actually received your content.\n\nWith Social SDK, your editor understands each account’s capabilities before anything hits production. A "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"text-only post aimed at Instagram, for example, fails at compile time or in your UI, not hours later in a log file. Everything is typed end to end, including mocks, so your integration remains predictable and maintainable as social APIs evolve.\n\nKey advantages include:\n\n- **Per-network outcomes** with explicit states and reasons\n- **Capability-aware types** that prevent invalid posts by design\n- **Typed analytics references** that clearly indicate when metrics are unavailable\n- **Deterministic testing** via an offline mock backend that mirrors real behavior\n\nSocial SDK is open source (MIT) and available on npm, making it straightforward to adopt in modern TypeScript stacks. Whether you are orchestrating multi-network posting, reading engagement metrics, or wiring up comments and messages, Social SDK gives your team a single, typed interface to social networks with confidence in every response.25:T894,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"EchoTik.live is a TikTok analytics tool and data platform. Your Data-Driven TikTok E-Commerce Expert. Empowering sellers and EC-creators with data-driven insights for product selection, influencer identification, live stream and video optimization, and more. Our mission is \"Discover TikTok e-commerce data with EchoTik\". We help creators and brands find the best content, track target TikTok creators \u0026 videos, and compare them insightfully. We also help sellers explore potential hot products and make decisions on product selection in TikTok. EchoTik.live is a data assistant for TikTok, dedicated to helping sellers and short video creators discover hot topics, analyze the composition of goods/videos/live broadcasts, and provide data insights for your decision-making. It aims to analyze data on TikTok such as popular products, videos, and live streams to help sellers and content creators make better decisions. By gaining insights from the analytics of viral content on TikTok, EchoTik.live assists users in discovering trending topics and understanding what resonates with the TikTok audience. \nFeatures\nChoose Sales Goods: Insight into billion-level market data, Accurately locate the trend.\nFind Influencer: Direct to top influencer. Build brand growth fast lane.\nCheck Competitor: Monitor market/competitor. Improve market competitiveness.\nScreen Live: Analyze live broadcast ecosystem data. View high GMV live broadcasts.\nData API\nProfessional API platform built on EchoTik's data infrastructure, covering all platform data and TikTok real-time endpoints.\nReal-time + Historical Data\nPowered by EchoTik, stream real-time data alongside massive historical archives — track trends up to 1,000 days back for richer analytics, model training, and market intelligence.\nFull Data Coverage\nComprehensive coverage across every dimension of the TikTok e-commerce ecosystem.\nReady to Use\nComplete developer docs and code examples included. No complex setup required — follow the guide and make your first API call in minutes.\nFast Response\nHigh-performance backend with powerful concurrent request handling. Low-latency responses keep your workflows smooth and uninterrupted at any scale."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"26:T5c7,Straitly gives engineering teams a unified, OpenAI-compatible API to access 140+ frontier LLMs with zero token markup and aggressive discounts on early usage. Instead of juggling separate keys, quotas, and dashboards across Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Meta and others, you point your application at a single endpoint and let Straitly handle routing, uptime and cost optimization.\n\nBehind the scenes, Straitly continuously routes each request to the healthiest, fastest, and cheapest provider for the specified model, so you get higher reliability and lower inference bills without rewriting code. **Zero data retention (ZDR)**, **SOC 2 Type II–audited controls**, and strict **“never trained on”** guarantees keep prompts and outputs out of training pipelines. This makes it easier to satisfy security, privacy, and compliance reviews for production workloads.\n\nDevelopers can drop Straitly into existing codebases in minutes using familiar OpenAI-style clients in cURL, Python, or JavaScript. From indie hackers to venture-backed engineering teams, you can qualify quickly, receive $100 in trial credits, and secure up to **30% off your first $10K of token spend** with flexible usage-based or committed pricing.\n\nKey advantages include:\n- **One API for 140+ LLMs across 20+ providers**\n- **Optimized routing for uptime, latency, and token pricing**\n- **Zero data retention with SOC 2 Type II controls**\n- **No token markup plus discounted program rates for serious usage**27:T55d,Fanout is a structured learning environment for engineers mapping the frontier of AI research, systems engineering, and machine learning mathematics. It curates dense concepts into a coherent path, helping you connect theory with implementation across inference, optimization, and large-scale infrastructure.\n\nExplore **mapped learning roadmaps** that span model architectures, distributed training, systems design, and robotics pipelines. Daily paper digests, annotated derivations, and practical labs turn advanced literature into skills you can apply"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," in real projects, from GPU-efficient inference stacks to robust control systems.\n\nFanout emphasizes **cross-disciplinary integration**:\n- **AI research tracks** linking transformers, diffusion, and multimodal models with real benchmarks\n- **Systems design guides** for scaling inference, caching, and observability in production environments\n- **ML math deep dives** into optimization, probability, and linear algebra behind modern models\n- **Open robotics pathways** connecting perception, control, and simulation with hands-on experiments\n\nWhether you’re transitioning into AI infrastructure, sharpening your research intuition, or formalizing your ML math foundations, Fanout offers a continuously updated map of what to study next—and why it matters for building resilient, high-performance intelligent systems.28:T58f,Codag helps engineering teams slash large-language-model coding-agent costs by compressing noisy tool output into the few lines that actually matter. Instead of forcing Claude Code or Codex to read thousands of lines of passing tests, repetitive logs, and giant JSON blobs, Codag teaches your agents to focus on failures, anomalies, and key context.\n\nWith a single `codag setup` command, Codag attaches directly to supported coding agents, verifies your workspace with an unbilled live check, and installs a lightweight per-user local service. **No wrapper commands, prompt rewrites, or workflow changes** are required—developers keep using their existing agents exactly as before while Codag silently trims away wasted tokens.\n\nBy compacting test runs, search results, file trees, and infrastructure logs, Codag routinely achieves around **75% context compression**, cutting token spend across long debugging sessions and CI runs. Your provider accounts, credentials, and gateways remain unchanged; Codag simply ensures that your agents read the one failing test instead of 4,000 lines of green checks.\n\nUse Codag to:\n\n- **Reduce coding-agent token spend** across long-lived sessions\n- **Preserve crucial debugging co"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ntext** without overflowing the context window\n- **Speed up agent reasoning** by stripping away irrelevant tool noise\n- **Adopt AI-assisted development** without forcing developers to change their habits29:T71b,KleoKlaw is an AI-powered job search agent that lives entirely in iMessage, turning simple texts into tailored job applications. Instead of juggling dozens of browser tabs and application forms, you text Kleo what roles, locations, and salary ranges you’re targeting. From there, it continuously discovers matching openings on supported employer and applicant tracking systems, then prepares customized applications for your approval.\n\nKleo automatically **tailors your resume to each specific role**, aligning your experience with individual job descriptions and storing every version for future reference. It also **creates and manages employer and ATS accounts on your behalf**, securing credentials in an encrypted vault so you don’t have to remember multiple logins. You stay in control: Kleo only submits applications you approve over iMessage, with an optional auto-apply mode for roles that fit your predefined criteria.\n\nWith **smart role discovery**, **assisted daily applying**, and **transparent resume customization**, KleoKlaw streamlines the entire process from first search to submitted application. Any time an employer requires extra details, verification, or security steps, Kleo pauses and texts you for the missing information, then resumes where it left off. For job seekers who live on their iPhone or Mac, KleoKlaw turns job hunting into a focused, conversational workflow—without endless forms or repetitive copy‑pasting.\n\n**Key benefits:**\n- AI job search managed entirely via iMessage conversations\n- Role discovery from supported employer career systems based on your skills and goals\n- Per‑job resume tailoring with stored versions for each application\n- Encrypted handling of employer and ATS account credentials\n- Optional auto-apply for highly relevant roles within your limits2a:T596,Monid give"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"s AI agents direct eyes on TikTok, Instagram, Reddit, and YouTube without hitting login walls, captchas, or rate limits. Instead of paying for bloated social listening suites, you trigger ultra-cheap, per-look pulls that return live posts, view counts, likes, comments, and captions as clean JSON your agent can reason over.\n\nEach request fans out across four social feeds in parallel at just **$0.0015 per source**—about **$0.006 total**—so you can monitor fast-moving social trends continuously without committing to expensive subscriptions. Your agent can search TikTok niches, read Instagram profiles, scan Reddit threads, and parse YouTube search results, all through one skill file and a single chat message.\n\n**Key advantages:**\n- **Unified multi-network feed**: TikTok, Instagram, Reddit, and YouTube results in one structured response.\n- **Per-look pricing**: Pay only when your agent actually reads social data, even at hourly cadence.\n- **Login wall bypass**: No manual sessions, headless browsers, or captcha workarounds.\n- **Action-ready JSON**: Rankings, counts, and metadata formatted for downstream workflows.\n\nBeyond social feeds, the same Monid balance connects your agent to scraping, enrichment, search, and media-generation APIs, letting it not only listen to what’s moving on social but immediately act—prospect, publish, analyze, and automate—without adding seats or recurring contracts.2b:T563,This repository from General Legal offers a curated collection of attorney-drafted legal templates tailored for startups and technology companies. Every agreement is written by experienced General Legal attorneys and released under the **CC0 1.0 Universal license**, meaning you can use, modify, and distribute the documents without attribution or restriction.\n\nThe library includes **LLM-optimized Markdown templates** plus the original **.docx source files**, making it easy to integrate with contract automation workflows or AI drafting tools. Highlighted `\u003cmark\u003e` fields clearly indicate where founders, operators, o"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"r counsel should customize party names, commercial terms, and jurisdiction-specific language.\n\nKey templates include:\n\n- Advisor Agreement with equity compensation, IP assignment, and confidentiality provisions\n- HIPAA-compliant Business Associate Agreement for protected health information\n- U.S. and global Data Processing Addenda aligned with CCPA/CPRA, GDPR, UK GDPR, and Swiss data protection rules\n- Employment, NDA, Privacy Policy, Cookie Notice, Terms of Use, and Master Services Agreement focused on technology deployments\n\nBy centralizing startup-focused contracts in a public GitHub repository, this project helps founders and in-house teams move faster on routine legal tasks while maintaining high drafting quality and modern regulatory coverage.2c:T5e1,Voice Cursor is an AI-powered voice dictation experience that lets you write at the speed of thought across Gmail, Slack, Notion, Google Docs, and dozens of other workspaces. Instead of staring at a blank page, you speak naturally and watch your ideas appear as polished, ready-to-send text with automatic grammar fixes and filler-word removal.\n\nBeyond transcription, Voice Cursor adds an intelligent editing layer on top of your existing workflow. Highlight any text and use natural voice commands to **rewrite**, **shorten**, **expand**, **translate**, or **reformat** content without retyping. Turn messy notes into bullet points, transform paragraphs into tables, or adjust tone for different audiences directly inside tools like Notion, LinkedIn, or VS Code.\n\nKey capabilities include:\n\n- **Context-aware recognition** that adapts to your app, selected text, and domain-specific jargon\n- **Automatic formatting** for clear, professional emails, documents, and knowledge bases\n- **Tone presets per app** so work messages, DMs, and drafts match the right voice\n- **Custom dictionary entries** for names, product details, and recurring phrases\n- **Cross-device sync** for tones, preferences, and diction across macOS, Windows (waitlist), iOS, and Android\n\nWith support for 100+ l"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"anguages and instant language detection, Voice Cursor helps you speak in your language and send in theirs—streamlining communication for knowledge workers, founders, engineers, and anyone who wants faster, clearer writing.2d:T484,Zero is an open-source coding agent that lives directly in your terminal, giving you full ownership over how you write, refactor, and navigate code. Built in Go by Gitlawb, Zero connects to **any language model** and orchestrates **every development utility** you rely on, without locking you into a proprietary ecosystem.\n\nWith Zero, you can wire up your preferred LLM, customize workflows, and keep everything local-first. That means **reproducible automation**, transparent behavior, and integrations tailored to your stack instead of generic presets. Whether you’re exploring unfamiliar repositories or accelerating daily tasks, Zero stays close to your shell and version control.\n\nKey capabilities include:\n\n- **Terminal-native coding agent** that understands your project context\n- **Model-agnostic orchestration** for self-hosted or cloud LLMs\n- **Go-based architecture** designed for extensibility and performance\n- **Open-source ownership**, letting you audit, fork, and adapt the agent\n\nZero is ideal for engineers who want an AI coding companion they can actually inspect, modify, and trust—running where they already work: the command line.2e:T680,Larasend is a self-hosted transactional email system tailored for Laravel teams that want full control over their messaging infrastructure while still leveraging Amazon SES or Cloudflare Email Service. Instead of wiring every application directly to a third‑party provider, Larasend centralizes delivery logs, previews, headers, and metrics behind a clean HTTP API and a dedicated Laravel mail transport.\n\nBy running Larasend on your own infrastructure with Docker, PostgreSQL, and Redis, you keep sensitive email metadata, API keys, and webhooks within your environment. **Project‑scoped API keys** support scopes, expiration, rotation, and last"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"‑used metadata, while **workspace members and project permissions** help you manage multi‑team access. The **activity dashboard** offers status filters, grouped timelines, detailed inspectors, and one‑click resend for rapid debugging.\n\nKey capabilities include:\n\n- Amazon SES integration with verified domains, configuration sets, IAM controls, and DKIM guidance\n- Cloudflare Email Service support using a scoped API token and hourly suppression‑list synchronization\n- Delivery, bounce, complaint, open, click, and suppression event ingestion for precise monitoring\n- Source health checks, provider quota synchronization, and guardrails for complaint rates and suppressions\n\nLarasend fits naturally into modern Laravel workflows, providing a dedicated mail transport (`MAIL_MAILER=larasend`) and a straightforward `/api/emails` endpoint. This gives development teams a reliable, auditable control plane for transactional messages without sacrificing the flexibility of their existing cloud email providers.2f:T5bb,ChatCut is a browser-based AI video editor that turns plain-language prompts into polished, on-brand videos. Instead of wrestling with timelines and keyframes, you describe the edit you want — trimming talking-head footage, tightening pacing, or adding B-roll — and the agent assembles a coherent first cut that actually matches your narrative.\n\nCreators and marketers can **edit videos directly from the transcript**, cutting sentences, removing filler words, and cleaning up delivery like editing a document. ChatCut then syncs every change to the timeline, adds **auto captions in 100+ languages** with customizable styles, and keeps your content accessible across platforms.\n\nBeyond basic editing, ChatCut acts as a **motion graphics and visual generation studio**. Describe chapter cards, charts, timelines, or emphasis effects in natural language and the AI motion graphics engine builds them straight onto your sequence — no After Effects, no manual keyframing. You can also generate AI images and video B-roll from"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," prompts or reference frames to fill gaps in your footage, create cinematic thumbnails, and maintain consistent visual style.\n\nBecause the agent can understand your footage, browse your website, pull logos, and read your marketing copy, it produces videos that feel native to your brand. From YouTube explainers to social clips and product demos, ChatCut compresses the entire post-production pipeline into a single prompt-driven workflow.30:T57d,OpenWorker is a local-first AI coworker that turns your high-level requests into finished work across your everyday systems. Instead of copy-pasting between chat windows and tools, you can delegate outcomes like “prep me for this renewal call” or “untangle my Tuesday,” and OpenWorker orchestrates the steps, checks your data, and prepares polished deliverables.\n\nRunning directly on your own machine, OpenWorker connects to the accounts you already rely on—such as Slack, HubSpot, GitHub, Notion, email, and your calendar—while preserving privacy and control. You bring your own models and API keys, including closed-weight or open-weight options, so you’re never locked into a single provider.\n\n**Key capabilities include:**\n- End-to-end task execution that produces concrete artifacts like briefs, incident timelines, and sprint priorities\n- Approval checkpoints before important actions (sending emails, posting to Slack, editing calendar events)\n- Deep workflow support for sales renewals, incident triage, product planning, and schedule management\n- 100% open-source codebase with transparent behavior and extensibility\n\nBy continuously reviewing context from your files and systems, OpenWorker behaves like a dependable teammate rather than a simple chatbot. It helps teams reduce manual coordination, speed up recurring workflows, and keep humans firmly in charge of final decisions.31:T5a7,Sakana Fugu is a frontier-level multi-agent orchestration model that dynamically coordinates a pool of specialized LLMs through a single OpenAI-compatible API. Instead of hand-crafting wor"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"kflows, Fugu learns how to assemble, route, and synchronize expert agents to deliver stronger results on complex, multi-step tasks.\n\nBuilt on research from the TRINITY and Conductor ICLR 2026 papers, Fugu uses evolved coordination strategies and reinforcement learning to unlock collective intelligence across coding, reasoning, math, and knowledge-intensive workloads. **One request** automatically leverages multiple agents with roles such as Thinker, Worker, and Verifier to improve reliability and depth of answers.\n\nWith Fugu, engineering and data teams can streamline integration while maintaining strict governance. You can **control which underlying models participate**, opt out of specific providers to satisfy privacy or compliance requirements, and optimize cost-performance without managing multiple APIs. Fugu and Fugu Ultra variants give you flexible performance tiers for quality-critical workflows.\n\nUse Sakana Fugu to embed multi-agent intelligence directly into product features, internal tools, and automated pipelines. From robust code generation and refactoring to advanced analytical reasoning, Fugu provides a single, research-driven interface to orchestrated LLM ecosystems that outperform individual models on challenging benchmarks.32:T5d0,Agent-Native is an open-source framework for building **agent-native applications** where AI agents and user interfaces share a single SQL-backed state. Instead of wiring separate bots, APIs, and frontends, you define reusable actions once and invoke them from chat, HTTP endpoints, MCP integrations, A2A flows, and CLI commands. This creates a unified app–agent loop that keeps humans, agents, and sessions perfectly in sync.\n\nEngineers can bring their own database, hosting, and model stack while relying on Agent-Native for identity, observability, tools, skills, and shared actions. Start with a chat-first scaffold, then layer on screens, jobs, and workflows as your agent grows into a full product. Prebuilt templates like Clips, Plans, Design, Content, Slides, and Analyti"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cs let you fork production-grade experiences that replace or augment tools such as Loom, Notion, design prototyping suites, slide creators, and product analytics suites.\n\nWith Agent-Native you can:\n\n- **Define actions once** and reuse them across agent, UI, API, and coding assistants\n- **Persist shared state in SQL** so agents can read and update any view or dataset\n- **Install skills into coding agents** like Claude Code, Cursor, or VS Code for visual planning and PR recaps\n- **Run locally and customize** fully open-source templates tailored for content, analytics, design, and more\n\nAgent-Native turns experimental agents into maintainable, product-grade systems that evolve alongside your codebase.33:T5f7,Zaro is an AI-native workspace that turns your company’s existing knowledge into living intelligence. Instead of locking data into yet another vendor silo, Zaro connects your documents, calls, tickets, and decisions into a single, versioned workspace that your team fully controls. Every interaction adds context, so your systems become smarter over time rather than starting from zero.\n\nDescribe what you need in plain language and Zaro generates custom agents, dashboards, and internal workflows directly from your own data. Sales can spin up a pipeline tracker from deal notes and call transcripts, operations can orchestrate facilities hubs and maintenance schedules, and HR can centralize onboarding, time off, and headcount in one connected view. Each workspace is siloed by company, team, or use case to keep permissions and governance tight.\n\nWith Zaro, **agents, data, and internal apps share memory**, so insights compound across use cases instead of fragmenting across tools. Runs from any model or framework read from your workspace, write back outcomes, and continuously refine your institutional knowledge. This creates a self-improving environment where:\n\n- **Context is captured once and reused everywhere** across teams\n- **Agents execute recurring work** and log results into the same workspace\n- **Generated apps"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," stay in sync** with real-time company data\n\nZaro lets you build intelligence for your company, not for a vendor, giving you durable ownership of the data and workflows that power your business.34:T598,Simile is an AI-driven simulation environment for predicting human behavior across customers, employees, and broad populations. Built on pioneering research in generative agents and rich agentic simulations, Simile lets organizations explore how people respond to new products, experiences, or policies **before** launching in the real world. This means faster learning cycles, fewer costly missteps, and decisions grounded in empirically validated behavioral data.\n\nTeams use Simile to run enterprise-grade simulation workflows that mirror real-world sentiment at scale. By modeling segments anchored in Gallup’s nationally representative panel, Simile delivers transparent, replicable insights that go far beyond traditional surveys or focus groups. You can:\n\n- **Find hard-to-reach audiences** and understand niche populations in detail\n- **De-risk major initiatives** by stress-testing concepts in simulated environments\n- **Segment sentiment with precision** and uncover behavioral drivers across cohorts\n- **Validate designs and messaging** based on realistic, dynamic responses\n\nSimile is trusted by leaders at CVS Health, Wealthfront, Banco Itaú, and global consumer brands to accelerate product development and customer research. Instead of “failing fast” in front of real customers, teams can safely experiment, iterate, and refine in simulation until they are confident their decisions will resonate in the market.35:T5a3,murmr is an on-device voice-to-text system for macOS and iOS that turns your natural speech into clean, polished writing without sending audio to the cloud. Powered by NVIDIA Parakeet, it strips filler, fixes punctuation, and adapts tone to match the app you’re using, so dictated text reads like you actually typed it. Your recordings and transcripts stay on your Mac or iPhone, preserving privacy for n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"otes, emails, and meeting follow-ups.\n\nOn Mac, murmr lives in the menu bar and activates with a simple key hold, dropping refined text directly at your cursor or ready to paste from the clipboard. On iPhone, a dedicated keyboard integrates with your favorite apps: tap the mic, speak, swipe back, and insert the cleaned transcript in a single tap. **No accounts, uploads, or per-word billing — just fast, local processing.**\n\nmurmr Pro unlocks a full voice workspace: searchable dictation history, word counts, streak tracking, meetings capture, listening modes, assistant-style actions, custom dictionary entries, snippets, and style transforms — all processed locally. You can even have long documents read back to you using high-quality on-device voices.\n\nWith murmr, you get:\n\n- **100% on-device transcription** for Mac and iPhone\n- **Filler removal and punctuation repair** for readable output\n- **Tone-matched text** tailored to each target app\n- **Unified voice hub** for dictation, listening, and insights on a single machine36:T5db,Greenlight is an open-source pre-submission compliance scanner designed specifically for Apple App Store review readiness. It analyzes your iOS project locally in under a second, scanning source code, privacy manifests, IPA binaries, and App Store Connect metadata against Apple’s official Review Guidelines to surface likely rejection risks before you submit.\n\nDevelopers can run a single `greenlight preflight` command to trigger parallel scanners that check for guideline violations such as private API usage, hardcoded secrets, missing App Tracking Transparency, and incorrect metadata. **Everything runs fully offline with no account required**, making it safe for sensitive codebases and ideal for automated pipelines.\n\nKey capabilities include:\n- **Static codescan** for Swift, Objective-C, React Native, and Expo projects\n- **Privacy manifest validation** including Required Reason APIs and tracking SDK alignment\n- **IPA binary inspection** for Info.plist keys, launch storyboard, icons, and "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"bundle details\n- **Metadata checks** for bundle identifiers, purpose strings, privacy policy URLs, and more\n\nFor flow-dependent rules like account deletion, restore purchases, and Sign in with Apple behavior, Greenlight offers an optional `greenlight verify` runtime tier via Revyl, running tests on real cloud devices. This opt-in layer stays separate from the static scanner, letting teams combine fast local checks with deeper runtime verification as part of their continuous delivery process.37:T63e,June is a privacy-first AI workspace for Mac that keeps your conversations, documents, and meeting notes local on your desktop instead of sending them to third-party servers. It combines a powerful private GLM, voice dictation, and automated meeting summaries so you can think, plan, and write with AI while maintaining strict control over sensitive information like finances, health details, and legal documents.\n\nWith June, you can securely compare W‑2s, paystubs, and mortgage paperwork, extract vendor renewal dates from PDFs, or pull invoice totals from bank statements without exposing raw files to external providers. **All prompts, files, and workflows stay on your Mac**, backed by open-source, local-first architecture and privacy-preserving AI routing.\n\nKey capabilities include:\n\n- **Private desktop agent** that reads local folders, calendars, and documents to automate tasks such as expense breakdowns or contract term extraction\n- **Voice dictation for Mac** that turns spoken thoughts into polished writing in any application via a keyboard shortcut\n- **Automated meeting notes** that detect supported calls and generate structured recaps, decisions, and action items without intrusive meeting bots\n- **Context-aware workflows** for drafting medical messages, revising performance reviews, and preparing board or client summaries while keeping data compartmentalized\n\nJune is built for people who handle highly sensitive work—founders, operators, lawyers, finance leads, and clinicians—who need AI assistance without turni"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ng their laptop into a data feed for remote providers.38:T894,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"EchoTik.live is a TikTok analytics tool and data platform. Your Data-Driven TikTok E-Commerce Expert. Empowering sellers and EC-creators with data-driven insights for product selection, influencer identification, live stream and video optimization, and more. Our mission is \"Discover TikTok e-commerce data with EchoTik\". We help creators and brands find the best content, track target TikTok creators \u0026 videos, and compare them insightfully. We also help sellers explore potential hot products and make decisions on product selection in TikTok. EchoTik.live is a data assistant for TikTok, dedicated to helping sellers and short video creators discover hot topics, analyze the composition of goods/videos/live broadcasts, and provide data insights for your decision-making. It aims to analyze data on TikTok such as popular products, videos, and live streams to help sellers and content creators make better decisions. By gaining insights from the analytics of viral content on TikTok, EchoTik.live assists users in discovering trending topics and understanding what resonates with the TikTok audience. \nFeatures\nChoose Sales Goods: Insight into billion-level market data, Accurately locate the trend.\nFind Influencer: Direct to top influencer. Build brand growth fast lane.\nCheck Competitor: Monitor market/competitor. Improve market competitiveness.\nScreen Live: Analyze live broadcast ecosystem data. View high GMV live broadcasts.\nData API\nProfessional API platform built on EchoTik's data infrastructure, covering all platform data and TikTok real-time endpoints.\nReal-time + Historical Data\nPowered by EchoTik, stream real-time data alongside massive historical archives — track trends up to 1,000 days back for richer analytics, model training, and market intelligence.\nFull Data Coverage\nComprehensive coverage across every dimension of the TikTok e-commerce ecosystem.\nReady to Use\nComplete developer docs and code examples included. No complex setup required — follow the guide and make your first API call in minutes.\nFast Response\nHigh-performance backend with powerful concurrent request handling. Low-latency responses keep your workflows smooth and uninterrupted at any scale."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"39:T624,This web-based generation platform gives creators flexible access to the complete Seedance model ecosystem, spanning Seedance 1.5, Seedance 2.0 Mini, and the flagship Seedance 2.5. Designed for scalable visual production, the service allows users to generate tailored video content based on required speed, scene complexity, and rendering resolution.\n\nArriving in late July as a major upgrade over Seedance 2.0, Seedance 2.5 significantly elevates AI video production standards. The flagship model supports continuous 30-second video generation alongside 4K resolution output, delivering unprecedented visual clarity, temporal consistency, and detailed rendering. To maximize creative control, Seedance 2.5 incorporates multi-modal media input processing. Creators can combine text prompts with multiple reference images, video clips, and audio files to direct subtle character performance, complex camera movements, and scene narrative flow.\n\nThe platform supports both text-to-video and image-to-video creation across diverse commercial and artistic applications—including commercial product ads, high-engagement social videos, cinematic storyboarding, and concept design. Visitors can test prompt structures, evaluate real Seedance 2.5 sample videos and demo examples, and compare performance directly against earlier model iterations. Whether you are benchmarking Seedance 2.5 prompts, reviewing visual motion fidelity, or monitoring official release-date and availability updates, this service provides an end-to-end workflow for high-definition AI video synthesis.3a:T40b,My Recomy turns word-of-mouth into income. You recommend a place you trust, someone books through your link and spends there, and you get paid. When that same customer comes back, you get paid again — the model rewards retention, not just the first visit.\n\nBusinesses gain a performance-based acquisition channel: they pay a commission only on real, validated consumption, decide the commission they offer, and can start on a free plan. From one panel they m"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"anage collaborations with ambassadors, traceable bookings, challenges with rewards, their own loyalty program, invoicing, daily closings, team access and reports.\n\nAmbassadors work from their phone: they choose the businesses they trust, share their link or QR, track every booking and commission in real time, and get paid automatically every week through Stripe Connect.\n\nCustomers book through someone they trust, can pay from the app — including splitting the bill — and earn loyalty points redeemable at each business.\n\nOperating across Europe and the United States.3d:[]\n3e:[]\n3c:{\"created_at\":\"2025-11-06T13:24:25.88387+00:00\",\"id\":13069,\"codename\":\"AI Video Generator\",\"slug\":\"saas-568c5d\",\"problem_label\":\"AI Video Generator for Text to Video and Image to Video\",\"solution_label\":\"Create cinematic AI videos from a prompt or animate still images into motion. GenVideo helps creators make social clips, product videos, ad creatives, and story-driven visuals in minutes.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/saas-568c5d/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3e\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"idea\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n40:[\"feature voting\",\"customer feedback\",\"product validation\",\"feature requests\",\"user voting\",\"product management\",\"customer insights\",\"feature prioritization\",\"product decisions\",\"user feedback\",\"product development\",\"customer validation\",\"feature ideas\",\"email voting\",\"product roadmap\"]\n41:[]\n3f:{\"created_at\":\"2025-11-14T13:34:20.401276+00:00\",\"id\":13278,\"codename\":\"FeatureVoice\",\"slug\":\"featurevoice\",\"problem_label\":\"Fastest way to validate product features with customers\",\"solution_label\":\"Validate product ideas with customer voting. Get instant feedback on feature idea from your users through one-click email-based voting. Make data-driven product decisions with real customer insights in hours, not weeks.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/featurevoice/logo_q100-128px.we"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"bp\",\"niche_kws\":\"$40\",\"icp_kws\":\"$41\",\"market\":\"brainstorming-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n43:[]\n44:[]\n42:{\"created_at\":\"2026-02-18T11:25:14.911756+00:00\",\"id\":14539,\"codename\":\"Nano Banana Pro\",\"slug\":\"nanobananapro-7dc0e1\",\"problem_label\":\"Stunning Visuals Nano Banana Pro\",\"solution_label\":\"Nano Banana Pro is an innovative AI tool designed for creating stunning 3D caricature portraits in a captivating Pixar style. Its advanced technology allows users to transform photos into eye-catching digital art with ease. Whether you're looking to enhance your personal projects or create unique gifts, Nano Banana Pro delivers high-quality, customizable results. Perfect for artists, designers, or anyone who loves creative expression, this tool combines simplicity and sophistication to bring your artistic visions to life. Elevate your digital art game with Nano Banana Pro and impress your audience with vibrant and playful designs.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/nanobananapro-7dc0e1/image.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$43\",\"icp_kws\":\"$44\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n46:[\"real-time voice translation; speech-to-speech AI; live translation; voice changer; voice cloning; AI voice; multiple voices; personas; multilingual communication; plug‑and‑play; low latency; gaming‑friendly; works with your tools; streaming tool; gaming tool\"]\n47:[]\n45:{\"created_at\":\"2026-03-27T14:08:54.057438+00:00\",\"id\":15240,\"codename\":\"HaloVoice\",\"slug\":\"halovoice\",\"problem_label\":\"Real‑time voice translation for streaming, gaming, and meetings\",\"solution_label\":\"HaloVoice is an AI-powered real-time voice translator for gaming, streaming, meetings, and multilingual voice chat. It provides live voice translation and real-time speech translation across apps like Discord, OBS, Zoom, Slack, and Teams, making it easy to communica"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"te across languages in real time.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/halovoice/74ca5e63-35b6-4bbe-a262-0128d07d59a9.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$46\",\"icp_kws\":\"$47\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n49:[\"Agents\",\"AI\",\"Personal AI\",\"Productivity\",\"Artificial Intelligence\"]\n4a:[]\n48:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-07T07:11:12.506748+00:00\",\"id\":16099,\"codename\":\"ASI:One\",\"slug\":\"asione\",\"problem_label\":\"A personal AI with memory that plans and acts for you\",\"solution_label\":\"ASI:One is a personal AI that remembers your preferences, collaborates with others’ AIs, and executes tasks. Plan nights out, align groups, and book the details automatically. It is connected to millions of agents through Agentverse, giving you on-demand capabilities for research, planning, and real-world tasks.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/asione/asi-one-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$49\",\"icp_kws\":\"$4a\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n4c:[\"ai\",\"audit\",\"ai-readiness\",\"seo\",\"seo audio\"]\n4d:[]\n4b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-11T09:30:42.696255+00:00\",\"id\":16177,\"codename\":\"Repolog\",\"slug\":\"repolog\",\"problem_label\":\"Website audit for SEO, performance, security \u0026 AI Readiness\",\"solution_label\":\"Repolog is a website audit built for how the web works in 2026.\\n\\nSEO score - meta tags, structured data, crawlability, internal linking\\nPerformance score - Core Web Vitals, render-blocking resources, real-world load behavior\\nAI Readiness score - how easily LLMs can parse, cite, and recommend your content\\nEvery issue comes with a plain-English explanation and a concrete fix.\\n\\nWho it's for:\\nIndie hackers, founders, and small teams who don't have an SEO agency on retainer.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/repolog/repolog.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$4c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$4d\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"produ"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ct_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n4f:[\"HIPAA\",\"HIPAA Compliance\",\"HIPAA Training\",\"HIPAA Risk Assessment\",\"CISA KEV\",\"Network Security Assessment\"]\n50:[]\n4e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-13T19:55:01.218008+00:00\",\"id\":16244,\"codename\":\"HIPAA Security Suite®\",\"slug\":\"hipaasecuritysuite\",\"problem_label\":\"Your Key to HIPAA Compliance®\",\"solution_label\":\"HIPAA Security Suite is an all-in-one HIPAA compliance software platform that helps healthcare organizations simplify risk assessments, employee training, policy management, documentation, remediation, and audit readiness. Built for medical practices, business associates, and healthcare service providers, it gives teams the tools they need to manage HIPAA requirements in one organized, easy-to-use system.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/hipaasecuritysuite/HSS_logo_115px.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$4f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$50\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n52:[]\n53:[]\n51:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-20T19:22:02.236352+00:00\",\"id\":16383,\"codename\":\"Aeterna\",\"slug\":\"aeterna\",\"problem_label\":\"Create an interactive AI digital twin to preserve your family's legacy.\",\"solution_label\":\"Aeterna is a secure digital vault that turns your life stories, photos, and voice notes into an interactive AI Digital Twin. Don't just leave behind a static box of photos—give future generations the ability to converse with your memories forever.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n\\n🎙️ AI Biographer: Effortless weekly storytelling prompts.\\n\\n🧠 Zero-Hallucination RAG: Stays 100% true to your actual words.\\n\\n🔒 Bank-Grade Privacy: AES-256 encrypted, never sold.\\n\\n📦 Media Vault: Add photos and letters for context.\\n\\nFree Account!\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aeterna/d6db9e0c-712c-4081-b507-13cfcad21caf__1_-removebg-preview.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$52\",\"icp_kws\":\"$53"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n55:[\"developer-tools\",\"ai-coding\",\"education\",\"online-course\",\"programming\",\"productivity\",\"rust\",\"typescript\"]\n56:[]\n54:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-26T14:34:55.942647+00:00\",\"id\":16483,\"codename\":\"CompoundCoders\",\"slug\":\"compoundcoders\",\"problem_label\":\"Engineer your AI workflow. Ship better code.\",\"solution_label\":\"Learn how to build production software with AI — not just demos. Courses, community, and reusable workflows for engineers shipping real systems.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/compoundcoders/logo-mark-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$55\",\"icp_kws\":\"$56\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Info product, Newsletters, Communities\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n58:[\"language\",\"language learning\",\"netflix\",\"youtube\",\"SRS\",\"anki\"]\n59:[]\n57:{\"created_at\":\