LMS\",\"solution_label\":\"The world's easiest way to create and deliver engaging online training courses.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/courseboxai/white-logomark-coursebox-gradient-background-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$5e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$5f\",\"market\":\"edtech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n61:[\"QR Code Generator\",\"Dynamic QR Codes\",\"Custom QR Codes\",\"Marketing Tool\",\"Lead Generation\",\"Google Reviews\",\"Restaurant Menu\",\"Business Page\",\"vCard QR Code\",\"Social Media Links\"]\n62:[]\n60:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-30T20:49:46.248483+00:00\",\"id\":16565,\"codename\":\"IMQRSCAN\",\"slug\":\"imqrscan\",\"problem_label\":\"Affordable branded QR codes with tracking\",\"solution_label\":\"IMQRScan is an affordable QR code generator for creating branded, editable, and trackable QR codes. Businesses can generate QR codes for URLs, menus, Google reviews, WiFi, vCards, business pages, social media links, WhatsApp, files, landing pages, and lead generation. Add your logo, customize colors, download in multiple formats, and track scan performance. Plans start from only $3/month.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/imqrscan/imqrscan-qr-code-generator-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$61\",\"icp_kws\":\"$62\",\"market"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n64:[\"landing page audit\",\"CRO\",\"conversion optimization\",\"SEO audit\",\"website audit\",\"SaaS\",\"indie hackers\",\"growth marketing\",\"copywriting\",\"pricing\",\"accessibility\",\"startup tools\",\"marketing tools\"]\n65:[]\n63:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-30T22:31:17.071179+00:00\",\"id\":16567,\"codename\":\"Improve My Page\",\"slug\":\"improvemypage\",\"problem_label\":\"Find what blocks your landing page from converting.\",\"solution_label\":\"Improve My Page turns any SaaS landing-page URL into a prioritized audit report. It checks conversion structure, copy, pricing clarity, SEO, speed, accessibility, security, trust signals, links, and images, then shows what to fix first. Founders, marketers, creators, and agencies can start with a free limited audit, unlock one full report, or use a monthly plan for repeated page reviews.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/improvemypage/improve-my-page-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$64\",\"icp_kws\":\"$65\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n67:[\"Options\",\"Wheel\",\"Stocks\"]\n68:[]\n66:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-31T04:37:52.841313+00:00\",\"id\":16571,\"codename\":\"ThetaRank\",\"slug\":\"thetarank\",\"problem_label\":\"Compare stock option outcomes before you place the trad\",\"solution_label\":\"Instantly see returns, assignment scenarios, premium collected, annualized yield, and S\u0026P outperformance for every call, put, and roll opportunity.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/thetarank/thetarank-logo-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$67\",\"icp_kws\":\"$68\",\"market\":\"fintech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n6a:[\"SaaS Backend\",\"Authentication\",\"Payments\",\"Billing\",\"Subscriptions\",\"Customer Management\",\"Entitlements\",\"Checkout\",\"Merchant of Record\",\"Developer Tools\",\"SaaS Infrastructur"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"e\",\"Digital Products\"]\n6b:[]\n69:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-31T20:32:00.024972+00:00\",\"id\":16580,\"codename\":\"tiun\",\"slug\":\"tiun-66bd87\",\"problem_label\":\"Stripe for indie hackers: auth, payments, DB in 4 lines\",\"solution_label\":\"tiun lets indie hackers launch digital products with authentication, payments, and a database in one system from day one. We built Stripe for Indie Hackers, so instead of stitching together separate tools and maintaining fragile webhook logic, you can integrate with a single command and let the AI Agent do the work for you. tiun keeps billing, access, and customer data in sync automatically, helping developers ship faster and spend less time on setting up their backend. We’re currently accepting only 100 early-adopter developers to use tiun for free. Sign up for access.\\n\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tiun-66bd87/tiun0773b495-af19-4f36-a047-665ec262bf2b-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$6a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$6b\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n6d:[\"trading\",\"trading-journal\",\"forex\",\"mt4\",\"mt5\",\"ai\",\"analytics\",\"fintech\",\"saas\",\"performance-tracking\"]\n6e:[]\n6c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-05-31T22:14:51.991168+00:00\",\"id\":16581,\"codename\":\"tradingjournal\",\"slug\":\"tradingjournal\",\"problem_label\":\"AI coaching for MT4/MT5 traders.\",\"solution_label\":\"TradingJournal helps MT4/MT5 traders import or sync trades, track performance, and improve discipline with structured journaling and AI coaching. Traders can review setups, rules, checklists, daily journals, performance analytics, and the trades that deserve a second look. The free plan includes a complete journal, analytics, Review Queue, What-If preview, and weekly performance emails. Pro adds broker sync, weekly AI reviews, daily recaps, Deep Analysis, and focused What-If reports.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tradingjournal/TJ-logo.avif\",\"niche_kws\":\"$6d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$6e\",\"market\":\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n70:[\"SEO\",\"SEO Audit\",\"Technical SEO\",\"Marketing\",\"AI\",\"Developer Tools\",\"SaaS\",\"Web Performance\",\"MCP\",\"Agency Tools\"]\n71:[]\n6f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T06:46:18.613838+00:00\",\"id\":16584,\"codename\":\"CrawlRaven\",\"slug\":\"crawlraven\",\"problem_label\":\"Crawl deep. Fix what matters. Rank higher.\",\"solution_label\":\"CrawlRaven is a professional SEO audit platform: crawl deep, fix what matters, rank higher. We crawl up to 50,000 pages and run 200+ checks across technical SEO, Core Web Vitals, structured data, links, and security — then rank every issue by ranking impact, so you know what to fix first. Agencies get white-label reports, scheduled audits, and team collaboration built in. And our MCP server plugs CrawlRaven into Claude: audit, pull the prioritized fixes, fix them with AI, and re-audit — in one loop.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/crawlraven/crawlraven-favicon-transparent-bg-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$70\",\"icp_kws\":\"$71\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n73:[\"E-commerce\",\"AI Video Generation\",\"TikTok\",\"Viral Content\"]\n74:[]\n72:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T08:49:59.231745+00:00\",\"id\":16590,\"codename\":\"CreatOK\",\"slug\":\"creatok\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn one winning video into hundreds\",\"solution_label\":\"CreatOK is an AI TikTok e-commerce video generator based on Soar, Wan, Seedance, VEO, Nano Banana Pro, Kling and so on. \",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/creatok/20260304-150210Tu-Biao-logo.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$73\",\"icp_kws\":\"$74\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n76:T894,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"EchoTik.live is a TikTok analytics tool and data platform. Your Data-Driven TikTok E-Commerce Expert. Empowering sellers and EC-creators with data-driven insights for product selection, influencer identification, live stream and video optimization, and more. Our mission is \"Discover TikTok e-commerce data with EchoTik\". We help creators and brands find the best content, track target TikTok creators \u0026 videos, and compare them insightfully. We also help sellers explore potential hot products and make decisions on product selection in TikTok. EchoTik.live is a data assistant for TikTok, dedicated to helping sellers and short video creators discover hot topics, analyze the composition of goods/videos/live broadcasts, and provide data insights for your decision-making. It aims to analyze data on TikTok such as popular products, videos, and live streams to help sellers and content creators make better decisions. By gaining insights from the analytics of viral content on TikTok, EchoTik.live assists users in discovering trending topics and understanding what resonates with the TikTok audience. \nFeatures\nChoose Sales Goods: Insight into billion-level market data, Accurately locate the trend.\nFind Influencer: Direct to top influencer. Build brand growth fast lane.\nCheck Competitor: Monitor market/competitor. Improve market competitiveness.\nScreen Live: Analyze live broadcast ecosystem data. View high GMV live broadcasts.\nData API\nProfessional API platform built on EchoTik's data infrastructure, covering all platform data and TikTok real-time endpoints.\nReal-time + Historical Data\nPowered by EchoTik, stream real-time data alongside massive historical archives — track trends up to 1,000 days back for richer analytics, model training, and market intelligence.\nFull Data Coverage\nComprehensive coverage across every dimension of the TikTok e-commerce ecosystem.\nReady to Use\nComplete developer docs and code examples included. No complex setup required — follow the guide and make your first API call in minutes.\nFast Response\nHigh-performance backend with powerful concurrent request handling. Low-latency responses keep your workflows smooth and uninterrupted at any scale."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"77:[\"TikTok analytics\",\"Infulencer\",\"Seller\"]\n78:[]\n75:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T09:10:08.6082+00:00\",\"id\":16592,\"codename\":\"EchoTik\",\"slug\":\"echotik\",\"problem_label\":\"YourData-DrivenTikTok E-Commerce Expert\",\"solution_label\":\"$76\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/echotik/Tu-Xiang-2026-5-14-18.35.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$77\",\"icp_kws\":\"$78\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n7a:[\"AI Agent\",\"next-generation automation\",\"LLM pipelines\"]\n7b:[]\n79:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T09:23:51.760359+00:00\",\"id\":16594,\"codename\":\"Keyapi\",\"slug\":\"keyapi\",\"problem_label\":\"One API Key. Unlimited Social Intelligence.\",\"solution_label\":\"Keyapi.ai: The Ultimate \\\"Moat\\\" Against AI Homogenization\\nThe biggest risk in 2026 is that your AI-generated content looks exactly like your competitor's AI-generated content. Standard TikTok data analytics tools scrape the same public data. The only way to win is by injecting Private Data into your models. This is where Keyapi.ai becomes your secret weapon.\\nHow it builds your competitive advantage:\\n1. Omnichannel Aggregation: Keyapi seamlessly pulls your proprietary data from TikTok, Amazon, Instagram, YouTube, and Shopify via a single, unified API.\\n2. Direct-to-AI Integration (MCP Protocol): It is designed to feed your specific brand context, customer CRM data, and past campaign performance directly into your AI generators.\\n3. The Anti-Commodity Engine: By grounding platforms like CreatOK in your private data, the content generated is 100% unique. It speaks directly to your audience’s distinct aesthetic preferences and buying habits, making it impossible for lazy competitors to clone.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/keyapi/Tu-Xiang-2026-6-1-16.17.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$7a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$7b\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n7d:[\"dynamic qr c"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"odes\",\"qr code generator\",\"editable qr codes\",\"scan analytics\",\"offline marketing\",\"no-code\",\"small business\"]\n7e:[]\n7c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T10:14:16.356016+00:00\",\"id\":16595,\"codename\":\"QRLagoon\",\"slug\":\"qrlagoon\",\"problem_label\":\"Editable QR codes for trackable offline marketing.\",\"solution_label\":\"QRLagoon helps restaurants, small businesses, marketers, creators, and agencies create dynamic QR codes for menus, flyers, posters, business cards, packaging, events, and campaigns. Unlike static QR codes, they can be edited after printing, so you can update destination links without replacing materials. The platform also provides privacy-friendly scan analytics by city and device type, helping you understand performance and turn QR codes into reusable marketing assets across offline channels.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/qrlagoon/qrlagoon_logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$7d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$7e\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n80:[\"AI\",\"Fundraising\",\"Startups\",\"Pitch Deck\",\"Investors\",\"Venture Capital\",\"Founders\",\"SaaS\",\"Productivity\",\"Angel Investors\"]\n81:[]\n7f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T20:10:33.817949+00:00\",\"id\":16601,\"codename\":\"Evalyze\",\"slug\":\"evalyze\",\"problem_label\":\"AI fundraising platform for founders\",\"solution_label\":\"Most founders raise blind. You send your deck out, hear nothing, and never find out what went wrong. Evalyze gives you the investor's view before you hit send. Upload your deck, get a VC-grade score in about a minute, and see the exact gaps a real investor would flag. Then match with the right people from 10,000+ verified investors. Built by an ex-VC, trained on 8,000+ funded raises.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/evalyze/128logo-color.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$80\",\"icp_kws\":\"$81\",\"market\":\"fintech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n83:[\"AI image gen"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"erator\",\"AI 3D model generator\",\"AI video generator\",\"Voice cloning\",\"AI tools for game developers\",\"Content creator tools\",\"Sprite sheet generator\",\"LoRA training\",\"All-in-one AI platform\",\"Subscription SaaS\"]\n84:[]\n82:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T21:53:51.867987+00:00\",\"id\":16602,\"codename\":\"Voxel Studio \",\"slug\":\"voxelstudiollc\",\"problem_label\":\"Every AI creator tool, one subscription, one login\",\"solution_label\":\"Voxel Studio is the all-in-one AI platform for indie game developers, streamers, and content creators. Image generation across 14+ models, image-to-3D meshes for Unity/Unreal/Godot, image-to-video, voice cloning, music + SFX, custom LoRA training, sprite sheet packing, and a full paint editor — under one subscription instead of stacking five. Outputs are commercially yours on every plan. 200 free credits at signup, no card required.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/voxelstudiollc/voxel-icon-static.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$83\",\"icp_kws\":\"$84\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n86:[\"ai\",\"bookmarks\",\"knowledge management\",\"second brain\",\"save links\",\"research\",\"notes\",\"productivity\",\"chrome extension\",\"memory\"]\n87:[]\n85:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-02T15:44:26.84566+00:00\",\"id\":16612,\"codename\":\"dEssence\",\"slug\":\"dessence\",\"problem_label\":\"Save it once. Just ask later.\",\"solution_label\":\"dEssence is an AI memory for everything you save. Save links, articles, and videos from the web, Telegram, or the Chrome extension, and it all lands in one library. Later you just ask in your own words, like \\\"that sleep article I saved\\\" or \\\"what can I cook tonight from my recipes.\\\" dEssence answers from your own saved material and shows the original sources behind every answer. Group saves into boards. Free during beta.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/dessence/IMG_0442.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$86\",\"icp_kws\":\"$87\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assis"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"tant\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n89:[\"launch-platform\",\"product-launch\",\"indie-hackers\",\"saas\",\"directory\",\"seo\",\"backlinks\",\"marketing\",\"affiliate-program\",\"maker-tools\"]\n8a:[]\n88:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-03T00:47:38.386289+00:00\",\"id\":16621,\"codename\":\"FireLaunch\",\"slug\":\"firelaunch\",\"problem_label\":\"The indie market place for more than just launch day. \",\"solution_label\":\"Launch board for indie makers. Free tier gets a real dedicated page with dofollow backlinks. Earn Spark from votes, clicks, dwell time. Hit 250 in week one and your listing stays in The Forge forever. One-time pricing, 50% lifetime affiliate commission.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/firelaunch/icon-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$89\",\"icp_kws\":\"$8a\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first