:\"Most AI agents are one-off scripts. No identity. No version history. No governance. They work in a demo, then break in production. Every team rebuilds the same plumbing from scratch. Nothing reusable. Nothing composable.\\n\\nPhinite fixes this. One platform to design agents, evaluate behavior, deploy anywhere, observe every run, and govern every action. Agents as durable, reusable units of intelligence. Not disposable code.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/phiniteai/Full-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$c8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$c9\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\ncb:[\"Email\",\"Onboarding\",\"Retention\"]\ncc:[]\nca:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T17:02:36.681317+00:00\",\"id\":16789,\"codename\":\"DigiStorms\",\"slug\":\"digistorms\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn free users into paying customers, on autopilot.\",\"solution_label\":\"DigiStorms is an AI onboarding agent that turns SaaS signups into paying customers — automatically. It watches how users behave in your product and sends the right email at the right moment, instead of blasting time-based sequences.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/digistorms/Stormi.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$cb\",\"icp_kws\":\"$cc\",\"market\":\"crm\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":f"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"alse}\nce:[\"screenshots\",\"visual testing\",\"website monitoring\",\"PDF export\",\"Markdown export\",\"Playwright\",\"no-code testing\",\"browser automation\",\"SaaS\",\"developer tools\"]\ncf:[]\ncd:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T17:21:33.428496+00:00\",\"id\":16790,\"codename\":\"RenderLog\",\"slug\":\"renderlog\",\"problem_label\":\"Capture, test and export web pages\",\"solution_label\":\"RenderLog helps teams run browser jobs without maintaining Playwright infrastructure. Capture screenshots, export pages to PDF, Markdown or HTML, run no-code checks for pricing, signup, docs and UI flows and keep outputs, assertions, baselines, history and alerts in one workspace.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/renderlog/web-app-manifest-192x192.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$ce\",\"icp_kws\":\"$cf\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nd1:[\"Agents\",\"Agents.md\",\"Preferences\",\"Markdown\",\"md\",\"Free\"]\nd2:[]\nd0:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T17:34:45.338897+00:00\",\"id\":16791,\"codename\":\"Agentsmd.me\",\"slug\":\"agentsmdme\",\"problem_label\":\"Stop re-explaining yourself to AI\",\"solution_label\":\"Generate a private AGENTS.md file that captures your preferences, taste, habits, and working style, so AI tools give you better recommendations and more consistent answers without re-explaining yourself every time\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/agentsmdme/download.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$d1\",\"icp_kws\":\"$d2\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Desktop App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nd4:[\"google reviews\",\"local seo\",\"review management\",\"small business\",\"free tool\"]\nd5:[]\nd3:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-13T07:53:40.227377+00:00\",\"id\":16802,\"codename\":\"GoogleReviewBoost\",\"slug\":\"googlereviewboost\",\"problem_label\":\"Free Google review link generator for local businesses\",\"solution_label\":\"GoogleReviewBoost lets local businesses generate a direct Google review link in seconds — no signu"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"p or account needed. Share the link via email, SMS, or print it as a QR code to make it easy for customers to leave a review. The tool also offers premium review packages for businesses looking to grow their Google rating faster. Built for small business owners who want more Google reviews without complex software.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/googlereviewboost/ReviewBoost-logo-no-bg-1500-x-1500-px-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$d4\",\"icp_kws\":\"$d5\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nd7:[\"ai image generation\",\"ai images\"]\nd8:[]\nd6:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-13T08:24:08.793257+00:00\",\"id\":16805,\"codename\":\"MyRaxAi\",\"slug\":\"myraxai\",\"problem_label\":\"Professional AI images in seconds\",\"solution_label\":\"MyraxAI empowers creators and businesses to generate stunning AI-powered images from simple text descriptions. Produce custom visuals, creative artwork, branding materials, and digital content quickly and efficiently without requiring graphic design expertise.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/myraxai/Screenshot-2026-06-13-at-10.52.35.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$d7\",\"icp_kws\":\"$d8\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nda:[\"coffee · cafe discovery · independent coffee · travel · coffee shops · remote work · digital nomad · city guide · specialty coffee · work-friendly cafes\"]\ndb:[]\nd9:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-14T01:00:26.335266+00:00\",\"id\":16816,\"codename\":\"Cafe Cartographer\",\"slug\":\"cafecartographer\",\"problem_label\":\"Find the indie café that matches your vibe\",\"solution_label\":\"Maps gives you the popular café. Not the right one.\\nCafé Cartographer finds the independent spot that fits how you want to work or hang that day — quiet with outlets, or loud and social — and shows you the details before you walk in. Even the places other apps miss.\\nTwenty seconds i"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"nstead of twenty minutes. I built it for my own travel; now I open it every morning. iOS with Web coming soon.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/cafecartographer/EB_wave.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$da\",\"icp_kws\":\"$db\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\ndd:[\"AI 3D Generator\",\"Image to 3D\",\"3D Model Generator\",\"3D Printing\",\"Game Assets\",\"AR\",\"Blender\",\"Unity\",\"Product Visualization\",\"No-code 3D\"]\nde:[]\ndc:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-15T13:18:51.700919+00:00\",\"id\":16849,\"codename\":\"Modelfy 3D\",\"slug\":\"modelfy3d\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn images into 3D models instantly\",\"solution_label\":\"Modelfy 3D (https://modelfy.art/) is an AI-powered image-to-3D generator that converts 2D images into textured 3D models in seconds. Creators, game developers, designers, ecommerce teams, and 3D printing users can upload an image, preview the result in the browser, and download production-ready assets in formats like GLB, OBJ, USDZ, and STL.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/modelfy3d/modelfy-3d-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$dd\",\"icp_kws\":\"$de\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\ne0:[\"seo\",\"backlinks\",\"directory submission\",\"dofollow backlinks\",\"domain rating\",\"link building\",\"startup launch\",\"indie hackers\",\"saas marketing\",\"backlink automation\"]\ne1:[]\ndf:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-15T13:58:32.976198+00:00\",\"id\":16852,\"codename\":\"Submitator\",\"slug\":\"submitator\",\"problem_label\":\"100+ directories, you pick which. Cheap, fast \u0026 good. From $29. \",\"solution_label\":\"Submit your startup to 100+ directories. Cheap, fast, and good.\\n\\nNot your regular \\\"we'll manually submit your startup\\\". We built real automation like back in the pre-AI era. Not \\\"AI assistants\\\". Not overseas teams clicking buttons. Just custom browser automation that actually works.\\n\\nOther"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," services charge $200-500 because they pay humans and AI to do the work. We charge $29-79 because our robots do it better, faster, and 24/7. Simple as that.\\n\\nAnd you stay in control. You pick your directories after you pay. They're all hand-picked, with real traffic and domain authority. No spam sites. No dead links. You watch every submission in a real-time dashboard and get a full report with all your links.\\n\\nQuality backlinks. Better SEO and DR. Done in 24-48 hours. One-time payment, no subscriptions, 30-day refund.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/submitator/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$e0\",\"icp_kws\":\"$e1\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\ne3:[\"Earn money inside your IDE\"]\ne4:[]\ne2:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-15T23:05:38.683356+00:00\",\"id\":16856,\"codename\":\"Highpay Ads\",\"slug\":\"highpayads\",\"problem_label\":\"IDE Ads\",\"solution_label\":\"Developers spend hours every day inside VS Code, Cursor and Windsurf, and the Explorer sidebar is almost always visible.\\n\\nHighpay Ads lets developers earn from small sponsored text cards displayed in their IDE sidebar. No banners, no popups, just simple text ads that match the editor.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/highpayads/apple-touch-icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$e3\",\"icp_kws\":\"$e4\",\"market\":\"ads\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\ne6:[\"React\",\"Svelte\",\"Vue\",\"Gamification\",\"Open Source\",\"Security\",\"Developer Tools\",\"Bot Protection\",\"Templates\",\"Zero Telemetry\"]\ne7:[]\ne5:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T18:31:23.922756+00:00\",\"id\":16870,\"codename\":\"conversion.business\",\"slug\":\"conversionbusiness\",\"problem_label\":\"Open-source gamified starter templates for React, Vue, Svelte.\",\"solution_label\":\"conversion.business provides free, open-source starter templates for "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"React, Svelte, and Vue that replace boring CAPTCHAs with interactive, zero-telemetry mini-games. Built for developers who want to stop bots without ruining their user experience, these templates are ready to drop into your next web project. The code is completely free to clone and use, with pre-configured components and fully localized documentation to help you build faster.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/conversionbusiness/oops_games_logo_minimal.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$e6\",\"icp_kws\":\"$e7\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\ne9:[\"GTM\",\"Marketing\",\"SaaS\",\"Founders\",\"Directories\",\"AI\"]\nea:[]\ne8:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T01:22:51.478154+00:00\",\"id\":16875,\"codename\":\"Favors.dev\",\"slug\":\"favorsdev\",\"problem_label\":\"A marketing hub where founders trade verified growth actions\",\"solution_label\":\"Favors.dev is a community-driven marketing platform designed for founders to trade verified growth actions. Instead of relying on traditional ads or content grinds, founders use a point-based system to request and perform tasks like launch-day shares, product feedback, directory listings, and newsletter mentions. The platform ensures quality through a verification system where every action is checked before points are released, preventing freeloading and ensuring that marketing efforts compound over time.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/favorsdev/favors-dev-500.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$e9\",\"icp_kws\":\"$ea\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nec:[\"dictation\",\"voice typing\",\"speech to text\",\"AI writing\",\"Windows productivity\",\"voice input\",\"web search\",\"email writing\",\"note taking\",\"accessibility\"]\ned:[]\neb:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T10:31:38.349762+00:00\",\"id\":16885,\"codename\":\"MachinesFluent\",\"slug\":\"machinesfluent\",\"problem_label\":\"The best AI powered Dictat"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ion Tool\",\"solution_label\":\"MachinesFluent lets you write anywhere by speaking instead of typing. It works anywhere the keyboard does. \\n\\nRewrite, summarize, translate, or perform web searches, by simply using your voice. It uses AI models to transcribe and polish your speech, while you control the output style using custom prompts.\\n\\nIt also adapts the writing style to the app you're using, and supports adding your own dictionaries for tough words. \\n\\nThat is the core of it.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/machinesfluent/FasterOperations-Wallpaper-Copy.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$ec\",\"icp_kws\":\"$ed\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Desktop App\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nef:[\"email\",\"email aliases\",\"spam filter\",\"privacy\",\"email forwarding\",\"inbox management\",\"anti-spam\",\"SMTP relay\",\"email security\",\"disposable email\"]\nf0:[]\nee:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T17:17:08.649734+00:00\",\"id\":16890,\"codename\":\"Cleanbox\",\"slug\":\"cleanbox\",\"problem_label\":\"Email aliases, AI spam filtering, and a full SMTP relay\",\"solution_label\":\"Cleanbox sits between the internet and your inbox. Every incoming email goes through spam scoring, virus scanning, AI classification, and your own rules before delivery. Create unlimited aliases that forward to your real inbox, build custom filters, and use Cleanbox as a complete SMTP relay. Works with Gmail, Outlook, iCloud, Yahoo, or any IMAP provider, no migration needed. Privacy-first: no advertising, no data selling, no user profiling.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/cleanbox/app.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$ef\",\"icp_kws\":\"$f0\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nf2:[\"DLP\",\"Cybersecurity\"]\nf3:[]\nf1:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T17:49:59.295555+00:00\",\"id\":16891,\"codename\":\"Secureintent\",\"slug\":\"secureintent\",\"problem_label\":\"SecureIntent prevents secrets"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," from being pasted into LLMs by removing them locally before they leave the machine, then restoring them safely when needed.\",\"solution_label\":\"Secureintent.ai is a free chrome extension that protects vibe coders and developers from pasting sensitive tokens, keys and 16-digit credit card details by alerting the user when they paste. Our unique zero retention architecture means the data is never stored or logged and it only ever resides in the local RAM.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/secureintent/SecureIntent-Icon-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$f2\",\"icp_kws\":\"$f3\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Browser Extension\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nf5:[\"SALES\",\"MARKETING\",\"GROWTH\",\"DISTRIBUTION\"]\nf6:[]\nf4:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T23:35:30.923476+00:00\",\"id\":16902,\"codename\":\"Zapnote\",\"slug\":\"zapnote\",\"problem_label\":\"Cold emails get ignored. Personalized pages get opened.\",\"solution_label\":\"Zapnote turns a cold prospect's domain into a personalized, co-branded microsite in under a minute. Instead of reading a wall of cold email text, your prospect opens a page built about them. Paste a domain on the homepage, watch the page generate live, and drop the link into your outreach. Built for sales teams and founders who want replies, not unsubscribes. No signup needed to try it. Be notable.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/zapnote/Type-Logomark.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$f5\",\"icp_kws\":\"$f6\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nf8:[\"voice enhancer AI，voice enhancer online，audio enhancer，video voice enhancer online，enhance audio quality online，vocal enhancer，video voice enhancer online\"]\nf9:[]\nf7:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T07:26:39.555627+00:00\",\"id\":16940,\"codename\":\"AI Voice Enhancer Online\",\"slug\":\"aivoiceenhanceronline\",\"problem_label\":\"voice enhancer AI，voice enhancer online，audio enhan"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cer，video voice enhancer online，enhance audio quality online，vocal enhancer，video voice enhancer online\",\"solution_label\":\"Free AI Voice Enhancer — Enhance Voice clarity \u0026 remove background noise online.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aivoiceenhanceronline/e74dd2e8-73a6-4ee5-bbcf-abbe79619dca.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$f8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$f9\",\"market\":\"music\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\nfb:[\"x\",\"workflow\",\"signals\",\"growth\",\"distribution\",\"marketing\"]\nfc:[]\nfa:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T13:47:56.173172+00:00\",\"id\":16949,\"codename\":\"XRL\",\"slug\":\"xrl\",\"problem_label\":\"Learn what works on X. Then repeat it.\",\"solution_label\":\"X Reach Lab turns X into a repeatable growth workflow. Connect your account, see what posts and replies create profile in