ital flower bouquets online\",\"solution_label\":\"Digital Flower Bouquet lets users create and send beautiful virtual flower gifts online. Users can personalize bouquets, add heartfelt messages, and instantly share them as a link. It is perfect for birthdays, romantic message"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"s, long-distance relationships, and thank-you gifts. No signup required, everything works instantly in the browser.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/digitalflowerbouquet/df-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$11c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$11d\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n11f:[\"ai\",\"video\",\"story\",\"generator\",\"youtube\",\"tiktok\",\"social\"]\n120:[]\n11e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T08:38:23.91844+00:00\",\"id\":17038,\"codename\":\"aistory-video\",\"slug\":\"aistoryvideo\",\"problem_label\":\"Generate captivating story videos\",\"solution_label\":\"Effortlessly generate captivating short story videos using the power of AI\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aistoryvideo/v2-2.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$11f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$120\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n122:[\"AI headshot generator\",\"Professional headshots\",\"LinkedIn headshot\",\"Corporate headshots\",\"Business profile photo\",\"AI portrait generator\",\"Resume photo\",\"Personal branding\",\"Remote team headshots\",\"Professional profile picture\"]\n123:[]\n121:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T11:13:37.080101+00:00\",\"id\":17039,\"codename\":\"ProfessionalHeadshot.io\",\"slug\":\"professionalheadshotio\",\"problem_label\":\"Studio-quality headshots from your own photos.\",\"solution_label\":\"ProfessionalHeadshot.io helps job seekers, founders, teams, and creators create polished AI headshots without booking a photographer. Upload a set of casual photos, choose professional styles and backgrounds, and generate high-resolution portraits for LinkedIn, resumes, company pages, speaker bios, and personal branding. It offers fast turnaround, multiple looks per session, commercial usage rights, and a private photo workflow designed for modern professionals.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/professionalheadshotio/logo-square.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$122\",\"icp_kws\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,":\"$123\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n125:[\"text-to-speech\",\"audiobook\",\"PDF converter\",\"EPUB\",\"document converter\",\"AI voice\",\"MP3\",\"productivity\",\"free tool\",\"ElevenLabs\"]\n126:[]\n124:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T12:36:05.406143+00:00\",\"id\":17041,\"codename\":\"DocsToAudio\",\"slug\":\"docstoaudio\",\"problem_label\":\"AI Document to Audio Converter \u0026 Voice Cloning\",\"solution_label\":\"DocsToAudio converts PDF, EPUB, DOCX, and TXT into MP3 or M4B audiobooks using AI voices—or your own cloned voice. The free tier offers 300+ voices in 30+ languages, with no account or file-size limits; documents are parsed in-browser and the original file is never uploaded. Premium is pay-as-you-go with no subscription, offering 800+ ElevenLabs voices, Gemini narration, background conversion with email alerts, 7-day re-downloads, and voice cloning from a 10–30 second recording or authorized upload.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/docstoaudio/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$125\",\"icp_kws\":\"$126\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n128:[\"agent-native-framework\",\"sql-backed-agents\",\"app-