rn Marketing.  AI powered, expert managed\",\"solution_label\":\"AI-powered, expert-managed search marketing optimization engine spanning SEO, GEO, CRO, and PPC, trained on a 1.5M-passage corpus of platform best practices\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/cortexcapconvert/cortex-logo-black-on-white.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$134\",\"icp_kws\":\"$135\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n137:[\"social media\",\"scheduling\",\"marketing\",\"productivity\",\"creator tools\",\"SaaS\",\"content marketing\",\"automation\",\"social media management\"]\n138:[]\n136:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T17:53:45.527964+00:00\",\"id\":17094,\"codename\":\"Donivo\",\"slug\":\"donivo\",\"problem_label\":\"Schedule to major social networks, vote on what ships next\",\"solution_label\":\"Donivo is a simple, fairly priced social media scheduling tool for creators, founders, small businesses, and teams. Create one post, choose your channels, and schedule across Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn, TikTok, YouTube, Threads, and Bluesky. Start free, no card required — and help shape the roadmap by voting on what gets built next.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wil"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"d-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/donivo/favicon-1024.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$137\",\"icp_kws\":\"$138\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n13a:[\"Productivity\",\"Podcasts\",\"AI\"]\n13b:[]\n139:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T18:37:14.466483+00:00\",\"id\":17095,\"codename\":\"fiveminutebrief\",\"slug\":\"fiveminutebrief\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn any topic into your own daily 5-minute podcast\",\"solution_label\":\"fiveminutebrief creates personalized daily 5-minute podcasts and newsletters for any topic you want to fo