nected agents, dashboards, and workflows. Teams describe what they need in natural language, and Zaro generates internal tools that share a unified memory layer your company fully owns.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/zaro-ai/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$140\",\"icp_kws\":\"$141\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n143:[\"AI Outbound platform\",\"Lead Generation\",\"Sales automation\",\"Signal-based prospecting\",\"Personalized outreach\",\"Deal pursuit\",\"Cold email\",\"GTM automation\",\"Prospect research\"]\n144:[]\n142:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T09:53:00.854046+00:00\",\"id\":17103,\"codename\":\"Outify\",\"slug\":\"outify\",\"problem_label\":\"The AI that turns outbound into revenue.\",\"solution_label\":\"Outify is the AI that turns outbound into revenue. Trained on your product, customers, and competitors, it runs your outbound end to end - finding the signal, building the lead, drafting the campaign, and chasing the deal until you win.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/outify/logo-only-white-black-background.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$143\",\"icp_kws\":\"$144\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n146:[\"Investor Matches\",\"Startup funding\",\"VC finder\"]\n147:[]\n145:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T15:31:39.298804+00:00\",\"id\":17109,\"codename\":\"Investor Match\",\"slug\":\"investormatch\",\"problem_label\":\"Find your perfect VC investors\",\"solution_label\":\"Upload your pitch deck and get 20 personalized VC matches with fit scores, direct contacts, and ready-to-send outreach email"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"s.  Get a Teardown of your deck to improve before pitching. Over $100M in verified investor commitments.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/investormatch/Screenshot-2026-06-26-at-8.27.20-AM.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$146\",\"icp_kws\":\"$147\",\"market\":\"startup-builders\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n149:[\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"No-Code\",\"SaaS\",\"Crypto\",\"Futures\",\"Trading Tools\",\"Self-Hosted\",\"Algotrading\",\"Quant Lab\"]\n14a:[]\n148:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T16:38:53.777024+00:00\",\"id\":17111,\"codename\":\"VESKALD\",\"slug\":\"veskald\",\"problem_label\":\"Strategies that survive real markets. Honestly tested. Self-Hosted bot\",\"solution_label\":\"Build crypto futures strategies without code, then find out whether they actually survive — honest backtest with real funding, slippage and commissions, stress-tests, out-of-sample validation, and three AI agents that diagnose, prototype and research. Self-hosted execution: your keys never leave your machine.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/veskald/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$149\",\"icp_kws\":\"$14a\",\"market\":\"fintech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n14c:[\"image editing\",\"video editing\",\"embedded editor\",\"canvas image editor\"]\n14d:[]\n14b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T17:02:01.066458+00:00\",\"id\":17112,\"codename\":\"polotno sdk\",\"slug\":\"polotnosdk\",\"problem_label\":\"Image and video editing SDK\",\"solution_label\":\"Ship image and video editing in weeks – without the long-term maintenance burden. Interactive editor, template automation, rendering, and export. Delivered as a programmable SDK you control. Designed to run inside your architecture.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/polotnosdk/logo-square-dark.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$14c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$14d\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"g"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"rowing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n14f:[\"Tech\",\"Web3\",\"Social platform\",\"Investing\",\"Sports\",\"Pop culture\",\"Prediction Markets\"]\n150:[]\n14e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-27T15:35:13.996397+00:00\",\"id\":17125,\"codename\":\"Problyx\",\"slug\":\"problyx\",\"problem_label\":\"A next-gen social prediction platform.\",\"solution_label\":\"Problyx is a next-gen social prediction market platform where users forecast the outcomes of real-time events across a wide range of topics. They can join existing markets or create their own, with prices and probabilities updating dynamically based on collective user activity.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/problyx/icon-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$14f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$150\",\"market\":\"community\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n152:[\"Fundraising\",\"CRM\",\"Investors list\",\"Outreach\",\"Investor intelligence\"]\n153:[]\n151:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T11:27:05.744408+00:00\",\"id\":17141,\"codename\":\"Round OS\",\"slug\":\"roundos\",\"problem_label\":\"AI fundraising CRM with investor dossiers, contacts and warm intro paths\",\"solution_label\":\"Round OS is an AI fundraising CRM for founders running pre-seed and seed rounds. It combines your fundraising context with a live investor database: fund profiles, partner and analyst contacts, investment focus, recent news, portfolio signals and warm intro paths. It helps founders prioritize the right investors, prepare personalized outreach, draft follow-ups and keep every investor conversation moving without losing context.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/roundos/IMG_20260618_184922_570.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$152\",\"icp_kws\":\"$153\",\"market\":\"startup-builders\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n155:[\"image to svg\",\"AI vectorizer\",\"png to svg\",\"dxf converter\",\"laser cutting\",\"cricut\",\"svg converter\",\"cnc\",\"embroidery\",\"print on demand\"]\n156:[]\n154:{\"create"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"d_at\":\"2026-06-28T16:41:34.826011+00:00\",\"id\":17142,\"codename\":\"Vectosolve\",\"slug\":\"vectosolve\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn any image into a clean, cut-ready vector\",\"solution_label\":\"VectoSolve turns any image into clean, cut-ready vector files. Drop a PNG, JPG or photo and get AI-traced SVG and DXF for laser cutters, Cricut, Silhouette, CNC, embroidery and print-on-demand. It removes backgrounds, upscales, and exports directly to the format your machine actually needs, not just a generic SVG. Free preview, no signup, no watermark. Also available as a public API, an MCP server, and browser extensions.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/vectosolve/vectosolve_monograme_couleur.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$155\",\"icp_kws\":\"$156\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n158:[\"AI Journaling\",\"Private Journaling\",\"Reflective Writing\",\"Self Reflection\",\"Writing App\",\"Personal Growth\",\"Mindfulness\",\"Digital Journal\",\"Thoughtful AI\",\"Mental Wellness\"]\n159:[]\n157:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T18:47:11.367896+00:00\",\"id\":17143,\"codename\":\"ALCHM\",\"slug\":\"alchm\",\"problem_label\":\"A private reflection practice for the moments therapy can’t reach.\",\"solution_label\":\"Most AI products try to answer every question. ALCHM explores a different direction: a private reflection platform that helps you think through writing instead of telling you what to think.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/alchm/ChatGPT-Image-Jun-21-2026-12_44_52-PM.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$158\",\"icp_kws\":\"$159\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n15b:[\"AI\",\"Productivity\",\"Content Aggregation\",\"Summarization\",\"YouTube\",\"Reddit\",\"WhatsApp\",\"Daily Digest\",\"AI Assistant\",\"News\"]\n15c:[]\n15a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T21:57:40.642999+00:00\",\"id\":17146,\"codename\":\"DailyTube\",\"slug\":\"dailytube\",\"problem_label\":\"Follow everything. Wat"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ch nothing. AI daily briefings.\",\"solution_label\":\"DailyTube monitors your YouTube channels, subreddits, X accounts, and TikTok creators overnight and delivers one AI briefing every morning to WhatsApp, email, or Telegram. No app to open, no feed to scroll — it just arrives. Each briefing goes through 14 refinement stages.\\n\\nAsk Max, the built-in AI assistant, follow-up questions with answers cited back to the exact source. Free forever, no card required.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/dailytube/DailyTube-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$15b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$15c\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n15e:[\"on-device dictation\",\"private transcription\",\"voice workspace\"]\n15f:[\"speech recognition\",\"voice productivity\",\"macos utilities\",\"ios keyboard\",\"privacy tech\"]\n15d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-29T09:57:02.827406+00:00\",\"id\":17154,\"codename\":\"Murmr Voice\",\"slug\":\"murmr-voice\",\"problem_label\":\"Effortless on‑device dictation, perfectly formatted, fiercely private.\",\"solution_label\":\"murmr converts natural speech into clean, tone-aware text entirely on-device for macOS and iOS, keeping audio and transcripts private. It removes filler, fixes punctuation, and offers a unified voice workspace with dictation history, listening modes, and advanced controls for focused, hands-free writing.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/murmr-voice/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$15e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$15f\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n161:[\"HTML to video\",\"Claude animations to MP4\",\"No-watermark video export\",\"Frame-by-frame render\",\"GSAP to video\",\"Social video\"]\n162:[]\n160:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-29T14:59:21.836141+00:00\",\"id\":17159,\"codename\":\"framecast\",\"slug\":\"framecast\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn Claude animations into watermark-free video\",\"solution_label\":\"Claude makes beautiful HTML animations, but screen re"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cording wrecks them with dropped frames, banded gradients, and a watermark. Framecast renders your animation frame-by-frame in a real browser engine into a clean, watermark-free MP4: YouTube 16:9, vertical 9:16, and square 1:1 from one drop. Works with CSS, GSAP, canvas, and SVG. Free preview, then $2.99 per video, no subscription.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/framecast/framecast-stripe-icon-square.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$161\",\"icp_kws\":\"$162\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n164:[\"contractor\",\"website builder\",\"lead generation\",\"home services\",\"HVAC\",\"plumber\",\"electrician\",\"roofer\",\"local SEO\",\"small business\"]\n165:[]\n163:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-29T16:46:51.199202+00:00\",\"id\":17161,\"codename\":\"forge\",\"slug\":\"forge\",\"problem_label\":\"Get your contractor website live in 10 minutes\",\"solution_label\":\"Forge is a website builder and lead management platform built specifically for home service contractors — plumbers, HVAC techs, electricians, and roofers. Get a professional website live in under 10 minutes, capture leads automatically, and collect Google reviews after every job. No tech skills, no agency, no waiting. One dashboard for your website, leads, and reviews.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/forge/forge_profile_photo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$164\",\"icp_kws\":\"$165\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n167:[\"AI Interview Assistant\",\"Live Interview Copilot\",\"Coding Interview Assistant\",\"Dual-Device Mode\",\"Real-Time Answers\",\"Resume-Based Answers\",\"Interview Preparation\",\"Mock Interviews\",\"Technical Interviews\",\"Job Search\"]\n168:[]\n166:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T02:38:05.489682+00:00\",\"id\":17168,\"codename\":\"InterviewFox AI\",\"slug\":\"interviewfoxai\",\"problem_label\":\"Dual-device AI Interview Assistant for Live Interviews\",\"solution_label\":\"In"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"terviewFox is a dual-device AI interview assistant for live and coding interviews. It detects interviewer questions in real time, generates resume-based answers, supports coding and system design help, and keeps AI responses off your shared screen by showing them privately on your phone. It works with Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, HackerRank, LeetCode, and other interview platforms.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/interviewfoxai/Image-18-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$167\",\"icp_kws\":\"$168\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n16a:[\"guideline auditor\",\"policy linter\",\"review validator\"]\n16b:[\"dev-tools\",\"aso\",\"analytics\",\"oss\",\"cloud\"]\n169:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T11:50:23.290567+00:00\",\"id\":17177,\"codename\":\"Greenlight\",\"slug\":\"greenlight\",\"problem_label\":\"Catch App Store issues early, before Apple rejects you.\",\"solution_label\":\"Greenlight is an open-source pre-submission compliance scanner for Apple App Store review that runs locally in under a second. It analyzes code, privacy manifests, binaries, and metadata against Apple’s guidelines to catch rejection risks early, with an optional runtime verification tier for flow-dependent checks.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/greenlight/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$16a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$16b\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n16d:[\"tech news\",\"news aggregator\",\"content curation\",\"productivity\",\"news reader\",\"free\",\"web app\",\"mobile app\"]\n16e:[]\n16c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T13:37:21.670851+00:00\",\"id\":17181,\"codename\":\"PageSifter\",\"slug\":\"pagesifter\",\"problem_label\":\"A free, human-curated tech news app\",\"solution_label\":\"PageSifter is a completely free aggregator of hand-picked tech news. A human editor sifts through the web to select the best articles. No algorithm decides what you see.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microla"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"unch.workers.dev/logos-001/pagesifter/pagesifter.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$16d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$16e\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n170:[\"smartbrush\",\"electric toothbrush\",\"dental care app\"]\n171:[]\n16f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T14:33:38.440519+00:00\",\"id\":17182,\"codename\":\"Feno.co\",\"slug\":\"fenoco\",\"problem_label\":\"Tech That Will Change Your Life\",\"solution_label\":\"Feno is a health-tech company championing the movement to advance oral care as the gateway to health. It blends the precision of advanced dental technology with the simplicity of everyday use to make oral health effortless.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fenoco/favicon_1.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$170\",\"icp_kws\":\"$171\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n173:[\"enterprise communication tool\"]\n174:[]\n172:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T19:10:33.747796+00:00\",\"id\":17187,\"codename\":\"Listo\",\"slug\":\"listo\",\"problem_label\":\"Modernize your venue’s service management\",\"solution_label\":\"Listo is the leading communication and task management platform for the deskless workforce, seamlessly connecting guests to staff and internal teams to one another with a single tap on any device. As a result, Listo helps world class stadium, venue and hotel operators function with a leaner labor force with more accountability, while simultaneously unlocking new areas of revenue and providing a gold standard of service to their patrons.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/listo/getlisto_logo.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$173\",\"icp_kws\":\"$174\",\"market\":\"team-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n176:[\"desktopagent\",\"privacyaissistant\",\"localfirstworkspace\"]\n177:[\"privacytech\",\"productivity\",\"macos\",\"knowledgework\",\"aigeneratednotes\"]\n175:{\"cre"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ated_at\":\"2026-06-30T19:27:03.951753+00:00\",\"id\":17188,\"codename\":\"OpenSoftware\",\"slug\":\"opensoftware\",\"problem_label\":\"All your words, captured and working for you.\",\"solution_label\":\"June is a privacy-first AI workspace for Mac that keeps chats, documents, and meeting notes local on your desktop. It combines a private agent, voice dictation, and automated meeting summaries so you can automate sensitive workflows without sending raw data to external servers.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/opensoftware/logo-placeholder.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$176\",\"icp_kws\":\"$177\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n179:[\"AI Triage\",\"Communication Triage\",\"Email Triage\",\"Slack Triage\",\"Hangouts Triage\"]\n17a:[]\n178:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T21:21:26.205729+00:00\",\"id\":17190,\"codename\":\"fluorly\",\"slug\":\"fluorly\",\"problem_label\":\"Fluorly gatekeeps your attention across Gmail, Slack, and Google Chat.\",\"solution_label\":\"Fluorly is a voice-first AI communication triage platform designed for busy entrepreneurs. It tackles message overload by consolidating incoming communications across channels like email and Slack into one simple, easy-to-view dashboard. By keeping tabs on your messages and highlighting priority items, Fluorly reduces the noise so you can focus on deep work. Simply chat with your smart assistant to triage your daily communications and take back control of your time.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fluorly/icon-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$179\",\"icp_kws\":\"$17a\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n17c:[\"jobsearch\",\"autofill\",\"chromeextension\",\"coverletters\",\"resume\",\"recruiting\",\"productivity\",\"ai\"]\n17d:[]\n17b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T21:24:29.950393+00:00\",\"id\":17191,\"codename\":\"ApplyBtn\",\"slug\":\"applybtn\",\"problem_label\":\"AI autofill for real-world job application forms\",\"solution_la"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"bel\":\"ApplyBtn is an AI Chrome extension for job application autofill. It fills real-world application forms directly on the page using your CV and the job description, generates tailored answers and cover letters, and keeps you in control before manual submission.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aoolybtn/icon-light-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$17c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$17d\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n17f:[]\n180:[]\n17e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T02:20:19.895036+00:00\",\"id\":17195,\"codename\":\"upscayl\",\"slug\":\"upscayl\",\"problem_label\":\"Upscayl AI Image Upscaler Online Free\",\"solution_label\":\"Instantly convert your photos to HD quality with the Upscayl AI Image Upscaler. This Upscayl Models enhances blurry, pixelated, or low-resolution photos to stunning 4K resolution in seconds — the Upscayl Image and Upscayl ai image upscaler you can rely on.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/upscayl/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260410222420_1067.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$17f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$180\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n182:[]\n183:[]\n181:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T08:27:37.716883+00:00\",\"id\":17199,\"codename\":\"flow ai\",\"slug\":\"flowai-b1d7d7\",\"problem_label\":\"Flow AI Video Generator Online\",\"solution_label\":\"Flow AI Video Generator Online\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/flowai-b1d7d7/flowaivideo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$182\",\"icp_kws\":\"$183\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n185:[\"AI marketing agent\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Google Ads\",\"PPC\",\"paid ads\",\"ad optimization\",\"marketing automation\",\"AI agent\",\"media buyer\",\"campaign management\"]\n186:[]\n184:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T15:52:10.978521+00:00\",\"id\":17213,\"codename\":\"AdsBud\",\"slug\":\"adsbud\",\"problem_l"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"abel\":\"Your AI media buyer for Meta and Google Ads\",\"solution_label\":\"AdsBud is an AI marketing agent that runs your Meta and Google Search campaigns from one chat, in plain language. It reads live performance and your actual setup on a schedule, scoring every campaign against today's number, your 7-day average, and your since-launch baseline, so it catches the leaks surface metrics hide. It proposes every fix with the reasoning attached, and nothing changes without your one-click approval. Solo from $29/mo.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/adsbud/meta-app-icon-1024.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$185\",\"icp_kws\":\"$186\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n188:[\"Seedance 2.5\",\"seedance25.tech\",\"AI video generator\",\"cinematic AI video\",\"production-grade AI video\",\"AI video generation platform\",\"ByteDance Seed AI\",\"synthetic video engine\"]\n189:[]\n187:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T16:13:30.294605+00:00\",\"id\":17214,\"codename\":\"Seedance 2.5\",\"slug\":\"seedance25-fe7887\",\"problem_label\":\"30 seconds. Native. No seams.\",\"solution_label\":\"Seedance 2.5 is a production-grade AI video generation platform accessible at seedance25.tech. Built for creators, brands and film studios, it delivers native 30-second single-pass cinematic footage with zero stitching, supports up to 50 multi-modal references for consistent visual identity, and offers precision local editing without full re-renders. With native audio-video sync and 4K output, it turns creative concepts into publishable studio-grade video in minutes, slashing traditional production costs and timelines.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/seedance25-fe7887/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$188\",\"icp_kws\":\"$189\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n18b:[\"local seo\",\"seo\",\"reputation management\"]\n18c:[]\n18a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T17:43:53.334122+00:00\",\"id"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\":17216,\"codename\":\"TBR Local\",\"slug\":\"tbrlocal\",\"problem_label\":\"SEO Done Right!\",\"solution_label\":\"Local SEO That Puts Your Business on the Map\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tbrlocal/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$18b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$18c\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n18e:[\"ip data\",\"ip detection\",\"fraud detection\",\"ip database\",\"ip analytics\"]\n18f:[]\n18d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T22:31:53.222269+00:00\",\"id\":17220,\"codename\":\"IPCheckly\",\"slug\":\"ipcheckly\",\"problem_label\":\"Where IP data meets security intelligence\",\"solution_label\":\"IPCheckly delivers fast, reliable IP intelligence through a powerful API that helps identify locations, networks, VPNs, proxies, Tor nodes, and potential security risks. Designed for developers and businesses, it enables smarter fraud prevention, geolocation, access control, and analytics with accurate, real-time data and seamless integration into modern applications.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/ipcheckly/Screenshot-2026-07-02-at-00.59.49.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$18e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$18f\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n191:[\"Spotify Podcast\",\"Spotify\",\"AI Podcast\",\"AutomaticTranscription\",\"AI\",\"Productivity\"]\n192:[]\n190:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-02T03:09:55.494017+00:00\",\"id\":17222,\"codename\":\"SpotScribe\",\"slug\":\"spotscribe\",\"problem_label\":\"Extract Spotify Podcast Transcripts Instantly\",\"solution_label\":\"Turn any Spotify podcast into text. Extract transcripts, generate AI summaries, chat with episodes, and copy or download content effortlessly.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/spotscribe/logo-rounded.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$191\",\"icp_kws\":\"$192\",\"market\":\"podcast\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_prem"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ium\":false}\n194:[\"News\",\"News Aggregator\",\"Content Discovery\",\"AI Tools\",\"Productivity\",\"Podcasts\",\"Search\",\"Apps\"]\n195:[]\n193:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-02T13:15:14.206963+00:00\",\"id\":17233,\"codename\":\"Symby\",\"slug\":\"symby\",\"problem_label\":\"Understand every side of a news story across articles, social, and podcasts\",\"solution_label\":\"Symby brings together news articles, social news posts, podcasts, and searchable background knowledge, all in one place, so you’ll never miss what matters. \",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/symby/Symby-Logo-white-on-gradient.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$194\",\"icp_kws\":\"$195\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n197:[\"terminal agent\",\"go-based assistant\",\"model-agnostic orchestrator\"]\n198:[\"developer tooling\",\"command-line\",\"ai engineering\",\"open-source\",\"code automation\"]\n196:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-02T17:44:50.418493+00:00\",\"id\":17238,\"codename\":\"Zero\",\"slug\":\"zero\",\"problem_label\":\"Zero: Open-source terminal agent, every model and tool unlocked\",\"solution_label\":\"Zero is an open-source terminal coding agent built in Go that connects to any language model and your existing development stack. It lives in your command line, enabling customizable, model-agnostic automation while keeping you in full control of your code workflows.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/zero/logo-placeholder.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$197\",\"icp_kws\":\"$198\",\"market\":\"oss\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n19a:[\"ai-image-generator\",\"ai-headshot\",\"ai-photoshoot\",\"ai-video-generator\",\"photo-editing\",\"ai-avatar\",\"text-to-image\",\"ai-photography\",\"content-creation\",\"ai-tools\"]\n19b:[]\n199:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-03T18:21:36.583193+00:00\",\"id\":17260,\"codename\":\"MagicShot AI\",\"slug\":\"magicshotai\",\"problem_label\":\"Your AI photographer, designer \u0026 video editor in one app.\",\"solution_label\":\"MagicShot.ai is"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," an all-in-one AI creative suite with 84+ tools: AI image generator, AI photoshoot (headshots, dating, wedding, baby, Instagram lifestyle), AI video generator, hairstyle changer, photo enhancer, background remover, and audio tools. Used by 400K+ creators, marketers, and everyday users. No design experience needed — most tools work from a single photo upload.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/magicshotai/magicshot-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$19a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$19b\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Desktop App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n19d:[\"mastering\",\"LUFS\",\"Spotify\",\"loudness\",\"-14 LUFS\",\"True Peak\",\"audio mastering\",\"music mastering\",\"streaming\",\"lufs meter\"]\n19e:[]\n19c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-04T17:56:37.423062+00:00\",\"id\":17276,\"codename\":\"LUFS Mastering\",\"slug\":\"lufsmastering\",\"problem_label\":\"Automatic mastering to Spotify standard: -14 LUFS · True Peak -1dB\",\"solution_label\":\"Most musicians upload to Spotify without knowing tracks get turned down if they exceed -14 LUFS. LUFS Mastering fixes this in seconds. Drop your audio file — WAV, MP3, FLAC — and it masters to exactly -14 LUFS with -1 dBTP True Peak using deterministic DSP (ITU-R BS.1770-4). No upload to any server. No account required. Runs 100% locally in your browser. Built for musicians, producers, and freelancers distributing to Spotify, Apple Music, DistroKid, CD Baby, Tunecore, LANDR, etc.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/lufsmastering/logo_128x128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$19d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$19e\",\"market\":\"music\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1a0:[\"AI safety\",\"prompt privacy\",\"browser extension\",\"local-first\",\"open source\",\"data protection\",\"developer tools\",\"sensitive data masking\",\"ChatGPT\",\"Claude\",\"Gemini\"]\n1a1:[]\n19f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-04T19:31:27.653453+00:00\",\"id\":17278,\"codename\":\"Offsend Browser Extension\",\"slug\":\"offsendbrowserextensi"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"on\",\"problem_label\":\"Mask secrets before you hit send.\",\"solution_label\":\"Offsend catches secrets and personal data in your prompts and masks them automatically — before they ever reach ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/offsendbrowserextension/AppIcon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1a0\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1a1\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Browser Extension\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1a3:[\"Marketing\",\"Market research\"]\n1a4:[]\n1a2:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-05T01:40:39.830051+00:00\",\"id\":17281,\"codename\":\"goahead\",\"slug\":\"goahead\",\"problem_label\":\"Put your impossible-to-test ads, brands, designs, and products in front of a real audience before you commit\",\"solution_label\":\"goahead lets you validate creative work with real audience feedback before it goes public. Test offline ads, design directions, or product concepts and see what genuinely connects with the people you're trying to reach.\\n\\nMade for marketers, designers, and product teams who want proof, not guesswork, before greenlighting a campaign or launch.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/goahead/goahead-icon-round-01.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1a3\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1a4\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1a6:[]\n1a7:[]\n1a5:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-05T07:29:40.970308+00:00\",\"id\":17286,\"codename\":\"Producer AI\",\"slug\":\"producerai\",\"problem_label\":\"Producer AI: AI Music Generator Free By Google\",\"solution_label\":\"Producer AI: AI Music Generator Free By Google\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/producerai/gemini-world-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1a6\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1a7\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1a9:[\"analytics\",\"SEO\",\"AI SEO\",\"product analytics\",\"cookieless analytics\",\"MCP\",\"content marketing\",\"growth tools\",\"AI"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," assistant\",\"dashboard\"]\n1aa:[]\n1a8:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-05T16:45:40.951247+00:00\",\"id\":17294,\"codename\":\"Analyse\",\"slug\":\"analyse\",\"problem_label\":\"Analytics, AI SEO, and a data copilot in one tab.\",\"solution_label\":\"Analyse replaces your fragmented growth toolstack with one dashboard. Cookieless product analytics with Mixpanel-grade funnels and cohort heatmaps, no SQL required. An AI SEO engine that goes from research to published post automatically. And a data copilot grounded in your real events and Search Console data. It also ships an MCP server so you can query your analytics directly from Claude or Cursor.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/analyse/Profile-Picture.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1a9\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1aa\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1ac:[\"Paste-a-URL listing creation (~30 second enrichment)\",\"Provenance labels on every field (Verified / AI-inferred / Founder-edited)\",\"Tool listing pages (structured\",\"labelled data)\",\"Comparison pages (X vs Y)\",\"Category pages\",\"Community upvotes\",\"Community surveys\"]\n1ad:[]\n1ab:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-06T17:43:20.597104+00:00\",\"id\":17308,\"codename\":\"directree\",\"slug\":\"directree\",\"problem_label\":\"Software listings you can trust. Every fact labelled.\",\"solution_label\":\"directree is an honest software directory and launch platform. Paste any product URL and get a full structured listing in about 30 seconds. Every field is clearly labelled Verified or AI-inferred, so you always know how we know it. Founders can claim their listing and get a do-follow backlink.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/directree/directree_fig_transp_500px.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1ac\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1ad\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1af:[\"MCP\",\"AI agents\",\"developer tools\",\"open source\",\"local-first\",\"gateway\",\"Cla"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ude\",\"Cursor\",\"security\",\"productivity\"]\n1b0:[]\n1ae:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T13:09:39.604074+00:00\",\"id\":17325,\"codename\":\"Toolport\",\"slug\":\"toolport\",\"problem_label\":\"All your MCP servers. One port.\",\"solution_label\":\"Toolport is a free, open-source, local-first MCP gateway. Set up and authenticate each MCP server once, and every AI client (Claude, Cursor, VS Code, Codex and the rest) shares it. Your agent loads a handful of meta-tools instead of hundreds, cutting tool-token overhead up to 91%. Every call is fingerprinted for tampering, your API keys stay in the OS keychain, and you get a full audit trail. No containers, no sign-up.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/toolport/toolport-icon-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1af\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1b0\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Desktop App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1b2:[]\n1b3:[]\n1b1:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T14:23:23.529267+00:00\",\"id\":17326,\"codename\":\"Planpoint Viewer\",\"slug\":\"planpointviewer\",\"problem_label\":\"Interactive floor plan selector for real estate: share plans and inventory.\",\"solution_label\":\"Planpoint Viewer turns static floor plans into an interactive stacking plan prospects can explore in seconds.\\n\\nEmbed it on any real estate website and let buyers and renters:\\n\\t•\\tBrowse available units at a glance\\n\\t•\\tFilter by price and availability, updated in real time\\n\\t•\\tPicture the space through images, 360° tours, and choice of finishes\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/planpointviewer/Icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1b2\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1b3\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1b5:[\"Product Studio\",\"Product Strategy\",\"Product Design\",\"Product Engineering\",\"AI Development Studio\",\"MVP Development\",\"Digital Product Development\",\"UI/UX Design\",\"Custom Software Development\",\"Startup Product Studio\"]\n1b6:[]\n1b4:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"15:14:11.827248+00:00\",\"id\":17328,\"codename\":\"Studio by dyventech\",\"slug\":\"studiobydyventech\",\"problem_label\":\"Bring the messy idea. We’ll find the product inside it.\",\"solution_label\":\"Dyven Studio helps founders and businesses turn messy product ideas into useful shipped products. We combine product strategy, design, engineering, AI thinking, and customer learning in one team, so decisions do not get lost between handoffs.\\n\\nUnlike traditional agencies, we do not just execute feature lists. We help clarify the product bet, test risky assumptions, ship the smallest valuable version, and learn from real user signals.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/studiobydyventech/Studiobydyventech.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1b5\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1b6\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1b8:[\"eSIM\",\"travel eSIM\",\"travel tech\",\"mobile data\",\"roaming alternative\",\"internet abroad\",\"digital SIM\",\"remote work\",\"digital nomads\",\"international travel\"]\n1b9:[]\n1b7:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T15:29:38.933572+00:00\",\"id\":17329,\"codename\":\"purasim\",\"slug\":\"purasim\",\"problem_label\":\"PuraSIM | eSIM for travellers\",\"solution_label\":\"Travel eSIMs without roaming fees\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/purasim/impressum-legal-notice-purasim-website-purasim.com-contact-holapurasim.com-purasim-is-a-digital-project-operated-by-its-ownerresponsible-person.-responsible-for-the-content-of-this-website-and-r-2.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1b8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1b9\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1bb:[\"Social Media\",\"Browser Extension\",\"Twitter\",\"Linkedin\",\"Instagram\",\"Reddit\",\"Youtube\",\"Tiktok\"]\n1bc:[]\n1ba:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T17:44:21.976294+00:00\",\"id\":17331,\"codename\":\"SocialClipper\",\"slug\":\"socialclipper\",\"problem_label\":\"Unified social media bookmarking platform for or"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ganizing and saving posts.\",\"solution_label\":\"SocialClipper is a premium social media bookmarking and organization platform that lets you clip and save posts from major platforms including Twitter/X, TikTok, Instagram, Reddit, YouTube, and LinkedIn.\\n\\nStore all your saved content in one secure, elegant dashboard instead of scattered across multiple apps. Perfect for content curators, researchers, and social media enthusiasts who need to organize and reference web content efficiently.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/socialclipper/socialclipper_20260706145911.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1bb\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1bc\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Browser Extension\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1be:[\"ai fluency\",\"ai skills assessment\",\"ai certification\",\"ai readiness\",\"workforce ai\",\"ai literacy\",\"skills assessment\",\"ai evaluation\",\"professional development\",\"hr tech\"]\n1bf:[]\n1bd:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T22:31:22.236274+00:00\",\"id\":17335,\"codename\":\"AISA (aisa.to) AI Fluency Assessment\",\"slug\":\"aisa\",\"problem_label\":\"Conversational and agentic AI Fluency Assessment with free Linkedin Certificate\",\"solution_label\":\"AISA is a conversational AI fluency assessment that measures how effectively professionals use artificial intelligence — scored across 5 dimensions and 11 criteria, with a free certificate.\\n\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aisa/logo-full-orange-big.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1be\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1bf\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1c1:[\"security\",\"software\",\"windows\",\"leak\",\"leakcheck\",\"hibp\",\"haveibeenpwned\",\"password\"]\n1c2:[]\n1c0:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08T10:17:25.701289+00:00\",\"id\":17347,\"codename\":\"LeakCheck\",\"slug\":\"leakcheck\",\"problem_label\":\"Is your password secure? Check now for free!\",\"solution_label\":\"LeakCheck compares your passwords and email addresses to millions of known data l"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"eaks – right on your PC.\\n\\nDiscover LeakCheck, the user-friendly Windows software for protecting your digital identity. With LeakCheck, you can securely check your passwords and email addresses for known data breaches – quickly, intuitively, and directly on your PC, without any sensitive data leaving your system.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/leakcheck/logo_glow.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1c1\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1c2\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Desktop App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1c4:[\"AI\",\"Architecture\",\"Interior Design\",\"Home Design\",\"Floor Plan\",\"Rendering\",\"Visualization\",\"Real Estate\",\"Landscape Design\",\"Design Tools\"]\n1c5:[]\n1c3:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08T14:32:32.024149+00:00\",\"id\":17348,\"codename\":\"ArchyBase\",\"slug\":\"archybase\",\"problem_label\":\"AI Architecture \u0026 Interior Design Studio\",\"solution_label\":\"ArchyBase is an AI-powered platform for architecture, interior, exterior, and landscape design. Transform photos, sketches, and floor plans into photorealistic renders in seconds. Generate AI floor plans, redesign interiors, visualize exteriors, and create 3D concepts with minimal effort. Built for architects, designers, real estate professionals, and homeowners looking to speed up design workflows and explore ideas faster.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/archybase/screenshot-20260221-111824.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1c4\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1c5\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1c7:[\"laravel mailer\",\"ses relay\",\"email controlplane\"]\n1c8:[\"devops\",\"email-infrastructure\",\"laravel\",\"transactional-mail\",\"cloud-email\"]\n1c6:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T08:20:57.038342+00:00\",\"id\":17361,\"codename\":\"Larasend\",\"slug\":\"larasend\",\"problem_label\":\"Own your Laravel emails: self-hosted, SES-powered, fully logged\",\"solution_label\":\"Larasend is a self-hosted transactional email system for Laravel teams that cen"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"tralizes delivery logs, events, and API keys while sending through Amazon SES or Cloudflare Email Service. It provides a dedicated mail transport, HTTP API, and dashboard fully hosted on your own infrastructure.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/larasend/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1c7\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1c8\",\"market\":\"oss\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1ca:[\"domain registration\",\"brand domains\",\"domain names\"]\n1cb:[]\n1c9:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T09:05:23.138375+00:00\",\"id\":17363,\"codename\":\"DomRegus\",\"slug\":\"domregus\",\"problem_label\":\"Your Domain. Your Identity. Your Future.\",\"solution_label\":\"DomRegus makes domain registration simple, secure, and reliable. Search, register, transfer, and manage domain names through an intuitive platform designed for individuals, startups, and businesses looking to establish a strong online presence.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/domregus/Screenshot-2026-07-07-at-13.22.39.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1ca\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1cb\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1cd:[\"personal CRM\",\"relationship keeper\",\"AI assistant\",\"reminders\",\"private notes\"]\n1ce:[]\n1cc:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-10T07:12:25.435086+00:00\",\"id\":17386,\"codename\":\"Ember: Relationship Keeper\",\"slug\":\"emberrelationshipkeeper\",\"problem_label\":\"The AI Keeper for your real relationships\",\"solution_label\":\"Ember is one private place for everything you need to remember about the people in your life: birthdays, moves, hard weeks, favorite details, kids' names, and follow-ups you promised. Keeper, the AI inside Ember, understands relationships: it turns one sentence into a note, a reminder, or an answer. It works for the people you love and the people you work with. No feed, no followers, no likes.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/emberrelationshipkeeper/ember-icon-1024.png\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,",\"niche_kws\":\"$1cd\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1ce\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1d0:[\"prompt editor\",\"talkinghead cleaner\",\"caption generator\"]\n1d1:[\"video editing\",\"creator tools\",\"content production\",\"marketing video\",\"postproduction\"]\n1cf:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-10T17:54:24.073024+00:00\",\"id\":17390,\"codename\":\"ChatCut\",\"slug\":\"chatcut\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn simple prompts into fully edited, AI-powered videos.\",\"solution_label\":\"ChatCut is an AI video editor that turns natural-language prompts into complete, on-brand edits. It assembles cuts, adds motion graphics, captions, and AI-generated visuals, while letting you edit talking-head videos directly from the transcript.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/chatcut/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1d0\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1d1\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1d3:[\"ip location\",\"ip checker\",\"geolocation detection\"]\n1d4:[]\n1d2:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-10T20:47:36.786881+00:00\",\"id\":17393,\"codename\":\"GeoPatrol\",\"slug\":\"geopatrol\",\"problem_label\":\"Know Every IP. Trust Every Connection.\",\"solution_label\":\"GeoPatrol is an advanced IP intelligence platform that provides accurate geolocation, network, ASN, proxy, VPN, and security insights. Instantly analyze IP addresses with reliable global data to improve cybersecurity, fraud prevention, traffic analysis, and business decision-making through a fast, intuitive online service.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/geopatrol/Screenshot-2026-07-04-at-12.14.46.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1d3\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1d4\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1d6:[]\n1d7:[]\n1d5:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11T10:34:09.67181+00:00\",\"id\":17406,\"codename\":\"TweetBoost GIF Downloader\",\"slug\":\"tweetboostgifdownloader\",\"problem_label\":\"Save Twitter "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"GIFs as MP4 or real .gif — free, no upload\",\"solution_label\":\"Save any Twitter (X) GIF in seconds — as MP4 or a real .gif. Free.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tweetboostgifdownloader/tweetboost-apple-touch-180.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1d6\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1d7\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1d9:[\"video\"]\n1da:[]\n1d8:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-12T06:35:31.464853+00:00\",\"id\":17421,\"codename\":\"Luma Dream Machine\",\"slug\":\"lumadreammachine\",\"problem_label\":\"Luma Dream Machine — AI Video Generator\",\"solution_label\":\"Luma Dream Machine — AI Video Generator\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/lumadreammachine/gemini-world-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1d9\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1da\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1dc:[\"accountability\",\"AI coach\",\"goal tracking\",\"habit tracker\",\"productivity\",\"self-improvement\",\"iOS\",\"Android\"]\n1dd:[]\n1db:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-12T13:22:56.356864+00:00\",\"id\":17426,\"codename\":\"Tier\",\"slug\":\"tier\",\"problem_label\":\"The AI accountability coach that reaches out first \",\"solution_label\":\"You don't quit your projects — you slowly disappear from them. Every tool you've tried (Notion, habit trackers, accountability partners) waited for YOU to show up. Tier is an AI coach that reaches out first: it knows your goal, remembers where you left off, and tells you the one thing to do today. Daily personalized check-ins, honest weekly reviews. Built from 20+ user interviews. iOS \u0026 Android.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tier/tier-5.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1dc\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1dd\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"idea\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1df:[\"AI form filler\",\"PDF automation\",\"E-signature\",\"Document automation\",\"Client CRM\"]\n1e0:[]\n1de"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,":{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-12T19:59:11.897149+00:00\",\"id\":17433,\"codename\":\"Filly AI\",\"slug\":\"fillyai\",\"problem_label\":\"Fill any PDF or Word form in seconds with AI\",\"solution_label\":\"Filly AI reads any PDF or Word form, extracts every field, and autofills it from a saved client profile in seconds. Review and adjust the placement, export a pixel-perfect document, share a no-login link for review, or collect an e-signature with a full audit trail. Includes built-in IRS forms (W-9, W-4, I-9), 25 ready-made templates, and an AI assistant that answers questions while you fill.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fillyai/filly-logo-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1df\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1e0\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1e2:[]\n1e3:[]\n1e1:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-13T03:36:33.650896+00:00\",\"id\":17439,\"codename\":\"Dreamina AI\",\"slug\":\"dreaminaai\",\"problem_label\":\"Dreamina AI: Free AI Image Generator \u0026 AI Video Generator\",\"solution_label\":\"Dreamina AI: Free AI Image Generator \u0026 AI Video Generator\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/dreaminaai/gemini-world-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1e2\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1e3\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1e5:[\"social listening\",\"social media monitoring\"]\n1e6:[]\n1e4:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-13T07:46:05.067469+00:00\",\"id\":17445,\"codename\":\"KWatch\",\"slug\":\"kwatch\",\"problem_label\":\"Receive real-time alerts when things are mentioned on social media\",\"solution_label\":\"Monitor keywords on Linkedin, Reddit, X, Facebook, Youtube, and HN, and get instant alerts by email, Slack, or API webhook\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/kwatch/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1e5\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1e6\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1e8:[\"AI tools\",\"AI di"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"rectory\",\"AI software\",\"SaaS discovery\",\"Productivity\",\"Marketing\",\"Automation\",\"SEO tools\",\"Software discovery\",\"Startup tools\"]\n1e9:[]\n1e7:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-13T15:05:27.244+00:00\",\"id\":17454,\"codename\":\"FindyourAI\",\"slug\":\"findyourai\",\"problem_label\":\"The fastest way to find AI tools that fit.\",\"solution_label\":\"FindYourAI is a curated AI tools discovery platform built to help users find, compare and choose the right AI software for real workflows. Instead of browsing endless directories, users can explore practical categories, use cases, pricing context, strengths and limitations, making it easier to discover relevant tools faster and make better software decisions.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/findyourai/Logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1e8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1e9\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1eb:[\"Content\",\"Marketing\",\"Agentic workflows\",\"Pipelines\",\"Content Marketing\",\"Lead Generation\"]\n1ec:[]\n1ea:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-13T15:33:50.58467+00:00\",\"id\":17455,\"codename\":\"VibeMyWay\",\"slug\":\"vibemyway\",\"problem_label\":\"Ship a full content package. While eating your lunch.\",\"solution_label\":\"One idea in. Blog post, email sequence, landing page, lead magnet, social kit, and images out. For founders and marketing leads at SMBs who handle content without a team, VibeMyWay is the practitioner-built plug-and-play AI workflow kit that turns one idea into a full publication package because every workflow was built and refined in production before being packaged for sale.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/viebmyway/squarepng300.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1eb\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1ec\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1ee:[]\n1ef:[]\n1ed:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-13T18:46:33.973438+00:00\",\"id\":17457,\"codename\":\"Perceptiq\",\"slug\":\"perceptiq\",\"p"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"roblem_label\":\"Become The Brand AI Recommends\",\"solution_label\":\"Perceptiq helps brands become visible in AI search and shape how AI assistants perceive them. It monitors real buying moments across AI chatbots, identifies where your brand is missing, misrepresented, or losing to competitors, and turns the findings into prioritized actions. With one-click execution and ready-to-use content, lean teams can improve AI visibility and brand perception without building an in-house GEO function.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/perceptiq/Frame-2-256.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1ee\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1ef\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1f1:[]\n1f2:[]\n1f0:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-13T20:42:06.724333+00:00\",\"id\":17462,\"codename\":\"RFPilot\",\"slug\":\"rfpilot\",\"problem_label\":\"AI-powered RFP\",\"solution_label\":\"AI-powered RFP, questionnaire and proposal responses for B2B teams.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/rfpilot/favicon-600.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1f1\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1f2\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1f4:[\"trichotillomania\",\"dermatillomania\",\"BFRB\",\"hair pulling\",\"skin picking\",\"nail biting\",\"habit tracker\",\"mental health\",\"self-help\",\"habit breaking\"]\n1f5:[]\n1f3:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14T07:07:21.139839+00:00\",\"id\":17471,\"codename\":\"SoloUno\",\"slug\":\"solouno\",\"problem_label\":\"Take control of hair pulling, skin picking \u0026 nail biting\",\"solution_label\":\"SoloUno helps people take control of body-focused repetitive habits like hair pulling (trichotillomania), skin picking, and nail biting. Because these habits tend to come and go rather than disappear, SoloUno focuses on real progress over quick fixes - affordable, daily, built for long-term habit change. It also supports behavioral therapy \\\"homework\\\" for those in treatment.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"dev/logos-001/solouno/Logo-solouno.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1f4\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1f5\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1f7:[\"Social Media Management\",\"Social Media Scheduling\",\"AI Content Creation\",\"Team Collaboration\",\"Agency Tools\",\"Content Calendar\",\"Social Media Analytics\",\"Approval Workflows\",\"Multi-Brand Management\",\"Automated Reporting\"]\n1f8:[]\n1f6:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14T12:03:29.325241+00:00\",\"id\":17480,\"codename\":\"PostPlanify\",\"slug\":\"postplanify\",\"problem_label\":\"Social media management for agencies and teams\",\"solution_label\":\"PostPlanify is an all-in-one social media management platform for agencies and teams. Plan, approve, schedule, and publish content across major social networks, manage multiple brands and clients, collaborate with your team, track analytics, automate reports, and create content faster with AI, all from one dashboard.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/postplanify/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1f7\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1f8\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1fa:[\"forms\",\"form\",\"builder\",\"creator\",\"app\",\"saas\",\"software\",\"tool\"]\n1fb:[]\n1f9:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14T12:21:18.723882+00:00\",\"id\":17482,\"codename\":\"Fantastic Forms\",\"slug\":\"fantasticforms\",\"problem_label\":\"The best website form builder app. Fast, fun and 100% free. Click here!\",\"solution_label\":\"Fantastic Forms is an all-in-one form builder that gives teams enterprise-grade capabilities with the simplicity of a modern SaaS. From lead capture and order forms to intake, quizzes, and unattended kiosks, one flat Pro plan unlocks everything: multi-page logic, real-time analytics, native integrations, and enterprise-grade security including SSO, SCIM, audit logs, malware scanning, and IP allowlisting.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fantasticforms/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1fa\",\"icp_k"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ws\":\"$1fb\",\"market\":\"no-code\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n1fd:[\"Testing\",\"AI\",\"QA\",\"Bug fix\",\"Social Proof\"]\n1fe:[]\n1fc:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14T12:30:01.574272+00:00\",\"id\":17484,\"codename\":\"Veriwasp\",\"slug\":\"veriwasp\",\"problem_label\":\"Stop Bugs Before They Bite\",\"solution_label\":\"VeriWasp is an AI-powered automated testing tool built for indie SaaS founders. Describe any user flow in plain English (signup, checkout, onboarding, etc.), and AI drives a real browser to execute it. Get a data rich report with full trace replay, and WCAG accessibility reports that adapt when your UI changes, no brittle scripts. Veriwasp also offers API testing, full-site a11y scans, Chaos mode, and CI/CD integration. Start with 10 free runs. Ship faster, break fewer things.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/veriwasp/IMG_2018.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$1fd\",\"icp_kws\":\"$1fe\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n200:[]\n201:[]\n1ff:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14T23:00:47.739573+00:00\",\"id\":17495,\"codename\":\"AgenticRank\",\"slug\":\"agenticrank\",\"problem_label\":\"Tech Assessment for Agentic\",\"solution_label\":\"Tech Assessments for Agentic Team.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/agenticrank/agenticrank-icon-300_