your raw notes and resources into high-impact study assets.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/longtermemoryaistudytool/ltm-logo-128x128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$206\",\"icp_kws\":\"$207\",\"market\":\"edtech\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n209:[\"GLP-1\",\"weight loss\",\"telehealth\",\"semaglutide\",\"tirzepatide\",\"compounded medication\",\"online prescription\"]\n20a:[]\n208:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T20:26:55.772389+00:00\",\"id\":17516,\"codename\":\"Harbor\",\"slug\":\"harbor\",\"problem_label\":\"Physician-led GLP-1 weight loss, delivered to your door\",\"solution_label\":\"Harbor is a telehealth platform for medically supervised weight loss. Board-certified U.S. physicians review your online health assessment and, when appropr"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"iate, prescribe compounded semaglutide from $99/mo or tirzepatide from $149/mo. Every plan includes 24/7 physician access, registered-dietitian support to help you keep the weight off, free discreet shipping, and a 12-month money-back results guarantee. No insurance required, HSA/FSA eligible, and you can cancel anytime.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/harbor/harbor-logo-white.webp\",\"niche_kws\":\"$209\",\"icp_kws\":\"$20a\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n20c:[\"SEO\",\"GEO\",\"AI visibility\"]\n20d:[]\n20b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T14:40:16.828827+00:00\",\"id\":17535,\"codename\":\"RankSurf\",\"slug\":\"ranksurf\",\"problem_label\":\"The AI visibility tool that gets you cited, not just tracked\",\"solution_label\":\"ChatGPT, Perplexity \u0026 Google AI Overview recommend your competitors, not you. RankSurf pinpoints the exact buying prompts you're losing, scores the third-party pages AI cites your rivals on, drafts the outreach, then re-crawls to prove when you get cited.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/ranksurf/ranksurf_logo_1024.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$20c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$20d\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n20f:[\"ai generation\",\"image generation\",\"ai text to image\"]\n210:[]\n20e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T21:48:41.955484+00:00\",\"id\":17544,\"codename\":\"GeniusAI\",\"slug\":\"geniusai\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn Simple Prompts Into Powerful Visuals.\",\"solution_label\":\"GeniusAI transforms your ideas into stunning, production-ready visuals in seconds. Generate unique images from simple text prompts, edit photos, upscale content, and explore creative styles - all through an intuitive platform built for creators, marketers, teams, and businesses.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/geniusai/Screenshot-2026-07-16-at-22.51.17.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$20f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$210\",\"ma"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"rket\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n212:[\"Small business website builder\",\"SEO optimization\",\"Website A/B testing\",\"Automated website building\",\"Agentic website builder\",\"AI website builder\",\"Small business marketing\",\"Website audit\",\"Website waitlist\",\"Landing page\"]\n213:[]\n211:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-17T06:19:05.048073+00:00\",\"id\":17555,\"codename\":\"Frontpage\",\"slug\":\"frontpage\",\"problem_label\":\"The landing page that builds itself, then improves itself.\",\"solution_label\":\"Frontpage is a website builder that works by conversation: you describe the site you want in plain English, and it builds and edits it for you, no templates, code, or designer required. Ask for a homepage, a services page, or a contact form and it appears; say what to change and the update is live in about a minute. You get a fast, professional site that is genuinely yours, with mobile-friendly pages, SEO basics, contact and quote forms, a blog, and the option to take orders or bookings all built in. When you are ready, connect your own domain (or buy one right through Frontpage) so customers find you at yourbusiness.com. And because every edit is just a conversation, keeping your site current stays easy long after launch.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/frontpage/frontpage-icon-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$212\",\"icp_kws\":\"$213\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n215:[\"affiliate marketing\",\"affiliate tracking\",\"referral program\",\"in-app purchases\",\"mobile SDK\",\"iOS\",\"Android\",\"RevenueCat\",\"StoreKit\",\"app monetization\"]\n216:[]\n214:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-17T20:06:36.840606+00:00\",\"id\":17564,\"codename\":\"Insert Affiliate\",\"slug\":\"insertaffiliate\",\"problem_label\":\"Affiliate tracking for in-app purchases on iOS and Android\",\"solution_label\":\"Insert Affiliate lets subscription apps run affiliate and referral programs that actuall"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"y work on mobile. \\n\\nWhen someone installs from a creator's link and subscribes inside your app, we tie that in-app purchase back to the affiliate who drove it, including renewals, so you can pay on real results. \\n\\nIt works on top of StoreKit, Adapty and RevenueCat, charges a flat fee rather than a cut of your revenue, and handles affiliate management and payouts in one place.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/insertaffiliate/Screenshot-2026-07-16-at-20.19.41.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$215\",\"icp_kws\":\"$216\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n218:[\"Travel\",\"AI\",\"Travel Discovery\",\"Vacation Planning\",\"iOS\",\"Flights\",\"Hotels\"]\n219:[]\n217:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-18T19:33:51.880102+00:00\",\"id\":17584,\"codename\":\"Nuvoha\",\"slug\":\"nuvoha\",\"problem_label\":\"Travel discovery that starts with you. \",\"solution_label\":\"The hardest part of travel isn’t booking. It’s deciding where to go. Tell Nuvoha your budget and the kind of trip you’re looking for, and discover personalised Trip Cards that bring flights, accommodation and destination inspiration together into complete, bookable trips. \",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/nuvoha/Nuvoha_Logo_Main_1.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$218\",\"icp_kws\":\"$219\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n21b:[\"product intelligence\",\"voice of customer\",\"AI for Builders\",\"continuous discovery\",\"MCP\"]\n21c:[]\n21a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-18T20:47:34.541312+00:00\",\"id\":17585,\"codename\":\"Fragment\",\"slug\":\"fragment-db72c0\",\"problem_label\":\"AI doesn't know your customers. Fragment does.\",\"solution_label\":\"Fragment connects what your customers say, what your product does, and what your company knows into structured context. Crafted to help product teams, builders, and their AI agents to ship the right things 10x faster.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,".microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fragment-db72c0/fragment-logo-mark-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$21b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$21c\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n21e:[]\n21f:[]\n21d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-19T01:48:03.976471+00:00\",\"id\":17588,\"codename\":\"Verstage\",\"slug\":\"verstage\",\"problem_label\":\"The pizza tracker for your projects.\",\"solution_label\":\"Verstage is a lightweight status tracker for your work. You know how you can watch a pizza go from the oven to out-for-delivery to your door? Verstage does that for your projects. Your clients and teammates watch progress happen, stage by stage, in real time — no more juggling status emails, calls, and “any news yet?” messages.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/verstage/verstage-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$21e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$21f\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n221:[\"ai social media manager\",\"social media scheduling\",\"social media management\",\"social media automation\",\"local business marketing\",\"small business marketing\",\"marketing automation\",\"ai content generation\",\"multi-platform publishing\",\"brand voice ai\"]\n222:[]\n220:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T00:17:36.672925+00:00\",\"id\":17609,\"codename\":\"presly\",\"slug\":\"presly\",\"problem_label\":\"AI social media manager\",\"solution_label\":\"Presly is an AI social media manager built for local businesses. Tell it about your business and it learns your brand voice, then writes captions, designs images, and publishes to 10 platforms on the schedule you set. Messages, comments, and reviews arrive in one inbox with replies already drafted for you to review and send. Made for restaurants, salons, dental offices, gyms, and repair shops. From $39/month.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/presly/app_icon_512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$221\",\"icp_kws\":\"$222\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_t"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ype\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n224:[]\n225:[]\n223