odename\":\"T-Shirt Design AI\",\"slug\":\"tshirtdesignai\",\"problem_label\":\"AI-powered custom tee graphics for print on demand\",\"solution_label\":\"T-Shirt Design AI helps designers concept many directions fast. Explore styles and compositions in minutes from a single prompt, then take the best one into your own tools. Export transparent, print-ready PNGs at 300 DPI. Upload references to keep your visual language consistent, so your output stays on-brand for print-on-demand workflows.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tshirtdesignai/apple-touch-icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$23c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$23d\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n23f:[\"Competitor "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Intelligence\",\"Competitive Intelligence\",\"Demand Intelligence\",\"Buyer Intent\",\"Answer Engine Optimization\",\"AEO\",\"GEO\",\"AI Visibility\",\"Market Research\",\"Sales Intelligence\",\"Lead Generation\",\"SaaS\",\"GTM\",\"MCP\",\"Reddit\"]\n240:[]\n23e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T03:18:13.008008+00:00\",\"id\":17684,\"codename\":\"Linkeddit\",\"slug\":\"linkeddit\",\"problem_label\":\"All-in-One AI Demand and Competitor Intelligence Platform\",\"solution_label\":\"Linkeddit is an AI demand and competitor intelligence platform for SaaS teams, agencies, and founder-led sales. It monitors review sites like G2, Capterra, TrustRadius, and Trustpilot plus the open web, delivering weekly graded competitor briefs covering launches, pricing changes, complaint themes, and switching signals. Its AI-powered lead pipelines find buyers actively looking to switch and draft personalized outreach for each one, while Answer Radar shows where ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini recommend competitors instead of you, then helps you fix it.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/linkeddit/li