:44:09.245246+00:00\",\"id\":17833,\"codename\":\"Arelio API Gateway\",\"slug\":\"arelioapigateway\",\"problem_label\":\"The Only API Gateway That Goes Beyond Just the Runtime\",\"solution_label\":\"Arelio is a lightweight API gateway built to make deploying, managing, and scaling APIs simpler and faster.\\n\\nUnlike traditional gateways that operate as standalone infrastructure, Arelio is part of the wider DigitalAPI ecosystem. Your gateway, API catalogue, developer marketplace, analytics, governance, and connected API products work together as one integrated experience.\\n\\nTeams can quickly deploy APIs, apply policies, manage revisions and versions, monitor API traffic, and understand exactly what is happening across the API lifecycle without navigating complex gateway infrastructure.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/arelioapigateway/DAC-new-logo-png.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$279\",\"icp_kws\":\"$27a\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n27c:[\"invoice generator\",\"invoice template\",\"PDF invoice\",\"freelancer tools\",\"small business\",\"contractor invoice\",\"free tools\",\"no signup\",\"VAT invoice\",\"billing\"]\n27d:[]\n27b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T08:46:46.087296+00:00\",\"id\":17835,\"codename\":\"Invoice Paid\",\"slug\":\"invoicepaid\",\"problem_label\":\"Free invoice generator - no signup, no watermark\",\"solution_label\":\"Create professional invoices in your browser and download a clean PDF - no account, no email gate, no watermark stamped across the page. Pick from 16 templates built for specific trades (plumber, electrician, cleaner, photographer) and tax systems (UK VAT, UAE TRN), or start blank. Add your logo, tax line, and payment terms. The web tool is free forever; the iPhone app adds saved clients, estimates, and paid/unpaid tracking.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/invoicepaid/AppIcon-1024.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$27c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$27d\",\"market\":\"payments\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n27f:[\"File Sharing\",\"File Hosting\",\"Cloud Storage\",\"Privacy\",\"Secure File Sharing\",\"Anonymous Uploads\",\"Browser Encryption\",\"Team Collaboration\",\"Productivity\",\"SaaS\"]\n280:[]\n27e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T13:47:16.754021+00:00\",\"id\":17842,\"codename\":\"StashMyFile\",\"slug\":\"stashmyfile\",\"problem_label\":\"Clean, private file sharing without the clutter\",\"solution_label\":\"StashMyFile is a modern file-hosting service built for fast uploads, clean download pages, and straightforward sharing. Upload files without creating an account, or sign in to manage uploads, use optional browser-side encryption, access premium features, and collaborate through shared organization workspaces. Unlike cluttered file hosts filled with misleading buttons and aggressive advertising, StashMyFile emphasizes privacy, transparent limits, and a simple, trustworthy experience for both uploaders and recipients.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.mi"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"crolaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/stashmyfile/android-chrome-192x192.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$27f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$280\",\"market\":\"cloud\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n282:[\"buy guest posts\",\"guest post marketplace\",\"buy backlinks\",\"backlink marketplace\",\"link building service\",\"guest post service\",\"verified DA backlinks\",\"niche edit\",\"sponsored post marketplace\",\"white hat link building\"]\n283:[]\n281:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T15:34:18.983052+00:00\",\"id\":17844,\"codename\":\"Serpverse\",\"slug\":\"serpverse\",\"problem_label\":\"Rank higher on Google with verified content placements\",\"solution_label\":\"Serpverse is a marketplace for guest post placements on real, manually vetted websites — no fake metrics, no PBNs. Buyers browse verified DA/DR listings and funds sit in escrow until content is approved, with dispute coverage even if a link disappears later. Publishers keep 100% of their price, no commission.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/serpverse/android-chrome-512x512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$282\",\"icp_kws\":\"$283\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n285:[\"AI Assistant\",\"Lifestyle\",\"Local Discovery\",\"Travel Planning\",\"Productivity\"]\n286:[]\n284:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T17:21:01.365264+00:00\",\"id\":17846,\"codename\":\"Karpo\",\"slug\":\"karpo\",\"problem_label\":\"Karpo — a proactive AI assistant that lives in iMessage\",\"solution_label\":\"Karpo is a proactive AI assistant that brings personalized city recommendations directly to iMessage. Tell Karpo what you feel like doing, from finding a dinner spot or local event to planning a date night, group hangout, weekend, or trip. It learns from what you love and skip, making every suggestion more relevant over time. Karpo can uncover hidden gems, suggest experiences, coordinate plans in group chats, provide booking links, and help with everyday life admin. Free to star"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"t and especially knowledgeable about New York City, San Francisco, and London, Karpo easily turns vague ideas into plans worth leaving home for.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/karpo/LA-compressed.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$285\",\"icp_kws\":\"$286\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-wip\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n288:[\"AI\",\"Content Curation\",\"News\",\"Learning\",\"Productivity\",\"Video\"]\n289:[]\n287:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T21:52:14.720029+00:00\",\"id\":17851,\"codename\":\"Vibin\",\"slug\":\"vibin\",\"problem_label\":\"The home of AI builders.\",\"solution_label\":\"Vibin is a personalized signal feed for people building with AI. Follow the tools and creators you care about, and it finds useful updates, tutorials, and examples from across the internet, then organizes them by topic and skill level so you can understand what matters without checking a dozen feeds.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/vibin/vibin-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$288\",\"icp_kws\":\"$289\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n28b:[\"Social Media\",\"Marketing\",\"AI Tools\"]\n28c:[]\n28a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T23:12:14.439016+00:00\",\"id\":17852,\"codename\":\"SocialPreviewing\",\"slug\":\"socialpreviewing\",\"problem_label\":\"Preview profile photos, cover images and posts across social media platforms\",\"solution_label\":\"Upload your pfp, cover image or post and instantly preview them on tablet, mobile and desktop.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/socialpreviewing/brand-logo-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$28b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$28c\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n28e:[\"Decision-Making\",\"Business Intelligence\",\"Productivity\",\"Vendor Management\",\"HR Tools\",\"Finance Tools\",\"SaaS\"]\n28f:[]\n28d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T14:19:13."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"106103+00:00\",\"id\":17899,\"codename\":\"Claritrix\",\"slug\":\"claritrix\",\"problem_label\":\"Weighted decision scorecards for business teams\",\"solution_label\":\"Claritrix is a browser-based weighted decision scorecard tool for consultants, procurement managers, HR teams, and finance professionals. Pick from 18 templates across Business \u0026 Finance, HR \u0026 People, and Vendor \u0026 Risk, add your options, set weighted criteria, score, and get ranked results with a recommended winner. Export a branded PDF, live-formula Excel workbook, or plain CSV. Everything runs 100% client-side; nothing is uploaded. One-time lifetime purchase, not a subscription. Built solo, still early, shipping based on real feedback.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/claritrix/claritrix-icon-profile-picture.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$28e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$28f\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n291:[\"1. Flexible Google Maps Extraction\",\"2. Rich\",\"Export-Ready Business Data\",\"3. Built for Real Business Workflows\"]\n292:[]\n290:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T15:57:09.806701+00:00\",\"id\":17900,\"codename\":\"G Maps Extractor\",\"slug\":\"gmapsextractor\",\"problem_label\":\"Extract Google Maps business leads\",\"solution_label\":\"G Maps Extractor is a no-code Google Maps scraper for collecting local business data at scale. It extracts names, addresses, phone numbers, emails, websites, social profiles, ratings, reviews, photos, and other public listing details. Users can run jobs in the cloud or through a Chrome or Edge extension, then export structured results to CSV, Excel, or JSON for lead generation, local SEO, outreach, and market research.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/gmapsextractor/128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$291\",\"icp_kws\":\"$292\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n294:[\"Generate images\",\"videos\",\"and audio with leadi"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ng AI models\"]\n295:[]\n293:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T20:50:29.432642+00:00\",\"id\":17904,\"codename\":\"HighReach\",\"slug\":\"highreach-c3d072\",\"problem_label\":\"AI Creator Studio for Video \u0026 Image\",\"solution_label\":\"HighReach is an AI creative studio for turning ideas into production-ready images, videos, and audio. Generate, edit, and transform content with leading AI models and specialized tools, all in one simple workspace for creators, brands, and businesses.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/highreach-c3d072/logo_icon_imresizer.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$294\",\"icp_kws\":\"$295\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n297:[\"Knowledge Base\",\"Second Brain\",\"Productivity\"]\n298:[]\n296:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T00:39:08.958323+00:00\",\"id\":17905,\"codename\":\"Adviserry\",\"slug\":\"adviserry\",\"problem_label\":\"Adviserry gives you outcomes, not just content\",\"solution_label\":\"Adviserry give you outcomes, not just content. It reads newsletters and watches YouTube videos from the experts you follow, maps them to your goals, and delivers specific moves to take each week. Adviserry isn't a second brain that just stores what you remembered to capture. Adviserry brings you the moves you should be making on your projects this week, whether you captured it or not. It auto-ingests your subscriptions, builds a searchable archive, and remembers your work to sharpen advice over time. Get proactive daily digests and alerts, chat with your archive, and even query it from Claude Desktop or ChatGPT via MCP.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/adviserry/Advissery-Logo_no-text.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$297\",\"icp_kws\":\"$298\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n29a:[\"swing trading\",\"stock screener\",\"wedge pattern\",\"consolidation breakouts\",\"charting\",\"technical analysis\",\"backtesting\",\"crypto\",\"ETFs\",\"trend"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"lines\",\"alerts\",\"market research\"]\n29b:[]\n299:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T14:38:06.125676+00:00\",\"id\":17923,\"codename\":\"TradingPal\",\"slug\":\"tradingpal\",\"problem_label\":\"Find the setup. See the track record.\",\"solution_label\":\"TradingPal finds wedges, trendlines, and consolidation breakouts across stocks, crypto, and ETFs—the same kinds of setups successful momentum swing traders have built strategies around. Every qualifying setup comes with its historical win rate, expected R, profit factor, and drawdown.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tradingpal/company-logo-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$29a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$29b\",\"market\":\"fintech\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n29d:[]\n29e:[]\n29c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T16:15:11.507699+00:00\",\"id\":17926,\"codename\":\"File Changer\",\"slug\":\"filechanger\",\"problem_label\":\"Change The Format Of Your Files However You Want\",\"solution_label\":\"FileChanger is a file conversion API that actually speaks technical formats. Convert Typst, Org-mode, AsciiDoc, DocBook, Jira markup, LaTeX, reStructuredText and Markdown in any direction, plus DOCX, PDF, EPUB, images, audio and video, across 40+ formats. One POST with a from and to format returns the converted bytes, no SDK to learn. Large files run as async jobs, and a built-in MCP server lets AI agents convert files for you.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/filechanger/filechanger-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$29d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$29e\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2a0:[\"n8n\",\"Accounts Receivable\",\"QuickBooks\",\"Xero\",\"Cash Flow\",\"Workflow Automation\",\"Finance\",\"Automation\",\"AI Agents\",\"B2B SaaS\"]\n2a1:[]\n29f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T17:49:19.899424+00:00\",\"id\":17929,\"codename\":\"AutomateNow\",\"slug\":\"automatenow\",\"problem_label\":\"Automate invoice recovery with built-in human approval "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"control.\",\"solution_label\":\"AutomateNow connects n8n directly to QuickBooks, Xero, and FreshBooks to audit past-due receivables automatically. The engine categorizes aging invoices by urgency, triggering polite nudges or firm notices. For high-dollar or sensitive accounts, an interactive Human-in-the-Loop Wait Node emails owners a tap-to-approve gate before sending follow-ups to clients. Reclaim your trapped capital, eliminate weekly collection admin, and keep 100% operational control. Purchase turnkey blueprints at AutomateNow.app.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/automatenow/automatenowlogovector.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2a0\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2a1\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Self-Hosted\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2a3:[\"saas\",\"ai\",\"marketing automation\",\"product launch\",\"seo\",\"technical founders\",\"small teams\"]\n2a4:[]\n2a2:{\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T20:49:54.733976+00:00\",\"id\":17932,\"codename\":\"morket\",\"slug\":\"morket\",\"problem_label\":\"AI-driven marketing for technical founders\",\"solution_label\":\"Automates marketing tasks for solo and small-team SaaS founders.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/morket/morket.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2a3\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2a4\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2a6:[\"Landing Pages\",\"Conversion Optimization\",\"CRO\",\"SaaS\",\"AI\",\"Marketing\",\"Copywriting\",\"A/B Testing\"]\n2a7:[]\n2a5:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-01T17:35:29.539225+00:00\",\"id\":17958,\"codename\":\"LandingBoost\",\"slug\":\"landingboost\",\"problem_label\":\"Find what stops your landing page from converting\",\"solution_label\":\"LandingBoost scans any SaaS landing page, compares clarity, relevance, trust, and action signals with revenue-backed references, and identifies the single highest-leverage edit to make first. \\n\\nFounders get page-grounded evidence, a prioritized fix, and a paste-ready prompt so they can "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"improve the page, rescan it, and measure whether the conversion signal moved. It is built for SaaS founders, indie hackers, agencies, and small growth teams.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/landingboost/LB-logo-2.PNG\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2a6\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2a7\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2a9:[]\n2aa:[]\n2a8:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-02T14:50:49.118179+00:00\",\"id\":17980,\"codename\":\"Fiuto\",\"slug\":\"fiuto\",\"problem_label\":\"All you need for user research. No experience required.\",\"solution_label\":\"Fiuto runs your full research loop: writes the study, runs it with AI testers and real people, and turns what happened into findings and a deck you can share.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fiuto/fiutoavatarteallight.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2a9\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2aa\",\"market\":\"ui-ux\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2ac:[]\n2ad:[]\n2ab:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-02T20:46:27.026581+00:00\",\"id\":17986,\"codename\":\"Seedance 2.0\",\"slug\":\"seedance20-01e6fe\",\"problem_label\":\"Seedance2.ai Has Moved to Seevio.ai\",\"solution_label\":\"Seedance2.ai has officially migrated to Seevio.ai. Continue using Seedance 2.0 to generate high-quality AI videos from text prompts, images, videos, and audio references. Existing users can access their accounts, subscriptions, credits, generation history, and support through Seevio.ai. Please update your bookmarks and use Seevio.ai for all future video creation and account management.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/seedance20-01e6fe/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2ac\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2ad\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2af:[]\n2b0:[]\n2ae:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T02:00:15.515481+00:00\",\"id\":18018,\"codename\":\"OutReign\",\"slug\":\"outreign\",\"problem_label\":\"Find"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," who to sell to. Then close them.\",\"solution_label\":\"OutReign is a comprehensive sales operations software designed to empower outbound B2B teams by streamlining the entire sales workflow, from ideal customer definition to personalized outreach. It serves as a modern, all-in-one alternative to traditional tools like Apollo, Instantly, Outreach, and Salesloft, specifically built to support founder-led sales operations and growth teams.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/outreign/outreign-logo-transparent.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2af\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2b0\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n2b2:[\"Asset Management\",\"Developer Tools\",\"Image Optimization\",\"File Management\",\"CDN\",\"Cloud Storage\",\"API\",\"Media Management\",\"Digital Assets\",\"Versioning\",\"Asset Delivery\",\"Web Development\"]\n2b3:[]\n2b1:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:47:01.849201+00:00\",\"id\":18033,\"codename\":\"Smooth Bundle\",\"slug\":\"smoothbundle\",\"problem_label\":\"Publish assets once. Use them everywhere.\",\"solution_label\":\"Smooth Bundle is a developer-first platform for publishing, managing, optimizing, and delivering digital assets.\\n\\nUpload once, process automatically, organize versions and tags, protect sensitive files, and use the same assets across websites, mobile apps, CMS platforms, documentation, and other products.\\n\\nBuilt for solo developers, small frontend teams, and agencies that need something more reliable than a public folder, but less complicated than a full enterprise DAM.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/smoothbundle/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2b2\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2b3\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2b5:[\"reddit\",\"lead generation\",\"customer discovery\",\"indie hackers\",\"saas\",\"outreach\",\"intent scoring\",\"social listening\",\"founders\",\"marketing\"]\n2b6:[]\n2b4:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T15:25:"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"25.904456+00:00\",\"id\":18040,\"codename\":\"FindEvo\",\"slug\":\"findevo\",\"problem_label\":\"Find your first customers on Reddit without getting banned\",\"solution_label\":\"Reddit is full of founders describing the exact problem your product solves. FindEvo scans the subreddits that matter, scores every post by how close that person is to buying, and checks the rules of each community before you say anything. You get an intent score, a ban risk read, and a specific way to approach that one conversation. No generated messages. You write it in your own words.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/findevo/findevo-128x128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2b5\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2b6\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2b8:[\"AI\",\"AI Writing\",\"Text Humanizer\",\"Humanize AI\",\"AI Detector\",\"Content Writing\",\"SEO\",\"Paraphrasing\",\"Copywriting\",\"Content Marketing\"]\n2b9:[]\n2b7:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T16:10:24.13181+00:00\",\"id\":18042,\"codename\":\"Humanize Max\",\"slug\":\"humanizemax\",\"problem_label\":\"AI humanizer for natural text with best possible human-like result\",\"solution_label\":\"Humanize Max converts AI written text into humanized writing, which cannot be detected by any AI detection tools but maintains its readability and meaning. Best suited for students, marketers, bloggers, SEO experts, and organizations utilizing AI platforms such as ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/humanizemax/icon-128x128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2b8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2b9\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2bb:[\"AI \u0026 Assistants\",\"AI Roleplay\",\"AI Coach\",\"Sales Training\",\"Leadership Development\",\"Onboarding\",\"Team Training\",\"L\u0026D\",\"Corporate Training\",\"Employee Training\"]\n2bc:[]\n2ba:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T16:57:44.910503+00:00\",\"id\":18045,\"codename\":\"The Reflection\",\"slug\":\"thereflection\",\"problem_label\":\"AI ro"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"leplay training for growing teams, without enterprise cost\",\"solution_label\":\"Most corporate training platforms are built for large companies with dedicated L\u0026D teams. The Reflection brings the same AI roleplay simulations and knowledge base to teams of 3-20, without the setup time or enterprise price tag. New hires practice real sales calls, objection handling, and difficult conversations with an AI coach that gives structured feedback after every session, using a knowledge base built from your own docs and playbooks. Live within 24 hours, from €350/month.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/thereflection/TheReflection_io.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2bb\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2bc\",\"market\":\"hr-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2be:[\"Outdoor ad testing\",\"Billboard ad testing\",\"OOH ad testing\",\"Outdoor advertising testing\",\"Billboard readability\",\"Billboard clarity\",\"Billboard viewability\"]\n2bf:[]\n2bd:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T23:30:59.123773+00:00\",\"id\":18053,\"codename\":\"Ad Corrector\",\"slug\":\"adcorrector\",\"problem_label\":\"Test clarity and visibility of outdoor ad creative.\",\"solution_label\":\"Ad Corrector helps you review billboard and outdoor ad creative for clarity, visibility, and impact. Upload your design and get a quick visual check showing what stands out, what gets overlooked, and how your ad reads at real-world viewing distance. Built for advertisers, designers, and brands who want outdoor ads that communicate clearly and perform in fast-moving environments.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/adcorrector/IMG_4625.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2be\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2bf\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2c1:[\"ai video\",\"video\"]\n2c2:[]\n2c0:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-05T13:43:29.217734+00:00\",\"id\":18086,\"codename\":\"Minimax h3\",\"slug\":\"minimaxh3\",\"problem_label\":\"2K AI video with native sound an"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"d instruction-based editing\",\"solution_label\":\"MiniMax H3 is an AI video generator combining multimodal understanding, 2K resolution, native audio, and instruction-based editing in one model.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/minimaxh3/favicon-96x96.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2c1\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2c2\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2c4:[\"cold email\",\"sales automation\",\"AI agents\",\"MCP\",\"CRM\",\"email deliverability\",\"B2B leads\"]\n2c5:[]\n2c3:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-05T20:06:56.656477+00:00\",\"id\":18095,\"codename\":\"JaxSuite\",\"slug\":\"jaxsuite\",\"problem_label\":\"AI cold outreach and CRM for startups\",\"solution_label\":\"JaxSuite is an AI-native cold outreach and CRM platform that helps startups land their first 100 customers without hiring an SDR team. Launch campaigns in under 15 minutes, reach 300M+ verified B2B contacts, and average 42% open rates with built-in warmup and spam testing. MCP-native: Claude and other AI agents can run your entire outbound motion. Startups get 50% off their first year.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/jaxsuite/jaxsuite-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2c4\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2c5\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2c7:[\"trading journal\",\"trading\",\"risk management\",\"prop firm\",\"trading psychology\",\"broker sync\",\"analytics\",\"fintech\",\"discipline\",\"AI coach\"]\n2c8:[]\n2c6:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-05T21:39:07.281256+00:00\",\"id\":18098,\"codename\":\"Tradoshi\",\"slug\":\"tradoshi\",\"problem_label\":\"The trading journal that shows what your habits cost.\",\"solution_label\":\"Tradoshi is a trading journal that turns your trades into decisions.\\nConnect one broker account for free, forever, no card, or just drop in\\na statement. You get your real risk per trade, R-multiple, expectancy\\nand drawdown, an Oshi Score that rates your discipline, a pre-session\\ncheck-in that flags"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," the days you shouldn't trade, and an AI coach that\\nnames the habits costing you money.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tradoshi/tradoshi-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2c7\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2c8\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2ca:[\"AI Image Generator\",\"AI Video Generator\",\"AI Chat\",\"AI Audio Generator\",\"Multimodal AI Platform\"]\n2cb:[]\n2c9:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T03:28:48.762496+00:00\",\"id\":18101,\"codename\":\"AIGenTools\",\"slug\":\"aigentools\",\"problem_label\":\"All-in-one AI platform for chat, image, video \u0026 audio\",\"solution_label\":\"AIGenTools is an AI platform for chat, image, video, and audio creation, powered by the latest models from the major AI labs. Chat with leading models, generate and edit images, and create video and audio — with new models added as they launch. \",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aigentools/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2ca\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2cb\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2cd:[\"request manager\",\"http\",\"smtp\",\"imap\",\"ldap\",\"dns\",\"smb\",\"kerberos\",\"spamd\",\"mysql\",\"spamassassin\",\"mongodb\",\"postgresql\",\"testing\",\"qa\",\"automation\",\"mcp\",\"integration\"]\n2ce:[]\n2cc:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T12:35:17.984253+00:00\",\"id\":18115,\"codename\":\"VirtuProbe Studio\",\"slug\":\"virtuprobestudio\",\"problem_label\":\"Testing workbench with multi-protocol support, chaining, scripting and MCP Server.\",\"solution_label\":\"Cross-protocol request workbench for integration and penetration testing. 11 protocols, local-first, no account needed. Put your tests together on your own or supervise your agent helping you achieve your goals via MCP. Chain your tests or script your scenarios in JS or Groovy. Free tier covers HTTP, DNS and SMTP testing.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/virtuprobestudio/logodagger256.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2cd\","])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"icp_kws\":\"$2ce\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Self-Hosted\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2d0:[]\n2d1:[]\n2cf:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T13:37:37.366927+00:00\",\"id\":18117,\"codename\":\"GoldMine\",\"slug\":\"goldmine\",\"problem_label\":\"Autonomous AI marketing agent for solopreneurs and small teams\",\"solution_label\":\"GoldMine AI is an autonomous online marketing agent designed for solopreneurs and small teams. It acts as a dedicated business brain—your \\\"Cortex\\\"—that learns and adapts to your marketing needs over time.\\n\\nRather than managing every detail manually, you focus on high-level decisions: approving recommendations, providing feedback, and making strategic choices. The AI handles the execution of campaigns, optimization, and ongoing learning from results.\\n\\nIdeal for founders and lean teams looking to scale their marketing without hiring a full in-house team.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/goldmine/goldmyne-logo-light.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2d0\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2d1\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2d3:[\"AI\",\"Restaurant Technology\",\"SaaS\",\"Digital Menu\",\"QR Code Menu\",\"Online Ordering\",\"Food Tech\",\"No-Code\",\"Automation\",\"Multilingual\"]\n2d4:[]\n2d2:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T14:11:24.474659+00:00\",\"id\":18119,\"codename\":\"MenuForma \",\"slug\":\"menuforma\",\"problem_label\":\"QR Menu \u0026 Online Ordering\",\"solution_label\":\"Turn any menu into a QR ordering system with multilingual support and Google review collection\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/menuforma/logo_square_640.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2d3\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2d4\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2d6:[\"sports analytics\",\"sports betting\",\"prediction markets\",\"monte carlo simulation\",\"mlb\",\"wnba\",\"csgo\",\"kalshi\",\"sports predictions\",\"data ana"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"lytics\"]\n2d7:[]\n2d5:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-08T08:47:26.460346+00:00\",\"id\":18158,\"codename\":\"Gambling_Degen\",\"slug\":\"gamblingdegen\",\"problem_label\":\"Sports predictions from 10,000 simulations, not gut feel\",\"solution_label\":\"NexGame Lite runs 10,000 Monte Carlo simulations per game to generate win probabilities and player prop projections across MLB, WNBA, and CS2. Built-in NexBet compares model output against de-vigged Kalshi market pricing to surface real edges. Every prediction is publicly tracked and verified on Veri.bet — no cherry-picked results. Free daily pick via newsletter, paid tiers unlock full slates and player props.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/gamblingdegen/nexgame_lite_icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2d6\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2d7\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2d9:[\"Resume Builder\",\"Cover Letter\",\"Job Search\",\"Job Application\",\"Career\",\"Job Hunting\",\"AI\",\"Productivity\",\"Resume\",\"SaaS\"]\n2da:[]\n2d8:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-08T15:30:43.894068+00:00\",\"id\":18164,\"codename\":\"LightningApply\",\"slug\":\"lightningapply\",\"problem_label\":\"Land more interviews, in a flash.\",\"solution_label\":\"Applying to 20 jobs shouldn't mean writing 20 resumes. Paste any job posting and LightningApply gives you a tailored resume and cover letter in minutes, formatted, polished, and ready to send.\\n\\nIt works from your real experience, so nothing gets invented and no job title you never held ends up on the page. Pick from different layouts and color themes, edit anything, and restyle without starting over.\\n\\nAny industry, any role.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/lightningapply/favicon-no-bg.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2d9\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2da\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2dc:[\"AI\",\"Customer support\",\"Knowledge base\",\"Cloudflare\",\"Shared inbox\"]\n2dd:[]\n2db:{\"created_at\":\"202"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"6-08-08T17:37:48.125627+00:00\",\"id\":18169,\"codename\":\"DobroDesk\",\"slug\":\"dobrodesk\",\"problem_label\":\"Support inbox with AI replies and no seat fees\",\"solution_label\":\"Email and website chat in one support inbox. DobroDesk uses a project's FAQ and help docs to draft replies or automatically handle simple repeated questions. People take over when a conversation needs context or judgment.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/dobrodesk/logo-mark.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2dc\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2dd\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2df:[\"AI Assistant\",\"AI Agent\",\"Chatbot\",\"Customer Support\",\"No-Code\",\"Automation\",\"WhatsApp\",\"Customer Service\",\"SaaS\",\"Omnichannel\"]\n2e0:[]\n2de:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-08T17:39:48.416572+00:00\",\"id\":18170,\"codename\":\"Invent\",\"slug\":\"invent\",\"problem_label\":\"Every channel, one AI brain, a tenth of the price.\",\"solution_label\":\"Invent turns your customer operation into one AI brain. Build a no-code assistant that answers from your data, then put it on WhatsApp, Instagram, web chat, SMS, and every channel you use, all flowing into one inbox. It remembers every customer, hands tricky conversations to your team, and sends broadcasts that sell. Pick your AI model and swap anytime. Setup takes minutes, plans start free, and pricing runs a tenth of Intercom's.\\n\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/invent/frame-375434.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2df\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2e0\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2e2:[\"SEO\",\"Content Marketing\",\"Blogging\",\"SEO Automation\",\"Keyword Research\",\"Backlinks\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Organic Traffic\",\"Content Creation\",\"Marketing Automation\"]\n2e3:[]\n2e1:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-09T13:30:21.716212+00:00\",\"id\":18196,\"codename\":\"SEObeast\",\"slug\":\"seobeast\",\"problem_label\":\"Your 24/7 AI SEO content team\",\"solution_label\":\"SEOBeast autom"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ates your SEO from keyword research to published, search optimized articles. Create and publish content consistently, discover backlink exchange opportunities, and connect Google Search Console to track performance and uncover new growth opportunities. Built for startups and businesses that want to grow organic traffic without spending hours managing SEO.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/seobeast/logo-icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2e2\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2e3\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2e5:[\"AI video\",\"text to video\",\"image to video\",\"video generator\",\"creator tools\",\"marketing videos\",\"social media content\",\"ecommerce video\",\"cinematic AI\"]\n2e6:[]\n2e4:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-10T08:10:46.807067+00:00\",\"id\":18211,\"codename\":\"MInimax H3\",\"slug\":\"minimaxh3-b4a6b7\",\"problem_label\":\"Create cinematic AI videos from text and media\",\"solution_label\":\"Minimax H3 AI Video Generator helps creators, marketers, designers, and ecommerce teams generate short 2K AI videos from text prompts, images, video clips, audio, and first or last frame references.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/minimaxh3-b4a6b7/logo_h3.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2e5\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2e6\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2e8:[\"AI Music Generator\",\"AI Song Maker\",\"AI Music Remixer\",\"AI Song Cover\",\"AI Vocal Remover\",\"AI Stem Splitter\",\"AI Lyrics Generator\"]\n2e9:[]\n2e7:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-10T08:13:29.504884+00:00\",\"id\":18212,\"codename\":\"LumiMusic\",\"slug\":\"lumimusic\",\"problem_label\":\"Create any music you can imagine.\",\"solution_label\":\"LumiMusic is an all-in-one AI music creation platform that transforms your ideas, text prompts, or lyrics into complete vocal and instrumental tracks—no production experience required.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"lumimusic/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2e8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2e9\",\"market\":\"music\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2eb:[\"S3\",\"Cloud Storage\"]\n2ec:[]\n2ea:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-10T18:28:35.816669+00:00\",\"id\":18229,\"codename\":\"Storage Donut\",\"slug\":\"storagedonut\",\"problem_label\":\"One app. Any S3 storage.\",\"solution_label\":\"Your files belong to you. Not your storage provider.\\n\\nStorage Donut brings Cloudflare R2, Amazon S3 and more into one cloud drive. \\n\\nBrowse every bucket in one place, move files between providers, share them with anyone, stream audio and video, edit Markdown, view spreadsheets and manage your storage from anywhere.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/storagedonut/Donut-white-background.webp\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2eb\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2ec\",\"market\":\"cloud\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n2ee:[\"analytics\",\"web analytics\",\"privacy\",\"gdpr\",\"cookieless\",\"saas\"]\n2ef:[]\n2ed:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-11T21:39:03.852161+00:00\",\"id\":18259,\"codename\":\"Statable\",\"slug\":\"statable\",\"problem_label\":\"Cookieless web analytics hosted in the EU\",\"solution_label\":\"Statable is cookieless web analytics for people who want clear numbers without the compliance overhead. No cookies means no consent banner, so you count every visitor instead of only those who click Accept. The tracker is about 2.1 KB, with a 471-byte build. Data is processed in the EU by a Dutch company. Plans start at $9/month for 10,000 pageviews, pooled across unlimited websites rather than charged per site.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/statable/logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2ee\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2ef\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n2f1:[]\n2f2:[]\n2f0:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T16:46:37.944321+00:00\",\"id\":18276,\"codename\":\"Clatree\",\"slug\":\"c"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"latree\",\"problem_label\":\"Know the moment your checkout breaks.\",\"solution_label\":\"Clatree provides continuous, automated testing of your entire e-commerce checkout process, simulating real customer behavior around the clock. This ensures that every step, from adding items to the cart through to the final place-order button, is functioning correctly.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/clatree/clatree_logo_main_bg.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2f1\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2f2\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2f4:[\"\\\"WordPress\\\"\",\"\\\"WordPress Plugin Finder\\\"\",\"\\\"Jira Plugin Finder\\\"\",\"\\\"Quiz Based Plugin Finder\\\"\",\"\\\"WordPress Plugin Recommendations\\\"\"]\n2f5:[]\n2f3:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T16:47:42.573134+00:00\",\"id\":18277,\"codename\":\"find-right-plugin\",\"slug\":\"findrightplugin\",\"problem_label\":\"Find the right plugin in 60 seconds\",\"solution_label\":\"Find Right Plugin is a free quiz that matches you to WordPress and Jira plugins based on your actual problem and role — not a generic top 10 list. Answer a few quick questions and get a ranked shortlist across 9 WordPress categories and 66 plugins, with honest free-tool picks shown alongside paid ones, and every affiliate link disclosed.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/findrightplugin/findrightplugin-icon-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2f4\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2f5\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2f7:[\"English speaking practice\",\"IELTS speaking\",\"AI feedback\",\"Pronunciation coaching\",\"Language learning\"]\n2f8:[]\n2f6:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-13T01:48:22.341171+00:00\",\"id\":18287,\"codename\":\"witspeak\",\"slug\":\"witspeak\",\"problem_label\":\"AI English speaking coach with instant feedback\",\"solution_label\":\"WitSpeak is an AI English speaking coach for iPhone and Android that helps learners build real spoken fluency. You answer ev"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"eryday conversation and IELTS-style prompts out loud, then get instant AI feedback on fluency, vocabulary, grammar, and pronunciation, plus a stronger example answer to study. With 70+ roleplay scenarios, live AI speaking sessions, pronunciation coaching, and a personalized practice plan, WitSpeak makes daily speaking practice possible anytime, anywhere. Built by ZenithNexus AI.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/witspeak/ChatGPT-Image-Jul-24-2026-05_21_07-PM.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2f7\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2f8\",\"market\":\"edtech\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2fa:[\"website monitoring\",\"uptime monitoring\",\"synthetic monitoring\",\"API monitoring\",\"browser monitoring\",\"website testing\",\"checkout monitoring\",\"form monitoring\",\"developer tools\",\"agency tools\"]\n2fb:[]\n2f9:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-13T15:35:02.428827+00:00\",\"id\":18302,\"codename\":\"CrawlPanel\",\"slug\":\"crawlpanel\",\"problem_label\":\"Know if your website works, not just if it’s online.\",\"solution_label\":\"CrawlPanel monitors more than whether your website is online. Track uptime and APIs, then run real browser journeys through critical flows like forms, logins, carts and checkout. When something breaks, CrawlPanel shows you the exact failed step, screenshot and technical context you need to investigate quickly. Built for developers, freelancers and agencies managing websites where “up” doesn’t always mean “working.”\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/crawlpanel/763018604_122105681589416267_8943064168006143257_n.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2fa\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2fb\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n2fd:[\"AI tutor\",\"Education\",\"Study assistant\",\"Homework help\",\"Exam prep\",\"Personalized learning\",\"Flashcards\",\"Multilingual\",\"Students\",\"EdTech\"]\n2fe:[]\n2fc:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-13T22:36:46.562923+00:00\",\"id\":18311,\"codename\":\"LemonSug"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ar Ai\",\"slug\":\"lemonsugarai\",\"problem_label\":\"Your AI tutor that remembers your weak spots\",\"solution_label\":\"LemonSugar Ai is a personalized AI tutor for students. Snap a homework problem, type a question, or ask by voice to get step-by-step explanations in your language and preferred learning style. It then creates custom quizzes, tracks weak spots, schedules review before exams, and supports test prep. Students can start free, with a paid plan for higher limits and advanced study features.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/lemonsugarai/lemonsugar-icon-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$2fd\",\"icp_kws\":\"$2fe\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n300:[\"revenue analytics\",\"subscription analytics\",\"mrr breakdown\",\"AI-powered charts\",\"daily business briefing\",\"track churn rate\",\"subscription analytics\",\"custom dashboard\",\"custom reports\",\"mrr goals\",\"marketing channels\",\"Stripe and Paddle integrations\"]\n301:[]\n2ff:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T07:33:29.05155+00:00\",\"id\":18325,\"codename\":\"Chartsy\",\"slug\":\"chartsy\",\"problem_label\":\"Find out which marketing channels drive your revenue\",\"solution_label\":\"Chartsy helps you see which marketing channels impact your MRR, churn and more.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/chartsy/Chartsy-Logo-Square.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$300\",\"icp_kws\":\"$301\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n303:[\"Job Search\",\"Career\",\"Resume Builder\",\"CV Builder\",\"Cover Letter\",\"Career Tools\",\"Job Loss\",\"Career Restart\",\"Resume Templates\",\"AI Career Tools\"]\n304:[]\n302:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T10:35:40.433351+00:00\",\"id\":18333,\"codename\":\"Tailero\",\"slug\":\"tailero\",\"problem_label\":\"Everything you need to get back to work.\",\"solution_label\":\"Tailero is a free career toolkit designed to help people move from job loss to their next opportunity. Create professional CVs, cov"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"er letters and career documents, follow practical Restart guidance after losing a job, and get country-specific resources for your job search. Tailero brings the essential tools and next steps into one place, helping you understand what to do next and get back to work faster.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tailero/LogoTailero3.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$303\",\"icp_kws\":\"$304\",\"market\":\"hr-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n306:[\"logo maker\",\"brand identity\",\"visual design\",\"AI design\",\"branding\",\"banner maker\",\"social media design\",\"no prompt\",\"founder tools\",\"small business\"]\n307:[]\n305:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T12:08:42.823748+00:00\",\"id\":18334,\"codename\":\"Qwelto\",\"slug\":\"qwelto\",\"problem_label\":\"Pick what you like. Qwelto builds the rest.\",\"solution_label\":\"Qwelto helps you make a logo and matching brand assets without writing design prompts. Start with a set of visual options and pick the ones that feel closest to what you want. Qwelto learns from those choices and uses the same direction for banners, website cards and social posts. Logos are free to create and download. The $29 Founder Pass unlocks the rest of the brand kit.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/qwelto/qwelto-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$306\",\"icp_kws\":\"$307\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n309:[\"AI Presentation Generator\",\"AI Documents Generator\",\"AI Forms\",\"AI Voice Assistants\"]\n30a:[]\n308:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T13:12:34.112757+00:00\",\"id\":18336,\"codename\":\"WZRD\",\"slug\":\"wzrd\",\"problem_label\":\"AI workspace for creating interactive, voice-enabled documents, forms, slides, and business experiences\",\"solution_label\":\"WZRD is an AI workspace for creating interactive slides, documents, sheets, forms, proposals, and business experiences. Users describe an outcome in natural language, and WZR"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"D generates structured content that can include AI guidance, voice interactions, questions, explanations, responses, signatures, file collection, and engagement tracking. It helps turn static documents and forms into conversational, guided experiences that can be published, shared, embedded, and measured without code.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/wzrd/IMG_8423.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$309\",\"icp_kws\":\"$30a\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n30c:[\"people management\"]\n30d:[]\n30b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T19:51:39.192385+00:00\",\"id\":18348,\"codename\":\"Mora\",\"slug\":\"mora\",\"problem_label\":\"Your 1:1s, prepped and remembered — automatically\",\"solution_label\":\"Mora drafts your 1:1 agenda before every meeting, keeps private notes during, and writes the recap after — so nothing gets lost between one conversation and the next. No account needed for your reports. Opening access Sept 2026.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/mora/Logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$30c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$30d\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n30f:[\"AI-agents\",\"Security\"]\n310:[]\n30e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-15T02:18:26.01663+00:00\",\"id\":18355,\"codename\":\"Custodian Labs Python SDK\",\"slug\":\"custodian-labs-python-sdk\",\"problem_label\":\"Deploy secure AI-agents in minutes.\",\"solution_label\":\"Fastest way to deploy AI-agents, securely.\\n\\nCustodian Labs makes it easy to connect leading AI models, add your own data, and launch single or multi-agent workflow, without complex infrastructure or compromising sensitive data.\\n\\n⚡ Go from prototype to deployment in minutes\\n🤖 Connect different AI models without vendor lock-in\\n🔒 Protect private data with our proprietary Guardian Layer algorithm without compromising AI effectiveness\\n🇳🇿 Supported by New Zealand Government funding\\n\\nBuild f"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"aster. Protect sensitive data. Deploy AI with confidence.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/custodianlabspythonsdk/Custodian-Webclip.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$30f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$310\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n312:[\"AI\",\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"e-commerce\",\"shopping assistant\"]\n313:[]\n311:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-15T17:57:04.201679+00:00\",\"id\":18374,\"codename\":\"TickClip: Buyer-First AI Shopping Assistant | Buy, Wait or Skip\",\"slug\":\"projectfiduciary\",\"problem_label\":\"TickClip is the buyer-first AI shopping assistant that checks price history, product signals, and seller risk before you spend.\",\"solution_label\":\"TickClip is an AI-powered shopping decision platform designed to protect consumers rather than push them toward a purchase. Instead of simply recommending products, TickClip analyzes factors such as price history, deal quality, product value, seller credibility, reviews, alternatives, and market signals to deliver a clear Tick, Clip, Skip\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/projectfiduciary/IMG_7309.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$312\",\"icp_kws\":\"$313\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n315:[\"reading\",\"podcasts\",\"research\",\"knowledge-management\",\"pocket-alternative\"]\n316:[]\n314:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-16T08:17:03.332344+00:00\",\"id\":18386,\"codename\":\"Omphalis\",\"slug\":\"omphalis-3db412\",\"problem_label\":\"The center of your understanding\",\"solution_label\":\"Articles, podcasts, videos and PDFs come in messy. They come out as one calm page with the structure made visible.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/omphalis-3db412/omphalis-logo-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$315\",\"icp_kws\":\"$316\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n318:[]\n319:[]\n317:{\"cre"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ated_at\":\"2026-08-16T10:22:47.430434+00:00\",\"id\":18391,\"codename\":\"FAQ Hub\",\"slug\":\"faqhub\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn your docs into grounded AI customer support.\",\"solution_label\":\"FAQ Hub turns scattered product knowledge into reliable, customer-ready support. Import PDFs, DOCX files, Markdown, or website content, then review and approve what goes live. Customers get grounded answers through AI chat, an inline help portal, or a hosted help centre. When sources cannot support an answer, FAQ Hub stops safely and hands the conversation to a human. Built for founders and lean SaaS teams, with simple, predictable monthly pricing.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/faqhub/Square_Logo_240.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$318\",\"icp_kws\":\"$319\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n31b:[\"fraud prevention\",\"visitor identification\",\"anonymity detection\",\"vpn detection\",\"proxy detection\",\"Bot detection\",\"Ai agent detection\",\"anti-detect browser detection\",\"traffic analytics\",\"api\"]\n31c:[]\n31a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-16T10:58:24.045251+00:00\",\"id\":18392,\"codename\":\"ShieldLabs\",\"slug\":\"shieldlabs\",\"problem_label\":\"Fraud detection and prevention with traffic quality scoring\",\"solution_label\":\"Fraud detection and prevention with traffic quality scoring, using visitor identification and anonymity detection with up to 99% accuracy. Stops multi-accounting, account sharing, fake signups and ad fraud.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/shieldlabs/ShieldLabs-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$31b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$31c\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n31e:[\"image to 3d model\"]\n31f:[]\n31d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T01:02:42.752047+00:00\",\"id\":18410,\"codename\":\"Image to 3D AI\",\"slug\":\"imageto3dai\",\"problem_label\":\"Convert Text \u0026 Images to High-Quality 3D Models in Seconds.\",\"solution_label\":\"Image to 3D AI lets you g"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"enerate high-quality 3D models from images or text in seconds. Free, fast, and perfect for dev, model designer.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/imageto3dai/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$31e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$31f\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n321:[\"voip\",\"international-calls\",\"calling-app\",\"no-signup\",\"ios-app\",\"expats\",\"travel\",\"roaming\",\"prepaid\",\"telephony\"]\n322:[]\n320:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T08:32:07.747108+00:00\",\"id\":18442,\"codename\":\"Telvio\",\"slug\":\"telvio\",\"problem_label\":\"Cheap international calls, no roaming, no sign-up\",\"solution_label\":\"Calling an ordinary phone number in another country is still a rip-off. Telvio is a small iPhone app for cheap international calls to real landlines and mobiles over WiFi or data - the other side just answers their normal phone, no app needed. There is no sign-up at all: no email, no password. You buy minutes once, they never expire, billing is per second, and the first minute is free.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/telvio/android.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$321\",\"icp_kws\":\"$322\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n324:[\"ai-learning-roadmap\",\"ml-math-curriculum\",\"systems-research-hub\"]\n325:[\"ai-education\",\"ml-engineering\",\"systems-architecture\",\"robotics-learning\",\"technical-upskilling\"]\n323:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T08:47:11.72071+00:00\",\"id\":18443,\"codename\":\"Fanout\",\"slug\":\"fanout\",\"problem_label\":\"Fanout: Daily-mapped AI learning, from theory to practical labs\",\"solution_label\":\"Fanout organizes advanced learning across AI research, system design, and ML math into clear, connected roadmaps. It combines daily papers, labs, and explanations to help engineers turn complex theory into practical, production-ready skills\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/fanout/logo.png\",\"nich"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"e_kws\":\"$324\",\"icp_kws\":\"$325\",\"market\":\"edtech\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n327:[\"Publish 3 SEO-optimized blog posts a day\",\"hands-off\"]\n328:[]\n326:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T11:20:11.341783+00:00\",\"id\":18447,\"codename\":\"Structura\",\"slug\":\"structura-e4187d\",\"problem_label\":\"Publish 3 SEO-optimized blog posts a day, hands-off \",\"solution_label\":\"Structura runs the whole publishing lifecycle unattended: research, strategy, writing, authority links, images, a 20+ point SEO protocol, and publishing. Output is real Gutenberg blocks, not pasted HTML. Publishes to WordPress natively or to any stack via a Content API.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/structura-e4187d/b1c66b81-b4eb-4437-877c-149202ac244e.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$327\",\"icp_kws\":\"$328\",\"market\":\"no-code\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"idea\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n32a:[\"context-compressor\",\"coding-agent-middleware\",\"token-spend-optimizer\"]\n32b:[\"dev-tools\",\"ai-ops\",\"developer-productivity\",\"llm-engineering\",\"cost-optimization\"]\n329:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T18:40:04.387752+00:00\",\"id\":18452,\"codename\":\"Codag AI\",\"slug\":\"codag-ai\",\"problem_label\":\"Slash coding-agent costs—one command, same dev workflow.\",\"solution_label\":\"Codag reduces coding-agent token costs by compacting noisy tool output into only the critical lines your AI needs. It attaches to Claude Code and Codex with one command, preserving existing workflows while delivering around 75% context comp\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/codag-ai/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$32a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$32b\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n32d:[\"llm aggregation\",\"multi-provider api\",\"ai inference gateway\"]\n32e:[\"developer apis\",\"ai infrastructure\",\"llm routing\",\"enterprise security\",\"cost optimization\"]\n32c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T18:41:15.414903+00:00"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\",\"id\":18453,\"codename\":\"Straitly AI\",\"slug\":\"straitly-ai\",\"problem_label\":\"143 models, zero markup—plus 30% off starting now.\",\"solution_label\":\"Straitly unifies access to 140+ LLMs behind one OpenAI-compatible API with zero token markup. It automatically routes requests for better uptime, latency, and cost while enforcing zero data retention and SOC 2 Type II controls for productio\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/straitly-ai/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$32d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$32e\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n330:[\"A personal wellbeing platform that guides you on your path to feeling better.\"]\n331:[]\n32f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T10:42:59.511985+00:00\",\"id\":18474,\"codename\":\"aelívra\",\"slug\":\"aelivra\",\"problem_label\":\"A personal wellbeing platform that guides you on your path to feeling better, for people whose health problems don't have an easy answer - one that moves with your life, notices which parts are actually helping, and helps you feel better faster.\",\"solution_label\":\"Nourishment\\nPersonalised goodness recipes guiding you through all health needs.\\n\\nSymptoms\\nEffortless symptom tracking, say goodbye to manual logging.\\n\\nMovement\\nGuided movement and exercises routines that heal your soul, and your body.\\n\\nBiomarkers\\nBiomarker lab result tracking and insights across your key health markers.\\n\\nMindfulness\\nGuided meditations across breathwork, mindfulness, sleep, and relaxation.\\n\\nWearables \u0026 Records\\nYour whole health picture dynamically shaping your plan.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aelivra/48adc0f2-c6d5-455d-ae56-6ee5d8b355a9.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$330\",\"icp_kws\":\"$331\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n333:[\"imessage job assistant\",\"ai job hunter\",\"automated job applier\"]\n334:[\"job search\",\"career automation\",\"job hunting\",\"resume optimization\","])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"recruiting tech\"]\n332:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T13:19:58.480023+00:00\",\"id\":18478,\"codename\":\"KleoKlaw\",\"slug\":\"kleoklaw\",\"problem_label\":\"Your iMessage AI that finds jobs and customizes resumes\",\"solution_label\":\"KleoKlaw is an AI job search agent that works entirely through iMessage, finding matching roles, tailoring your resume, and submitting applications you approve. It discovers positions on supported employer systems, manages accounts securely\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/kleoklaw/logo-placeholder.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$333\",\"icp_kws\":\"$334\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n336:[\"agent connector\",\"social feed aggregator\",\"loginwall bypass\"]\n337:[\"social listening\",\"api integrations\",\"growth marketing\",\"creator analytics\",\"agent infrastructure\"]\n335:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T13:22:03.469611+00:00\",\"id\":18479,\"codename\":\"Monid AI\",\"slug\":\"monid-ai\",\"problem_label\":\"Live social insight, four feeds, one ultra‑cheap AI call\",\"solution_label\":\"Monid lets AI agents read TikTok, Instagram, Reddit, and YouTube live through one skill, bypassing login walls and captchas. It delivers structured social data on a per-look basis for a fraction of subscription listening costs, enabling con\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/monid-ai/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$336\",\"icp_kws\":\"$337\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n339:[\"hackathon management\",\"event management\",\"hackathon platform\",\"team formation\",\"jury scoring\",\"participant registration\",\"submissions\",\"leaderboard\",\"certificates\",\"white label\",\"live-events\",\"mentoring\",\"check-in\"]\n33a:[]\n338:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T14:51:44.483613+00:00\",\"id\":18485,\"codename\":\"HackathonHost\",\"slug\":\"hackathonhost\",\"problem_label\":\"Run your whole hackathon under your own brand — registration to certificates — for one flat price per event.\",\"solution_label\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,":\"HackathonHost is an all-in-one platform for running hackathons, demo days and team-based competitions — from registration to results. Organizers get one branded space to collect sign-ups, build teams, run judging against custom criteria, control the live event with timers and projector views, reveal results and rewards, and issue certificates with QR verification. Plus email broadcasts, surveys, exports and analytics. It runs white-label under your own brand and you pay $99 per event with no subscription.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/hackathonhost/hackathonhost-app-icon-1024.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$339\",\"icp_kws\":\"$33a\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n33c:[\"AI App Builder\",\"No-Code\",\"Low-Code\",\"Prompt to App\",\"Cloud Development\",\"AI Code Generation\",\"Smart Home\",\"Rapid Prototyping\",\"Conversational Development\",\"Web App Builder\"]\n33d:[]\n33b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T10:05:47.961717+00:00\",\"id\":18519,\"codename\":\"Tuya AI Coding\",\"slug\":\"tuyaaicoding\",\"problem_label\":\"Build apps from ideas, with AI\",\"solution_label\":\"Tuya AI Coding is an AI-powered platform that turns natural language into fully functional, cloud-hosted apps. Simply describe what you want to build, and it generates working code in real time — supporting Web, H5, Mobile App, and Tuya Applet. With multiple leading AI models, production-ready templates, and conversational iteration, go from idea to live preview in minutes and refine through natural dialogue.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/tuyaaicoding/tuya-coding-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$33c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$33d\",\"market\":\"mvp-builders\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n33f:[\"product-hunt\",\"launch\",\"founders\",\"indie-hackers\",\"accountability\",\"community\",\"growth\",\"marketing\",\"saas\",\"networking\",\"launch-day\",\"startup-tools\"]\n340:[]\n33e:{\"cr"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"eated_at\":\"2026-08-20T10:57:48.132467+00:00\",\"id\":18520,\"codename\":\"LaunchPact\",\"slug\":\"launchpact\",\"problem_label\":\"Find support for your Product Hunt launch from fellow founders\",\"solution_label\":\"Match with founders who commit to supporting your launch — and actually follow through.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/launchpact/launchpact-logo-1200-white.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$33f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$340\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n342:[\"Virtual Tour\",\"360°\",\"Panorama\",\"Real Estate\",\"Interactive\",\"Self-Hosted\",\"Cloud\",\"SaaS\",\"AI\",\"Photography\"]\n343:[]\n341:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T12:46:54.806615+00:00\",\"id\":18526,\"codename\":\"Simple Virtual Tour\",\"slug\":\"simplevirtualtour\",\"problem_label\":\"Unlimited 360° virtual tours: Self-hosted or Cloud.\",\"solution_label\":\"Create professional virtual tours with full flexibility and no limits 🚀 Choose Self-Hosted 🗄️ with a one-time payment for complete ownership and control, or Cloud hosting ☁️ for a ready-to-use managed solution. Build unlimited immersive tours through an intuitive backend designed for speed and simplicity. Extend your platform with AI tools, Google Street View export, and SaaS plugins to scale into a real virtual tour business.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/simplevirtualtour/logo.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$342\",\"icp_kws\":\"$343\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Self-Hosted\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n345:[\"Kling 4.0\",\"Kling 4.0 AI Video Generator\"]\n346:[]\n344:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T14:57:37.732548+00:00\",\"id\":18530,\"codename\":\"Kling 4 video generator\",\"slug\":\"kling4videogenerator\",\"problem_label\":\"Create Cinematic Video from Text \u0026 Images\",\"solution_label\":\"Turn text or images into multi-shot, cinematic video — with director-grade control, physically real motion, native audio, and consistent characters across shots"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,". Powered by the newest Kling AI model. Free to try, no account needed.\\n\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/kling4videogenerator/180x180.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$345\",\"icp_kws\":\"$346\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n348:[\"startup contracts\",\"privacy agreements\",\"hipaa documentation\"]\n349:[\"legaltech\",\"startups\",\"compliance\",\"contracts\",\"opensource\"]\n347:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T15:06:40.792192+00:00\",\"id\":18531,\"codename\":\"Legal Templates\",\"slug\":\"legal-templates\",\"problem_label\":\"Free, attorney-crafted legal templates you can use anywhere.\",\"solution_label\":\"General Legal’s GitHub repository provides attorney-drafted legal templates for startups and tech companies, in Markdown and .docx, under a CC0 license. It covers core contracts like NDAs, DPAs, privacy policies, and MSAs so teams can launc\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/legal-templates/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$348\",\"icp_kws\":\"$349\",\"market\":\"oss\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n34b:[\"Marketing automation\",\"outreach automation\",\"lead generation\",\"social selling\",\"AI agent\",\"Reddit marketing\",\"social listening\",\"growth automation\",\"customer acquisition\",\"MCP\",\"browser extension\",\"brand monitoring\",\"LinkedIn automation\",\"X automation\",\"founder tools\",\"SaaS marketing\"]\n34c:[]\n34a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T16:58:23.315058+00:00\",\"id\":18535,\"codename\":\"ReplyHey\",\"slug\":\"replyhey\",\"problem_label\":\"Get Customers from Reddit on Autopilot\",\"solution_label\":\"Automate your Reddit, X and LinkedIn Marketing\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/replyhey/icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$34b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$34c\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n34e:[\"Revenue recovery\",\"Failed payment recovery\",\"AI recovery assistant\",\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Stripe\",\"Square\"]\n34f:[]\n34d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:20:21.646779+00:00\",\"id\":18537,\"codename\":\"Recoura\",\"slug\":\"recoura\",\"problem_label\":\"Recover the revenue your payment processor gave up on\",\"solution_label\":\"Recoura offers manual and automatic recovery of failed payments for revenue that Stripe and Square give up on. It includes custom email templates, multi-currency support, custom recovery sequences, an AI recovery assistant (optional AI generated recovery emails, tailored to your business), and analytics to help with recovery campaigns. It supports failed payments across invoices, subscriptions, and one-off payments, and is one of the few recovery tools supporting Square.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/recoura/icon-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$34e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$34f\",\"market\":\"fintech\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n351:[\"Grocery Tracking\",\"Receipt Scanner\",\"Expense Tracking\",\"Personal Finance\",\"Grocery Budget\",\"Food Waste\",\"Spending Tracker\",\"Receipt Scanning\",\"Grocery Spending\",\"Food Management\"]\n352:[]\n350:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-21T05:04:12.834471+00:00\",\"id\":18545,\"codename\":\"Ripn\",\"slug\":\"ripn\",\"problem_label\":\"Track grocery spending and food waste from receipts\",\"solution_label\":\"Ripn is a grocery tracking app that turns receipts into spending data. Take a photo of your receipt and Ripn automatically reads the items, prices, categories, and dates. See where your grocery money goes, keep track of what may expire, and record what you throw away. It helps you understand both how much you spend on groceries and how much of that money ends up wasted.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/ripn/Ripn-1024-x-2000-px-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$351\",\"icp_kws\":\"$352\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n354:[\"business rules engine\",\"rules engine\",\"expression language"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\",\"saas\",\"automation\",\"natural language\"]\n355:[]\n353:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-22T11:06:31.847118+00:00\",\"id\":18597,\"codename\":\"GoRules\",\"slug\":\"gorules\",\"problem_label\":\"Business logic humans can read and machines can run\",\"solution_label\":\"Every company keeps two copies of its business logic: a document people read and code that runs. They drift. GoRules keeps one copy. Rules read like sentences, live in visual graphs or policy documents, and ship with reviews, releases, and tests. The open-source ZEN engine (MIT, Rust) answers your API, your agents, and your batch jobs in about 10 microseconds. An AI copilot builds and explains rules; people release. Cloud, self-hosted, or embedded.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/gorules/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$354\",\"icp_kws\":\"$355\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n357:[\"ai\",\"content\",\"transcription tool\"]\n358:[]\n356:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T06:15:45.937551+00:00\",\"id\":18647,\"codename\":\"Viraldrop \",\"slug\":\"viraldrop\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn every viral video into your unfair advantage\",\"solution_label\":\"Converts a link to any public TikTok, Reels, or YouTube Shorts video into a transcript, an explanation of why the video went viral, and a rewritten script adapted to a different brand's voice.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/viraldrop/ViralDrop_Logo_1.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$357\",\"icp_kws\":\"$358\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n35a:[\"audio transcription\",\"video transcription\",\"transcription\",\"speech to text\",\"video to text\",\"audio to text\",\"pay-as-you-go\",\"speaker diarization\",\"speaker identification\",\"productivity\"]\n35b:[]\n359:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T09:48:56.358031+00:00\",\"id\":18656,\"codename\":\"Hushscript\",\"slug\":\"hushscript\",\"problem_label\":\"Privacy-first, pay-as-you-go transcription\",\"solution_lab"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"el\":\"Hushscript is privacy-first, audio and video transcription service without a subscription. Video stays on your device, audio isn't kept after processing, and transcripts are stored encrypted. Free speaker identification with labels, AI insights, and transcript cleanup. Transcribe in 99 languages with top-tier accuracy, and handle specialist recordings with dictionaries, keyterms, custom prompts, medical mode, and multichannel support. Translate the result and export it in 21 formats.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/hushscript/avatar-512.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$35a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$35b\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n35d:[\"education\",\"home ed\",\"home education\",\"homeschool\",\"home ed tracker\",\"home education tracker app\"]\n35e:[]\n35c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T10:23:58.758635+00:00\",\"id\":18660,\"codename\":\"Strew Home Ed Tracking App\",\"slug\":\"strewhomeedtrackingapp\",\"problem_label\":\"The easy way to document home education.\",\"solution_label\":\"Strew is a simple home education app that helps parents capture learning without the paperwork. Quickly log activities, projects, books, trips and everyday moments, while optional AI identifies learning outcomes and helps organise your records. Over time, Strew builds a clear picture of your child’s education and turns it into professional, ready-to-share PDF reports in minutes, leaving you more time for the learning itself.\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/strewhomeedtrackingapp/strew-home-ed-logging-app-white-500.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$35d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$35e\",\"market\":\"edtech\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n360:[\"voice dictation\",\"speech transcription\",\"voice editing\"]\n361:[\"productivity\",\"voicetech\",\"writing\",\"multilingual\",\"knowledgework\"]\n35f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T21:25:38.702229+00:00\",\"id\":18684,\"codename\":\"VoiceCursor A"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"I\",\"slug\":\"voicecursor-ai\",\"problem_label\":\"Speak naturally, watch flawless text appear everywhere you write.\",\"solution_label\":\"Voice Cursor turns natural speech into polished writing across your favorite tools, with context-aware transcription, intelligent voice editing, and automatic formatting. It lets you rewrite, translate, and adjust tone by voice, so you can \",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/voicecursor-ai/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$360\",\"icp_kws\":\"$361\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"other\",\"offer_type\":\"\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":false}\n363:[\"AI\",\"video calls\",\"AI avatars\",\"creator economy\",\"SaaS\",\"marketplace\",\"live video\",\"coaching\",\"monetization\",\"AI twin\"]\n364:[]\n362:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T18:40:00.130031+00:00\",\"id\":18711,\"codename\":\"Twinly Lab\",\"slug\":\"twinlylab\",\"problem_label\":\"You can't be everywhere. Your AI twin can.\",\"solution_label\":\"Twinly Lab is a live-video AI twin marketplace. Creators, coaches, and influencers deploy an AI version of themselves — face, voice, and knowledge — that fans can book for paid 1:1 video consultations. These are real video calls, not chatbots, and they run 24/7 without the creator needing to be present.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/twinlylab/Generated-Image-June-09-2026-1_30AM.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$363\",\"icp_kws\":\"$364\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n366:[\"youtube transcript\",\"transcript generator\",\"youtube to text\",\"video to text\",\"subtitles\",\"srt download\",\"captions\",\"transcription\",\"mcp server\",\"ai summary\"]\n367:[]\n365:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T19:00:04.914435+00:00\",\"id\":18712,\"codename\":\"YouTube Transcript AI\",\"slug\":\"youtubetranscriptai\",\"problem_label\":\"Free YouTube transcript generator — extract, copy, download\",\"solution_label\":\"YouTube Transcript AI extracts the complete transcript from any YouTube video in seconds. Paste a URL and get cle"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"an, readable text — no sign-up, no limits. Download as TXT or SRT, copy with one click, translate to 100+ languages, or ask AI questions about the video. Works with auto-generated and manual captions, and handles videos without captions through AI transcription. Also available as an MCP server for AI agents.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/youtubetranscriptai/logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$366\",\"icp_kws\":\"$367\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n369:[\"Gamification\",\"Habit Tracking\",\"Accountability\",\"Social\",\"Challenges\",\"Creator Economy\",\"Community\"]\n36a:[]\n368:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T23:10:45.904691+00:00\",\"id\":18719,\"codename\":\"StreakWars\",\"slug\":\"sw\",\"problem_label\":\"Daily proof challenges. Last streak standing wins.\",\"solution_label\":\"Turn any daily goal into a last-person-standing competition. Join a War, post proof before each deadline, and keep your streak alive. Miss once and you're out; the last eligible player wins.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/sw/streakwars-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$369\",\"icp_kws\":\"$36a\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n36c:[]\n36d:[]\n36b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T10:22:58.853897+00:00\",\"id\":18731,\"codename\":\"PIGPR\",\"slug\":\"pigpr\",\"problem_label\":\"Reputation on Radar\",\"solution_label\":\"\\\"PigPR watches your brand's reputation across reviews, news, social and AI answers — weekly reports, backlink tracking and competitor ad alerts. Start free.\\\"\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/pigpr/pigpr-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$36c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$36d\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n36f:[\"Website Builder\",\"Visual Web Design\",\"No Code Website Builder\",\"iPad Native App\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"370:[]\n36e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T14:16:49.36976+00:00\",\"id\":18737,\"codename\":\"Sitely iPad AI+Visual Website Builder\",\"slug\":\"sitelyipadaivisualwebsitebuilder\",\"problem_label\":\"The power and simplicity of Sitely is now available on iPad!\",\"solution_label\":\"It seemed impossible but we did it: Sitely AI+Visual Website Builder is now on the iPad!\\n\\nIf you already use Sitely on your Mac, you’ll feel right at home. If you’re new to Sitely, you’ll enjoy its power and simplicity, and its seamless integration with iPadOS features and UI. Everything you could do on a Mac, you can now do on your iPad—and more, with Apple Pencil and touch.\\n\\nFrom your first idea to a published website, you can now take Sitely with you wherever you go.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/sitelyipadaivisualwebsitebuilder/icon_1024-light.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$36f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$370\",\"market\":\"mvp-builders\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n372:[\"AI design\",\"vector graphics\",\"SVG generator\",\"logo maker\",\"illustration\",\"mascot creator\",\"background removal\",\"image vectorizer\",\"API\",\"MCP\"]\n373:[]\n371:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:32:43.235974+00:00\",\"id\":18748,\"codename\":\"CleanVector\",\"slug\":\"cleanvector\",\"problem_label\":\"Create professional illustrations, logos, and reusable mascots\",\"solution_label\":\"CleanVector is an AI design workspace for creating professional illustrations, logos, icons, and complete visual systems from a prompt. Create a mascot once, then reuse the same character across new scenes, poses, and visual styles while keeping it recognizable. Refine colors and shapes in a focused editor, build complete logo kits, and export production-ready SVG or transparent PNG assets for websites, apps, campaigns, and products. API and MCP access are available for automated workflows.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/cleanvector/cleanvector-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$372\",\"icp_kws\":\"$"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"373\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n375:[]\n376:[]\n374:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-27T12:55:14.956317+00:00\",\"id\":18778,\"codename\":\"voiceslab\",\"slug\":\"voiceslab\",\"problem_label\":\"Free AI Voice Cloning\",\"solution_label\":\"Clone your voice from a short audio sample while preserving your natural tone, accent, and speaking style. Create realistic voiceovers, podcasts, videos, and more in your own voice\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/voiceslab/logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$375\",\"icp_kws\":\"$376\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n378:[]\n379:[]\n377:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T00:21:34.38184+00:00\",\"id\":18790,\"codename\":\"Macless\",\"slug\":\"macless\",\"problem_label\":\"$$99 once. No Mac, ever.\",\"solution_label\":\"Macless walks you through connecting your GitHub repo, then handles code signing, building, and uploading your iOS or Android app to TestFlight or Google Play automatically. No Mac required, no Xcode, no terminal, no monthly CI subscription. One-time $99, or use the free Signing Doctor tool to diagnose signing errors on its own.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/macless/maclessfavicon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$378\",\"icp_kws\":\"$379\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n37b:[\"1.Data Extraction / Data Scraping\",\"2.Web Scraping\",\"3.Google Maps Tools / Maps Tools\",\"4.Business Data / Data Collection\"]\n37c:[]\n37a:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T02:18:57.642264+00:00\",\"id\":18793,\"codename\":\"Free Google Maps Extractor \u0026 Scraper with Email | GMPlus\",\"slug\":\"freegooglemapsextractorscraperwithemailgmplus\",\"problem_label\":\"Extract Google Maps Business Data with Emails\",\"solution_label\":\"Free Google Maps Extractor \u0026 Scraper to collect business names, phones, websites, available emails, ratings and mo"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"re, then export results to CSV, XLSX, or JSON. No code, no extension required.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/freegooglemapsextractorscraperwithemailgmplus/Dan-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$37b\",\"icp_kws\":\"$37c\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n37e:[\"AI Video generator\",\"Explainer video\",\"motion graphics\",\"ai video maker\",\"talking head video editor\"]\n37f:[]\n37d:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T11:28:02.177563+00:00\",\"id\":18807,\"codename\":\"TapVid\",\"slug\":\"tapvid-49ead3\",\"problem_label\":\"TapVid \",\"solution_label\":\"TapVid turns the materials you already have into a video that explains things clearly and accurately, with shot-level editing, batch production, REST API, and MCP access.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/tapvid-49ead3/tapvid-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$37e\",\"icp_kws\":\"$37f\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n381:[\"Quant trading\",\"Automated trading\",\"Backtesting\",\"Risk management\",\"Market research\",\"Trading infrastructure\",\"Fintech\"]\n382:[]\n380:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T05:54:01.050408+00:00\",\"id\":18830,\"codename\":\"Felix Trade\",\"slug\":\"felixtrade\",\"problem_label\":\"Run your own quant trading desk, built on Arc\",\"solution_label\":\"Felix is a quant trading platform for developing, backtesting, and running systematic strategies. Research markets, test performance and drawdowns, set capital and risk limits, and monitor automated execution from one workspace. Felix Trade launches September 22 on Arc.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/felixtrade/felix-trade-microlaunch-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$381\",\"icp_kws\":\"$382\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n384:[\"AI Website Builder\",\"SEO Automation\",\"GEO\",\"AI Visibility\",\"No Code\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,",\"Website Localization\",\"International SEO\",\"Multilingual Website\",\"Own Cloud Deployment\",\"Agency Tools\"]\n385:[]\n383:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T10:37:09.146543+00:00\",\"id\":18838,\"codename\":\"PolyDraft\",\"slug\":\"polydraft\",\"problem_label\":\"AI website builder with continuous SEO and GEO\",\"solution_label\":\"PolyDraft is an AI website builder that turns a business brief or existing URL into a researched, responsive, production-ready site. After launch, it keeps finding SEO, GEO, internal-linking, content, and localization opportunities, prepares improvements in context, and lets you review every change before publishing. Build and preview for free, deploy to your own domain and cloud, and grow across up to 100 languages without juggling separate website, SEO, and localization tools.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/polydraft/polydraft-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$384\",\"icp_kws\":\"$385\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n387:[\"MCP Server\",\"Developer Tools\",\"AI Agents\",\"Screen Recording\",\"Audio\",\"Diarization\",\"Meetings\",\"OCR\",\"Local-First\",\"Open Source\"]\n388:[]\n386:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T20:11:52.58202+00:00\",\"id\":18852,\"codename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"slug\":\"talkthrough\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn recordings into searchable evidence for coding agents\",\"solution_label\":\"Talkthrough is a local-first MCP server that turns screen recordings, audio, and long multi-speaker meetings into searchable evidence for coding agents. It indexes transcripts, exact frames, OCR, wall-clock timestamps, and optional speaker diarization, so agents can triage bugs, analyze incidents, extract specifications, decisions, and action items, and answer who said what with timestamped proof. Recordings stay on your machine, with no runtime telemetry.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/talkthrough/talkthrough-logo.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$387\",\"icp_kws\":\"$388\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Self-Hosted\","])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n38a:[\"Reviews\",\"Companies\",\"Brands\",\"Complaints\",\"Funny\",\"Restaurants\",\"Shops\",\"Sentiment\",\"Bad\",\"Rage\",\"Vent\"]\n38b:[]\n389:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-30T19:35:04.824686+00:00\",\"id\":18867,\"codename\":\"Grumble\",\"slug\":\"grumble\",\"problem_label\":\"The Bad Reviews App\",\"solution_label\":\"Grumble is a place for discovering and sharing honest, bad reviews about brands business and public services! We're all about fighting shitification \u0026 giving power back to consumers. Users can post complaints, photos, videos, and stories, and connect with others through likes, comments, and shares and see the rage visualized in real time!\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/grumble/grumble_gradiant.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$38a\",\"icp_kws\":\"$38b\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n38d:[\"aeo\",\"ai-seo\",\"geo\",\"ai-visibility\",\"llm-monitoring\",\"brand-monitoring\",\"chatgpt\",\"competitor-analysis\",\"marketing-analytics\",\"seo-tools\"]\n38e:[]\n38c:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T08:53:11.708286+00:00\",\"id\":18878,\"codename\":\"CiteGraph\",\"slug\":\"citegraph\",\"problem_label\":\"Get your product mentioned by AI assistants\",\"solution_label\":\"CiteGraph measures which products AI assistants actually recommend. It asks the real questions buyers type into AI across four engines (ChatGPT family, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity), repeatedly, and reports how often you are named, who wins instead, and which pages the engines cite. Every rate carries a margin of error. Each scan ends with the specific missing sentence that would put you in the answer, drafted and ready to edit.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/citegraph/microlaunch-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$38d\",\"icp_kws\":\"$38e\",\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n390:[\"Developer Tool"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"s\",\"SaaS\",\"DevOps\",\"Analytics\",\"Infrastructure\",\"Web Development\",\"Sysadmin\"]\n391:[]\n38f:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T12:03:50.383086+00:00\",\"id\":18893,\"codename\":\"PixoMonitor\",\"slug\":\"pixomonitor\",\"problem_label\":\"Multi-location uptime monitoring, cron tracking, and server agents.\",\"solution_label\":\"An all-in-one developer infrastructure suite. PixoMonitor handles 1-minute uptime checks across global locations, custom status pages, cron heartbeats, and background server agents. To celebrate our launch week, we are giving away 10 permanently free Pro Accounts to our first 10 qualified Discord testers who deploy a monitor and provide raw technical feedback. Head to our site to join the launch group!\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/pixomonitor/product-hunt-thumbnail-240.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$390\",\"icp_kws\":\"$391\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n393:[\"ad intelligence\",\"competitor research\",\"facebook ads\",\"tiktok ads\",\"ad spy\",\"ad library\",\"marketing analytics\",\"competitive intelligence\",\"mcp\",\"ai agent\"]\n394:[]\n392:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T12:33:00.437199+00:00\",\"id\":18894,\"codename\":\"spytrend\",\"slug\":\"spytrend\",\"problem_label\":\"Competitor ad intelligence for Facebook and TikTok\",\"solution_label\":\"SpyTrend is ad intelligence for Facebook and TikTok. Instead of reviewing ads one at a time, it links the accounts, pages and landing domains behind a single advertiser into one profile, so you research a whole competitor at once: the creatives in rotation, the countries they target, and how long each ad has run. Over 1.1B ads are auto-sorted into 33 categories and 343 subcategories. Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Codex or VS Code over MCP and research in plain language\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/spytrend/spytrend-logo-128.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$393\",\"icp_kws\":\"$394\",\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"g"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"rowing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n396:[\"AI website hosting\",\"free website hosting\",\"ChatGPT website\",\"Claude website\",\"Gemini website\",\"small business website\",\"no-code hosting\",\"marketing tools\",\"landing page hosting\",\"website conversion\"]\n397:[]\n395:{\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T20:57:33.324846+00:00\",\"id\":18906,\"codename\":\"AI Website Hosting for Marketers and Business Owners\",\"slug\":\"aiwebsitehostingformarketersandbusinessowners\",\"problem_label\":\"AI website hosting built for marketers, not engineers.\",\"solution_label\":\"Builderall AI Site Hosting is free hosting for websites built with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, or Meta AI. Where Vercel and Cloudflare Pages are built for developers who deploy from Git, Builderall is built for marketers and small business owners who just want more leads and sales. Upload it and it's on a free Builderall subdomain in minutes, no github, no command line, no APIs. Builderall also offers a host of integrated marketing tools within the platform.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/aiwebsitehostingformarketersandbusinessowners/logo_icon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$396\",\"icp_kws\":\"$397\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n399:[\"api\",\"developer-tools\",\"saas\",\"marketplace\",\"data\",\"backend\",\"integration\",\"automation\",\"no-code\",\"geolocation\",\"validation\",\"currency\",\"web-scraping\",\"compliance\"]\n39a:[]\n398:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T00:58:09.654998+00:00\",\"id\":18911,\"codename\":\"dataandapis\",\"slug\":\"dataandapis\",\"problem_label\":\"One subscription. Every API.\",\"solution_label\":\"dataandapis.com is a self-serve API marketplace built for developers who'd rather ship than negotiate. One token-based subscription unlocks the entire catalog: geolocation, data validation, currency rates, HTML rendering, SSL checks, sanctions screening, device databases and more. No per-API contracts, no sales calls, no surprise invoices. Sign up, grab your key, and call your first endpoint in un"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"der a minute. Utility APIs at prices that make building it yourself the expensive option.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/dataandapis/Twitter-profile-photo-2-1-.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$399\",\"icp_kws\":\"$39a\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n39c:[\"AI Workflow Automation\",\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"AI Agents\",\"Productivity\",\"Business Intelligence\"]\n39d:[]\n39b:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T03:56:58.08115+00:00\",\"id\":18914,\"codename\":\"Ergofect\",\"slug\":\"ergofect\",\"problem_label\":\"Automate Smarter. Grow Faster.\",\"solution_label\":\"Ergofect builds the automation layer that sits on top of the CRM, helpdesk, and spreadsheets you already run. No new platform, no migration, no long contract.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/ergofect/ergofect-avatar.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$39c\",\"icp_kws\":\"$39d\",\"market\":\"productivity\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n39f:[\"fitness\",\"gamification\",\"walking\",\"motivation\",\"habit\",\"fun\",\"engaging\",\"social\"]\n3a0:[]\n39e:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T09:20:10.501052+00:00\",\"id\":18920,\"codename\":\"reTrek\",\"slug\":\"retrek\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn your everyday walks into adventures\",\"solution_label\":\"reTrek is a mobile app that turns your everyday walking into a journey along a famous trail. Pick the Camino de Santiago, Everest Base Camp, the Inca Trail or a story-driven quest, then walk in real life. Every step moves you along the route, and each milestone unlocks a short film about the place you have reached. Walk solo, team up, or race your friends.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/retrek/favicon-192.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$39f\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3a0\",\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3a2:[\"website-builder\",\"opensource"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\",\"free\",\"no-code\"]\n3a3:[]\n3a1:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T19:38:56.327992+00:00\",\"id\":18935,\"codename\":\"MeridianOS\",\"slug\":\"meridianos\",\"problem_label\":\"free no-code website builder that makes your site look like a retro OS\",\"solution_label\":\"MeridianOS is a free, no code portfolio website builder that makes your site look and work like a vintage computer’s operating system. Visitors boot into a desktop with a nested file system, image galleries, blog posts, audio/video files, password protected folders, built-in Applications and more.. All showcasing your work.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/meridianos/globe-badge-1-.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3a2\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3a3\",\"market\":\"no-code\",\"product_type\":\"Self-Hosted\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3a5:[\"Developer Tools\",\"SaaS\",\"AI\",\"Productivity\",\"Design Tools\",\"react\",\"system design\",\"code-generation\",\"mcp\",\"ai-agents\"]\n3a6:[]\n3a4:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T19:55:50.750687+00:00\",\"id\":18936,\"codename\":\"Nodlume\",\"slug\":\"nodlume\",\"problem_label\":\"System design for cross-platform React apps\",\"solution_label\":\"Design the full system of a React app — pages, data models, API routes, agents — for Web, desktop, mobile, CLI, and browser extensions.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/nodlume/Screenshot-2026-08-31-141312.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3a5\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3a6\",\"market\":\"dev-tools\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"mvp-wip\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3a8:[\"social media design\",\"design inspiration\",\"swipe file\",\"launch visuals\",\"product marketing\",\"visual references\"]\n3a9:[]\n3a7:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T23:58:47.749272+00:00\",\"id\":18940,\"codename\":\"Posts Design\",\"slug\":\"postsdesign\",\"problem_label\":\"Mobbin for social media post designs\",\"solution_label\":\"posts.design is a hand-picked gallery of real social post visuals from leading companies and their designers. See all the biggest and new announcements"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," but also dive into historical content - announcements, opengraph images, hiring, launches and more feed-native references.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/postsdesign/posts.design.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3a8\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3a9\",\"market\":\"social-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3ab:[\"SEO\",\"AI\",\"Developer Tools\",\"Claude Skills\",\"CLI\"]\n3ac:[]\n3aa:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-02T02:05:11.0768+00:00\",\"id\":18943,\"codename\":\"SEOAgent\",\"slug\":\"seoagent\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn your Grok Bot into a full-time SEO engineer\",\"solution_label\":\"Turn your Grok Bot, Claude Code, Codex, or Cursor agent into a full-time SEO engineer.\\n\\nSEOAgent lives in your repo. It audits your site and search results, researches competitors and keywords, writes articles and landing pages, and does outreach for backlinks. You review every change before it ships.\\n\\nFree Skill forever. Autopilot is $49/site/month after a $1 7-day trial.\\n\\nInstall: npm install -g @seoagent-official/seoagent \u0026\u0026 seoagent init\\nWebsite: https://seoagent.com\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/seoagent/microlaunch-logo.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3ab\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3ac\",\"market\":\"seo\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3ae:[\"Productivity\",\"AI\",\"AI Tools\"]\n3af:[]\n3ad:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-02T02:13:39.460648+00:00\",\"id\":18944,\"codename\":\"Open Portal\",\"slug\":\"openportal\",\"problem_label\":\"Screenshots that answer back.\",\"solution_label\":\"Fastest way to ask AI about anything on your screen. Box anything on your screen. Get an answer, or a finished thumbnail, ad, or redesign.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/openportal/stripeopenportalpremium.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3ae\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3af\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Desktop App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"is_premium\":true}\n3b1:[\"Indie Makers\",\"Product Discovery\",\"Startup Directory\",\"Founder Community\",\"Build in Public\",\"SaaS\",\"Indie Hackers\",\"Startup Tools\",\"Founder Networking\",\"Product Marketing\"]\n3b2:[]\n3b0:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-02T09:44:59.611074+00:00\",\"id\":18953,\"codename\":\"IndieTools\",\"slug\":\"indietools\",\"problem_label\":\"Discover products. Follow founders. Keep building.\",\"solution_label\":\"IndieTools is a discovery platform for independent products and the founders behind them. Makers can list their products for free, build founder profiles, share product updates, follow other builders, connect through direct messages, and stay discoverable beyond launch day. Products live in an organically ranked directory, while optional paid features provide additional exposure without changing organic rankings.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logo-001/indietools/favicon.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3b1\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3b2\",\"market\":\"directories\",\"product_type\":\"Directory, Store or Marketplace\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3b4:[\"home inventory app\",\"home inventory for insurance\",\"how to document belongings for wildfire\",\"home inventory app California\",\"wildfire preparedness home inventory\",\"how to create a home inventory list\",\"home inventory app for insurance claims\",\"best home inventory app 2026\",\"home inventory app for renters\",\"Sortly alternative\",\"Sortly pricing alternative\",\"home inventory checklist for insurance claim\"]\n3b5:[]\n3b3:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-02T09:53:56.298139+00:00\",\"id\":18955,\"codename\":\"WIPI\",\"slug\":\"wipi\",\"problem_label\":\"Your Voice-Powered Home Inventory \u0026  Asset Tracker\",\"solution_label\":\"The only AI-powered inventory and asset assistant that uses vision and voice to track your home, workspace, or job site in seconds.\\nNever lose anything again.\\n\\nSay It \\n\\nSnap It \\n\\nFind It\\n\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/wipi/New-WIPI-Logo_Color.jpeg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3b4\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3b5\",\"marke"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"t\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Lifetime deal\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3b7:[]\n3b8:[]\n3b6:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-02T21:51:10.346612+00:00\",\"id\":18964,\"codename\":\"Add Car Widgets\",\"slug\":\"addcarwidgets\",\"problem_label\":\"Widgets, startup sounds \u0026 synced lyrics for CarPlay\",\"solution_label\":\"Add Car Widgets makes Apple CarPlay yours. Add eleven home-screen widgets — photos, weather, music, a GPS speedometer and more — swap the default connection chime for a custom startup sound, and see time-synced lyrics from Apple Music and Spotify. No CarPlay in your car? Mount Mode turns your iPhone into a big-tile driving dashboard. Built for iOS 16.2+, tuned for iOS 26. Free to try; on the App Store as Car Play Connect: Auto Sync.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/addcarwidgets/Frame-25.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3b7\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3b8\",\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"established\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3ba:[\"AI image generator\",\"AI video generator\",\"generative AI\",\"content creation\",\"design tools\",\"text to image\",\"image to video\",\"AI music\",\"AI speech\",\"developer API\"]\n3bb:[]\n3b9:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T02:05:31.043612+00:00\",\"id\":18965,\"codename\":\"BudgetPixel AI\",\"slug\":\"budgetpixelai\",\"problem_label\":\"Create images, videos, audio, and designs with AI\",\"solution_label\":\"BudgetPixel AI is an all-in-one creative workspace for generating and editing images, videos, music, speech, and design assets. It gives creators, marketers, agencies, and developers access to leading AI models through one shared credit balance. Users can compare models, upscale results, remove backgrounds, train custom LoRAs, build designs on a visual canvas, and connect automated workflows through its API and MCP integration.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/budgetpixelai/logo-square.jpg\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3ba\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3bb\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\","])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3bd:[\"Workforce Management\",\"Employee Scheduling\",\"Time Tracking\",\"Time and Attendance\",\"Employee Time Clock\",\"GPS Time Tracking\",\"Task Management\",\"HR Software\",\"Frontline Workforce\",\"Deskless Workforce\"]\n3be:[]\n3bc:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T03:03:10.77414+00:00\",\"id\":18967,\"codename\":\"Teamsly\",\"slug\":\"teamsly\",\"problem_label\":\"AI workforce management: scheduling, time tracking, tasks, frontline teams\",\"solution_label\":\"Teamsly is AI-powered, all-in-one workforce management software for hourly, shift-based, frontline, deskless, and field teams. Build schedules, track time and attendance with GPS and geofencing, manage timesheets, PTO, jobs and crews, assign recurring tasks with photo proof, collect forms and audits, train employees, and keep teams connected through chat and announcements. Replace spreadsheets, paper timecards, group texts, and disconnected workforce apps with one web and mobile platform.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/teamsly/Teamsly_square_White.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3bd\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3be\",\"market\":\"hr-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3c0:[\"AI tools\",\"AI directory\",\"Software discovery\",\"Artificial intelligence\",\"AI characters\",\"Chatbots\",\"SaaS\",\"Product discovery\",\"Startup tools\",\"Developer tools\"]\n3c1:[]\n3bf:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T10:11:30.493866+00:00\",\"id\":18977,\"codename\":\"ToolScope\",\"slug\":\"toolscope\",\"problem_label\":\"Discover AI tools and create unique AI characters\",\"solution_label\":\"ToolScope is an AI discovery platform that helps users find, evaluate and review useful AI tools across a wide range of categories. Visitors can explore detailed listings, follow products and discover new solutions, while founders can submit tools, claim their pages and verify ownership. ToolScope also features interactive AI characters that users can chat with or create and customise, bringing software disc"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"overy and AI interaction together in one platform.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/toolscope/Screenshot-2026-09-03-102536.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3c0\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3c1\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Web Tool/App\",\"offer_type\":\"Free product\",\"stage\":\"mvp-ready\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3c3:[\"AI Assistant\",\"Productivity\",\"Task Management\",\"Time Tracking\",\"Focus\",\"To-Do List\",\"Time Management\",\"Procrastination\",\"Personal Productivity\",\"Desktop App\"]\n3c4:[]\n3c2:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T11:36:39.47903+00:00\",\"id\":18980,\"codename\":\"Vulpie.AI\",\"slug\":\"vulpieai\",\"problem_label\":\"Vulpie plans your day, times every task, and tells you the truth about where your hours went\",\"solution_label\":\"VulpieAI is an AI-powered scheduling assistant designed to help you plan your day more effectively. It automatically times every task you add, providing detailed insights into where your hours actually go.\\n\\nThe tool helps you:\\n\\n🦊Plan and organize your daily tasks;\\n\\n🦊Get automatic time estimates for each task;\\n\\n🦊Understand your time allocation patterns;\\n\\n🦊Optimize your daily schedule\\n\\nPerfect for anyone looking to improve productivity and gain visibility into how they spend their time throughout the day.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/vulpieai/cofd.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3c3\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3c4\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"AI Assistant\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false,\"is_premium\":true}\n3c6:[\"ai video generator\",\"ai video agent\",\"text to video\",\"image to video\",\"script to video\",\"storyboard\",\"video editing\",\"content creation\",\"character consistency\",\"team collaboration\"]\n3c7:[]\n3c5:{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T11:59:23.865111+00:00\",\"id\":18981,\"codename\":\"Pixo\",\"slug\":\"pixo-3aa4d7\",\"problem_label\":\"AI agents that create and edit complete videos\",\"solution_label\":\"Pixo is an agent-driven AI video platform for creators and teams. Chat with an AI director that researches, scripts, storyboards, gener"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ates consistent scenes with leading video models, adds voiceover, and edits the final cut in one collaborative browser workspace.\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/pixo-3aa4d7/pixo-icon-black-256.png\",\"niche_kws\":\"$3c6\",\"icp_kws\":\"$3c7\",\"market\":\"ai\",\"