39900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Real-time voice translation that works inside Discord, OBS and Zoom makes playing and streaming across languages much easier.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}\n52b:{\"vote_id\":20815,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T05:57:45.581552+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Strong idea in a competitive space. To stand out from Google/Zoom: (1) Focus deeply on one vertical (gaming looks most promising) before spreading thin. (2) Lead with latency benchmarks - gamers care more about speed than accuracy. (3) Show\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}\n529:[\"$52a\",\"$52b\"]\n52c:[]\n52d:[]\n52e:[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocId7apiS66cEoC6E_F1CSo7Uv6wxhlCioDftxK4ZolydRNxMQ=s96-c\"]\n52f:[]\n530:[]\n531:[]\n532:[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSo"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Avqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUlc15NfBS0-ZV--YKy-Ex2dNzEuUw_qXWN2OzaWI691ZgGw=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036466743804071936/6UGAmfGL_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056022842014060544/WILw0QFk_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2095463009908858883/G3537XxQ_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLGzlPxQVSwS2fl7vajziw6y6uwDjJRIhDyF-1Mel7qWz-RlABi=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIC_GExHqJ3is7YNyfPUUsBBiS2YdBokfzXU3PxmGnRhDM09g=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088759233068068864/xCnXj0kl_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1993744339365670912/hMnDFPr6_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912674739900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\"]\n534:{\"vote_id\":21148,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T23:39:40.400358+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"b9fecca6-51f9-43d6-8fe2-66ebeb042669\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912674739900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Going from a photo to resale value and profit in one step saves resellers a lot of guesswork.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}\n535:{\"vote_id\":21115,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T09:22:13.24221+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"f0331b13-7e75-4458-b134-99acd6da8cff\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088759233068068864/xCnXj0kl_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Brilliant idea and execution! Well done and congratulations on the launch 🚀 \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}\n536:{\"vote_id\":21076,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-21T19:10:18.865026+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"689cce1b-7b47-4d51-9dc4-1695b07798f7\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056022842014060544/WILw0QFk_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Super cool product!  I can definitely see how this would be very useful to thrift store shoppers!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}\n533:[\"$534\",\"$535\",\"$536\"]\n537:T40b,My Recomy turns word-of-mouth into income. You recommend a place you trust, someone books through your link"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," and spends there, and you get paid. When that same customer comes back, you get paid again — the model rewards retention, not just the first visit.\n\nBusinesses gain a performance-based acquisition channel: they pay a commission only on real, validated consumption, decide the commission they offer, and can start on a free plan. From one panel they manage collaborations with ambassadors, traceable bookings, challenges with rewards, their own loyalty program, invoicing, daily closings, team access and reports.\n\nAmbassadors work from their phone: they choose the businesses they trust, share their link or QR, track every booking and commission in real time, and get paid automatically every week through Stripe Connect.\n\nCustomers book through someone they trust, can pay from the app — including splitting the bill — and earn loyalty points redeemable at each business.\n\nOperating across Europe and the United States.538:[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"]\n539:[]\n53a:[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIuBfjpw0prqCMbMQBpxUnLnq2CgAcGA30g7xTSxGHJrEaL-Sl=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\"]\n53b:[]\n53c:[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJr9442QHBu6YorGKcPBm5rAAx1ElwYGSrqM8fVvkV7QFDDENyqCg=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1797908061794770944/17ij-3"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"IV_normal.jpg\"]\n53d:[]\n53e:[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-Y-A7yz04EQ_VTRNe1ivCqZr-rPL2krNo_hkWateyAkatrQ=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIuBfjpw0prqCMbMQBpxUnLnq2CgAcGA30g7xTSxGHJrEaL-Sl=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=