king to slash photography costs.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21034,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-20T02:26:19.479587+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"6d75b56f-c84a-4bdc-b47e-a0fa1610d1dd\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1775104722435031040/JEfzb6he_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"https://photogpt.io/ai-clothes-changer\\n\\nThe AI Clothes Changer is especially useful for e-commerce teams. Nice!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21033,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-20T02:24:30.712059+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"425a8373-8e26-46eb-b3ca-c61c87e2c28b\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJoUxS46GVNPfX6aqfQnFtpvpT3TqRkvBmJzSymQ4lxseeoww=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"It`s so nice and friendly for new user!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21032,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-20T02:24:15.439461+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"7700f8d4-3a9d-4e23-b5f9-e6cfe149576c\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUYVPO3Z01B9-Er4g-6-gD9dzmsrnhSgdElSHKcv_9OD5OjA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"This image platform is so easy to use, and its extensive inspiration library always sparks new creative ideas!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21031,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-20T02:22:46.856278+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3036bc00-eede-4f71-9e71-0f1d5ca590a9\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGFofAiThT5ryAfJlsaFhBw-QZ2bkeT1ultTvaCdOr1NlkN98=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Super clean studio lighting and realistic details. It makes generating commercial-grade ecommerce visuals and lifestyle shots effortless without costly photoshoots. Exactly what modern online sellers need!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17757,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-11T21:39:03.876522+00:00\",\"product_id\":18259,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://statable.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Statable is cookieless web analytics for people who want clear numbers without the compliance overhead. No cookies means no consent banner, so you count every visitor instead of only those who click Accept. The tracker is about 2.1 KB, with a 471-byte build. Data is processed in the EU by a Dutch company. Plans start at $9/month for 10,000 pageviews, pooled across unlimited websites rather than charged per site.\",\"maker_name\":\"Yevhen\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJggHv486ZZ1N1Ej8K3rzHHTi4BpKgcBQ1msKzQClWkh2YYqQ=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"StatableCom\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/statable/hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-15\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":17,\"votes_all_time\":17,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":3.39,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.176470588235294,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":9004.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":5295,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYAp2Uub3mVRQbJekXxOTLG0HhMGRahfxM7B2vg_2a1YHjdXjP=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJggHv486ZZ1N1Ej8K3rzHHTi4BpKgcBQ1msKzQClWkh2YYqQ=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJgR-YEyFvVM-qfuKps4QpJJamDkCNKazytRv4sSu6awTZxMA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2039034231427682304/sQi9IdR4_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIX_FzVBNRoKqjTf2uHeUhQ2kTWQvgsi45ORPlO3FQWeIFDU65V=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIH4TZeSbBZJJNlKUc2K8MsbHxOMctJRxEE59n-8YTIDpqk1BtU=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1916548447383023616/b6vbxsCR_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ892TtndlXZ0GADmT-YqNSrGbZn2PRRQ5Nw-NE7xjzS6V0qw=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKlkDbbZcyZr80QVyzxxECTzyMNBZSn3w4ElenRthl-ixRwskathA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKyvGKFIbzcFdUEeNMCkqldl1XTIq_5U--lLomp-M9gD0l8s0w=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLuJ1oLdC1ftmoLx-klYf0szBX3GiI06uFnEaXNXXas5uC8KdX-=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-FTNwJqt4txPaal7Da04y30u1dHzvLvj_J6_nd10AOMknBA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100713397843283968/6ZaKVIYv_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912674739900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":21144,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T23:37:39.636865+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"b9fecca6-51f9-43d6-8fe2-66ebeb042669\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912674739900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"No cookies means no consent banner, so you count every visitor. That's a clear, practical pitch.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21013,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-18T19:35:20.240389+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"342e32a9-903f-4b20-a8b1-fd4c46d6c808\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100713397843283968/6ZaKVIYv_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Does Statable make cookieless EU analytics feel clear for a solo founder on a cold visit? Happy to send a totally free first-impression video if useful.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20937,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-15T09:34:40.409917+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"d96ef6db-3e5e-4535-837c-5eab803bb0c5\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ892TtndlXZ0GADmT-YqNSrGbZn2PRRQ5Nw-NE7xjzS6V0qw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Really cool design, need to switch from GA ASAP :)\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20933,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-15T09:14:31.982087+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"7f672722-6f97-48eb-89d4-c91cd8dad37a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIX_FzVBNRoKqjTf2uHeUhQ2kTWQvgsi45ORPlO3FQWeIFDU65V=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Huge congrats! Merging GSC \u0026 GA4 saves so much time. The MCP support for AI agents is my favorite feature—takes analytics to the next level. Public sharing links make client reporting effortless. Best of luck!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18355,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T20:11:52.648896+00:00\",\"product_id\":18852,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/korovin-aa97/talkthrough-mcp\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Talkthrough is a local-first MCP server that turns screen recordings, audio, and long multi-speaker meetings into searchable evidence for coding agents. It indexes transcripts, exact frames, OCR, wall-clock timestamps, and optional speaker diarization, so agents can triage bugs, analyze incidents, extract specifications, decisions, and action items, and answer who said what with timestamped proof. Recordings stay on your machine, with no runtime telemetry.\",\"maker_name\":\"Alexander Korovin\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/talkthrough/talkthrough-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":15,\"votes_all_time\":15,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":3.39,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.533333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":8920.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":5353,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLhx-H4JxbDgtdL5w5FEvZdhotmTelZ9kyZER0NtS5Uh3aY966GLw=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBL4Kqab4qdV9Pfhk9t8Ia4pcQYxFXOQ-pRXjBFkWNjj8IJZcG=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIyC7m1wM5I3NR6BcdgO9-ODMGe6z_SDCE2lNPCwShxX0Ps0Pl9=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8HLXoY_rzOnE6KmpP3PxjbwHptIALdxQVzn3xGvmwVDNwgXQdSA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLRa6T70fY8xzyVvLUANE5fPwVfeVd2AcZ0LcvJr65lgCeocw=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKcqTNh8wa72LOWwuvsi13bEs8S7VGbJWi7-gRDW63A_TMDvw=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8lVToYSNdjqgS7HZpzLoTUTAba_sok59fJ7m-DYaV9MWK6g=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKSgJBpMeVIt541uTB5lk8ILP_NLm6X-bf1bEdJ1_W4J3xvwLhm=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-FTNwJqt4txPaal7Da04y30u1dHzvLvj_J6_nd10AOMknBA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIO4QYps4JbbI-R4kdHJEIm7nmL3oVEGd-Rfb0iiAAkXeR3Wsu1=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAWVCRSovWUPipNFJGk44V-DUI6LQqXp5K5xfRQDCfyZqcD9lqxA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":21110,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T04:06:03.855309+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"f6d8744d-2ef1-42a8-a4e1-5a40b107ef3b\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAWVCRSovWUPipNFJGk44V-DUI6LQqXp5K5xfRQDCfyZqcD9lqxA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Really cool idea! Love that it turns recordings into actual context AI agents can use, not just another summary. The timestamps, frames, and MCP integration make it feel genuinely useful for real dev workflows.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20810,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-10T15:25:56.451848+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"46f988e1-727b-40e6-a90f-2ecc1d19e3be\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8HLXoY_rzOnE6KmpP3PxjbwHptIALdxQVzn3xGvmwVDNwgXQdSA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"A wonderful MCP that helps me a lot with my day-to-day tasks\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20787,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-09T18:33:28.054212+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"29ec60e1-43c1-46ea-b71f-b3a94d0c9dcc\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBL4Kqab4qdV9Pfhk9t8Ia4pcQYxFXOQ-pRXjBFkWNjj8IJZcG=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"It’s a rather interesting product; I think it could make life easier for many managers who frequently have to attend online meetings.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20786,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-09T17:31:37.054118+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"c0f4e00e-4dfe-43f8-8f64-593f7871bf0d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLhx-H4JxbDgtdL5w5FEvZdhotmTelZ9kyZER0NtS5Uh3aY966GLw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"this is what was missing for me when I try to explain thoroughly what needs to be done. pulling together the screenshots and my annotation via an effortless recording is what makes me comfortable with my ai-assisted development setup\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18381,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T08:53:11.732497+00:00\",\"product_id\":18878,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.citegraph.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"CiteGraph measures which products AI assistants actually recommend. It asks the real questions buyers type into AI across four engines (ChatGPT family, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity), repeatedly, and reports how often you are named, who wins instead, and which pages the engines cite. Every rate carries a margin of error. Each scan ends with the specific missing sentence that would put you in the answer, drafted and ready to edit.\",\"maker_name\":\"Asif\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@akbuilds_/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"akbuilds_\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/citegraph/microlaunch-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":13,\"votes_all_time\":18,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.388888888888889,\"score_execution\":4.75,\"product_points\":8815,\"product_points_week\":3976,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKLIalo1mPozVZrfPR7xAJKynWkPpY1Q-EovpOkgNAm6Btutbd=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKePsJsq17txQUf5kA2668brkbs2fgWdq_R7EQElCtj7IIcUA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6EHoAdbyLgaAndp-BpId03lugPJNTjGK9b3XD8FgGCod1Gw=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIf_EPU3ijDhWuI4HOQQkd2zoJxYNztpnVubqK5vPYpcrwASBtI=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092077814476365824/urdhFPiN_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIuBfjpw0prqCMbMQBpxUnLnq2CgAcGA30g7xTSxGHJrEaL-Sl=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqX3Ua_qkB51NJ8b61uWIGI11Zkpx0cfgsvP93rJzMdkHRdv0=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2059921999762440192/S8Qxn8ZJ_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ5wQxoqFHk5vZasjtvwp7c2SjM12fTus3BdvoXpIdwxdjaTUp=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":20652,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-07T09:20:13.49708+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"48ca3a34-439d-40fd-ac86-6903a450f39a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ5wQxoqFHk5vZasjtvwp7c2SjM12fTus3BdvoXpIdwxdjaTUp=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great idea and it works well too. I signed up for the trial and it's doing a great job!! \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20594,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T16:18:29.351737+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"c9d68d35-c888-4e5f-97c3-bad617f2038e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2059921999762440192/S8Qxn8ZJ_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Great product, been using it recently \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20510,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T20:51:20.389333+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"37fb84e9-ecdd-4f3a-ab91-676b9aef7d02\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIf_EPU3ijDhWuI4HOQQkd2zoJxYNztpnVubqK5vPYpcrwASBtI=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"This looks nice, I will definitely give it a try!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20468,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T13:24:19.221825+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e043e0d2-0ab8-4fac-898b-5aa4b51f2cc7\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6EHoAdbyLgaAndp-BpId03lugPJNTjGK9b3XD8FgGCod1Gw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"CiteGraph looks like a genuinely useful and well-thought-out product. I especially liked how it shows not just where you’re losing AI citations, but also why and what you can do to improve.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19053,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-21T15:58:39.559048+00:00\",\"product_id\":19546,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://filetourl.org/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"FileToUrl.org converts files up to 49MB into shareable filetourl.org links in seconds, with temporary 30-day hosting on the free tier and optional permanent URLs plus unlimited uploads on an affordable Pro plan.\",\"maker_name\":\"Fraser Richardson\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://filetourl.org/assets/og-default-qSPXxlM2.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":11,\"votes_all_time\":11,\"votes_week\":11,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":25.89,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.454545454545454,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":8603.11241751318,\"product_points_week\":8325,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJL4pS_s9M5Q-INVkDnWWseq4_7KvVzxkDABFZU9-c1u0f37auk=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2055642740369641472/16lbGUTQ_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046954265944424448/a543LnU__normal.png\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2041475265344217088/7odOkwkx_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIuBfjpw0prqCMbMQBpxUnLnq2CgAcGA30g7xTSxGHJrEaL-Sl=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100713397843283968/6ZaKVIYv_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2066117391273152513/xJgYP8au_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKQxNlx8wxxMZtoX5zgdHDPzgtfPWiV52WVCXMYi9DceA4F6fo=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKE9nfGjiszYAv64XPaA8h1Ara95CTPdAPqU1Qf7RItXKiHCg=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":21117,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T09:26:41.404379+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"64dbebc8-dd83-4db2-a4be-d7c9e992f9da\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2066117391273152513/xJgYP8au_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Just tested it does exactly what it says, worth bookmarking imo :-)\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21097,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T18:06:49.088528+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"342e32a9-903f-4b20-a8b1-fd4c46d6c808\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100713397843283968/6ZaKVIYv_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Does FileToURL make turning any file into a shareable link feel instant before someone creates an account? Happy to send a totally free first-impression video if useful.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21094,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T08:57:31.803012+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"6411b9df-c6e4-435b-b5a9-359be1b2252a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2041475265344217088/7odOkwkx_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Simple site, works, would definitely recommend, one to bookmark or get the chrome extension\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21093,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T08:53:37.26426+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"bcdcd841-b7d7-429f-ab56-827a0bc765ad\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046954265944424448/a543LnU__normal.png\",\"feedback\":\"Great idea, no sign up, very easy to use and free \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21091,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T08:46:38.283069+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"4f020bcc-a1b6-468c-85ea-23f5badfc6ff\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2055642740369641472/16lbGUTQ_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Does what it says on the tin, i use it for image files, so easy to use, and the chrome extension means i don't have to leave the browser \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":21090,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T08:43:00.396072+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"6b8322c9-8a84-402c-9c1c-7f245ea57a99\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJL4pS_s9M5Q-INVkDnWWseq4_7KvVzxkDABFZU9-c1u0f37auk=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"There is no sign up, no account necessary, you get 3 shareable links per day for files up to 49 mb and the links last 30 days thats it. If you want unlimited permanent links there are pro plans from £2 per month\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18859,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-15T06:28:47.800783+00:00\",\"product_id\":19352,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://vestra.ai/home\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Vestra is your AI Agen