tart scrolling, and when time's up, complete a quick checkpoint before deciding whether to continue. Turn an automatic scroll into a moment to pause, learn and reset.\",\"maker_name\":\"Precious Leku Owan \",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/scrollcheckpoint/ebadef5cc3c2d5a9e11ab6017a3eb70bf500f3dc72f8433c24bf09de4452ff80.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-12\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":7,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":3.39,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.285714285714286,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":7847,\"product_points_week\":5313,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIuBfjpw0prqCMbMQBpxUnLnq2CgAcGA30g7xTSxGHJrEaL-Sl=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsnlMyhp1eaGwIhJNvGc8GsKQLqo6VeYiL1FOXbUAyggGjng=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912674739900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":21147,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T23:39:12.085005+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"b9fecca6-51f9-43d6-8fe2-66ebeb042669\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912674739900018689/1et7uuSX_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Stepping in when the app opens, instead of relying on willpower, is the right design. A pause before continuing is a gentle nudge.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":20995,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-18T01:26:49.885792+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ebe74b1c-7bfe-43f2-8778-efd607cc84d6\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsnlMyhp1eaGwIhJNvGc8GsKQLqo6VeYiL1FOXbUAyggGjng=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Tested ScrollCheckpoint and love the approach! The gentle pause screens break doomscrolling far better than aggressive app blockers. Offline journal saving is a great bonus. A home screen widget would make toggling sessions even smoother!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"5fa660af-286f-4c14-a0ab-e55a4e41cb46\",\"user_id\":\"e3337257-8c07-40b7-823e-568a6a53448b\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMYGmGiN7AkoaSkxQhgPaUlGYTTxBfy3A43FjpwOWdNUYIkQ=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"Scroll Checkpoint\",\"text\":\"Thank you very much for your feedback. We'll consider your suggestion in the next update\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-19T19:10:03.318Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19046,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-21T09:06:16.753553+00:00\",\"product_id\":19539,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.newcv.io/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"NEWCV.IO is a career application platform for creating professional resumes, generating them around target roles, tailoring them to specific jobs and auditing them before you apply. Build from scratch or import your existing career information, then use the NEWCV Engine when you want deeper generation, job matching and recruiter focused analysis.\",\"maker_name\":\"Simar Malhi\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@thesimarmalhi/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"thesimarmalhi\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/newcvio/schermafbeelding-2026-09-21-om-11.12.17.webp\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":12,\"votes_all_time\":12,\"votes_week\":6,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":12,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.083333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":7687.555084532756,\"product_points_week\