1:13:34.570698+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"1e6cfef4-121e-44cf-9736-1f31b19ec26c\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPMzcW9eIql2BCLLKd1R3Gi0lHThipzIAvkw_75gWMcsJrEw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Public leaderboards for SEO scores is a nice touch. I would also like to see more features around AEO/GEO\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18762,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-12T06:37:15.946215+00:00\",\"product_id\":19255,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.oneguyconsulting.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"OneGuyConsulting.com is the passion project of HIPAA compliance expert and founder Chuck Weiselberg. For eight years Chuck watched healthcare SaaS companies fall behind by refusing to use the technology in front of them. HIPAA is complex, every attempt to simplify it only makes it more confusing. Chuck knew a better way. He automated his methodology, crushed the repetitive work, and built a program that small practices can actually finish.\",\"maker_name\":\"Chuck Weiselberg\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@oneguyco/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"oneguyco\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/oneguyconsultinghipaacompliancesolutions/one-guy-consulting-2-.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-15\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":5,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":2,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":4,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.2,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":7218,\"product_points_week\":5324,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYAp2Uub3mVRQbJekXxOTLG0HhMGRahfxM7B2vg_2a1YHjdXjP=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLX2G9JGd-BiqBSCCMr96w0voyY2SnlDdfa90g4K-fLPY2rlA=s96-c\",\"http