ntact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18420,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-06T10:46:32.281515+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"All-in-one creative suite with 84+ tools is ambitious - love solving creators' tool fatigue. Speed promise is gold. Consider: clearer onboarding for each tool, template marketplace for faster workflows, affordable pricing tier for freelance\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17809,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-13T22:36:46.586824+00:00\",\"product_id\":18311,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://lemonsugar.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"LemonSugar Ai is a personalized AI tutor for students. Snap a homework problem, type a question, or ask by voice to get step-by-step explanations in your language and preferred learning style. It then creates custom quizzes, tracks weak spots, schedules review before exams, and supports test prep. Students can start free, with a paid plan for higher limits and advanced study features.\",\"maker_name\":\"Atheeth Sishtla\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"atheethsishtla\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/lemonsugarai/Screenshot-2026-08-13-at-5.34.47-PM.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-13\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":3,\"votes_all_time\":19,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.421052631578948,\"score_execution\":4.857142857142857,\"product_points\":5770,\"product_points_week\":4006,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19899,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T16:56:00.47062+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"LemonSugar Ai Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19711,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-15T15:05:55.379974+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"99b27a06-15d8-42ea-9e98-f180a1e377c4\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLu1vcWXrXhldh9_skcClo8I6nVJfrXsJpJPfezBG3tr_V5PyxGtQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I recently tried Lemon AI and found it easy to use and helpful. The interface is simple, the responses are quick, and it makes everyday tasks much easier. \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"9dfd50dd-bb15-4c38-a338-a22f47e24f47\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"Thank you for trying it. I’m glad the experience felt fast and simple. One small clarification: the full product name is LemonSugar Ai, and its focus is helping students understand and retain what they learn.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:25.361Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19689,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-15T01:54:59.844134+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"25b1ebec-5d41-4218-9506-25c0bc41d2df\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLVEMrsPpjOzwNQAdGWWZCmmKT-USeYrYjV-UXULxAzeB9dGQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great idea, I love the possibility of consolidating the most effective ways to study with AI in one interface. \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"7bc6d68e-a9b8-42b6-a9e5-62b5c39c375b\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"That’s exactly the idea—explanation, retrieval practice, weak-spot memory, and exam review should work as one learning loop instead of separate tools. Thank you!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:24.490Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19688,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-15T01:19:09.366342+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"b7d50346-372b-4bd8-a9d9-9452cca2593e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXBthyJlMdjxnzyGSxyJYjyznRSD04eY4ACTk3lESuRs7Eou4=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"It's great to see this product available for school and college students. \\n\\nIn this competitive world, such an assistant app is \\\"friend in need\\\" for students who need any kind help at a reasonable cost.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"5053c9ba-e3a1-405c-a490-177c02e6ba25\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"Thank you. Affordability matters deeply here: routine questions should not require the most expensive AI model, and students should still receive quality help when it counts.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:23.631Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19674,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T21:00:50.538676+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"b4657575-2862-4740-989a-a80846bcafac\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5lNkh09GRF53Fhps2o9WgMBwUsfKAgKGDwjrj8ACgrq3YIA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Exceptional \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"c713f47f-be3a-417d-bf50-5487eb573684\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"I appreciate it—thank you for taking the time to try LemonSugar Ai.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:22.775Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19673,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T20:56:10.31455+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"05b34092-05ed-4149-82a7-9b35f4b97088\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTCUi7C0YwMrYltIPvgvSg57h_6XCCrqriiN14N-xOnwHFMpfnBg=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Incredible idea catered towards making learning easy and fun for kids and adults alike! \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"57747788-8bbb-42dc-a95e-fb8ada483ae9\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"Thank you! Bringing proven study methods into one simple experience is exactly what I’m aiming for, for learners from high school through graduate study.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:21.898Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19672,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T20:50:41.347535+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"a6e1f845-dc5a-4466-b73b-40f837f52721\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLV9SFLM1e8BdQyjJIoVUjt5yamU8Bt5TTnG-8Y04-7P3N-4owo=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Excellent response of the maths problem functionality..!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"32297ead-86c9-419e-8ecf-fb742cb2f0cc\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"Glad the math workflow worked well for you. The goal is to show each step clearly, then check that the method—not only the answer—stuck.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:21.142Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19664,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T12:58:04.005579+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"41b487b5-0ef0-40eb-b2bd-39a71647e043\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZ7FC4kIhoHXsesmfOpOpvUyoJwU253p9i-WfKYnBMTrttEo3V=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Excellent platform \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"24ad52fd-4f98-4eb1-9ebd-4bf5322ab792\",\"user_id\":\"0d3b123a-9e36-432d-815b-76ac0947b757\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKS5MMzXs9Vm5TKQ2QpdmGTivYalDxCjwBGUiUJVVrdfIx7HugR=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"atheeth sishtla\",\"text\":\"Thank you! I’m building LemonSugar Ai to make AI help turn into real understanding—not just a quick answer. I appreciate you trying it.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T04:35:09.934Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18807,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-14T07:56:23.58516+00:00\",\"product_id\":19300,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.roomai.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"RoomAI turns a real photo of your room into AI-generated design options in under a minute, while keeping the walls, windows, and camera angle exactly as photographed. It covers 20+ room-specific presets — living room, bedroom, bathroom, house exterior, staging, decluttering — drawing on a shared library of 300+ styles, so each room type gets presets tuned to it instead of one generic style list. Free to try, no card required.\",\"maker_name\":\"Linn\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIa5ggIu8IhWHMyK3rB35k5ZhNv77JlHJ_ocM3eeVBgyacZKyI=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/roomai/Shou-Ye.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":4,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":4,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":9.39,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":5767,\"product_points_week\":5167,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100713397843283968/6ZaKVIYv_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":21098,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T18:09:40.635931+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"342e32a9-903f-4b20-a8b1-fd4c46d6c808\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100713397843283968/6ZaKVIYv_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Curious whether RoomAI makes redesigning a room from one photo feel believable while keeping the same walls. Can send a totally free first-impression video if helpful.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19041,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-21T07:16:47.607568+00:00\",\"product_id\":19534,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://wizstar.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Wizstar is an AI-powered video generator that turns prompts, product links, and photos into cinematic videos, shoppable ads, localized translations, and talking avatars for global marketing and content teams.\",\"maker_name\":\"Wizstar\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.g