for big chains, venues get an affordable way to run stamps and points programs. Customers use one account and one QR code across every participating business, earning rewards they can redeem for real perks each venue sets. Owners get a simple scan-and-reward flow at checkout, plus tools to send promotions.\",\"maker_name\":\"Lukasz\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/crabtap/hero-crabtap.webp\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":4,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":5305,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYmsR3U70FzKZ1SXxJsdxqOQ4Jx4mVH4RyLEJOLEvh2o5FNQ=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18470,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T02:05:31.071622+00:00\",\"product_id\":18965,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://budgetpixel.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"BudgetPixel AI is an all-in-one creative workspace for generating and editing images, videos, music, speech, and design assets. It gives creators, marketers, agencies, and developers access to leading AI models through one shared credit balance. Users can compare models, upscale results, remove backgrounds, train custom LoRAs, build designs on a visual canvas, and connect automated workflows through its API and MCP integration.\",\"maker_name\":\"Cheinia\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@budgetpixel/avata