\"product_points\":4692,\"product_points_week\":4092,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19095,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-25T08:25:24.249006+00:00\",\"product_id\":19588,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://getroastly.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Roastly gives you a fast, brutally honest homepage critique with annotated screenshots and an optional $9 teardown that pinpoints your biggest money leak and how to fix it.\",\"maker_name\":\"Nick Levy\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://getroastly.app/opengraph-image?f032d3481b3303ba\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-25\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":2,\"votes_all_time\":2,\"votes_week\":2,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":4,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4692,\"product_points_week\":4092,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18595,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-07T08:42:20.697926+00:00\",\"product_id\":19089,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.socialcrawl.dev/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"SocialCrawl is a unified social media data API that gives developers and AI agents access to clean, structured data through a single API key. We power AI agents by providing the API to search, scrape, and interact with social media at scale. \",\"maker_name\":\"Selene\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@vaaselene/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"vaaselene\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/socialcrawl/Screenshot-2026-08-20-at-10.27.01.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":2,\"votes_all_time\":2,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4553.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18606,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-07T15:43:43.799057+00:00\",\"product_id\":19100,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://bubblemarkets.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"BubbleMarkets is a multi-asset financial market visualization platform that transforms stocks, ETFs, cryptocurrencies, forex, commodities, bonds and global indices into interactive bubble maps. Users can quickly identify market leaders, laggards, price movements and trading activity through an intuitive visual interface. With flexible filters, multiple timeframes, watchlists, charts, market data and news, BubbleMarkets helps traders, investors and analysts understand what is moving across global markets without switching between multiple financial platforms.\",\"maker_name\":\"sabin_ewing\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@bubblemarketss/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"bubblemarketss\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/bubblemarkets/Screenshot-2026-09-07-at-8.23.33-PM.png\",\"batch_num\":202610,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":3,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4537,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-FTNwJqt4txPaal7Da04y30u1dHzvLvj_J6_nd10AOMknBA=s96-c\",\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17331,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T08:46:46.108603+00:00\",\"product_id\":17835,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://invoicepaid.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Create professional invoices in your browser and download a clean PDF - no account, no email gate, no watermark stamped across the page. Pick from 16 templates built for specific trades (plumber, electrician, cleaner, photographer) and tax systems (UK VAT, UAE TRN), or start blank. Add your logo, tax line, and payment terms. The web tool is free forever; the iPhone app adds saved clients, estimates, and paid/unpaid tracking.\",\"maker_name\":\"Alexander\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL0dZg9FPOpxp465TV5C3v5y5prafD4lgu-F4ay7KqhU5iFMg=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/invoicepaid/Screenshot-2026-07-28-at-12.42.44.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-28\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":12,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.166666666666667,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":4432,\"product_points_week\":4000,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbb0alMZZ7OMbFdn819cVPFxtfNEpv6ikPojhGBn52JAzZ2_R-=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19442,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T07:57:52.73867+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"No signup and no watermark is exactly right - the account wall is the real friction, not the PDF. Wishlist: duplicate-last-invoice from localStorage, freelancers resend near-identical ones monthly.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19327,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T10:06:09.523177+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Invoice Paid Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18940,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T13:51:32.34746+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Invoice Paid has great potential and offers some useful features, but I encountered a few issues that could be improved. Please contact me so I can share detailed feedback and suggest the changes I'd like to see.\\n\\nEmail: contact@rforrank.co\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18930,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T09:24:40.644654+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"5e43a54f-af8c-40f1-ad32-3e562f59cb16\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIoQ9kYf0Jqs3XoKFAqukMX3U1Rg7s-Igr8Xu3_FXxIC-xe4wav=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Using this already for a week, just one more invoice generator, but simple and fast\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18100,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-22T11:06:31.873623+00:00\",\"product_id\":18597,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://gorules.io\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Every company keeps two copies of its business logic: a document people read and code that runs. They drift. GoRules keeps one copy. Rules read like sentences, live in visual graphs or policy documents, and ship with reviews, releases, and tests. The open-source ZEN engine (MIT, Rust) answers your API, your agents, and your batch jobs in about 10 microseconds. An AI copilot builds and explains rules; people release. Cloud, self-hosted, or embedded.\",\"maker_name\":\"Stefan\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/gorules/gorules-ph-01-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-24\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":2,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4245,\"product_points_week\":3658,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ892TtndlXZ0GADmT-YqNSrGbZn2PRRQ5Nw-NE7xjzS6V0qw=s96-c\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16601,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T15:31:39.33387+00:00\",\"product_id\":17109,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://investormatch.pro/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Upload your pitch deck and get 20 personalized VC matches with fit scores, direct contacts, and ready-to-send outreach emails.  Get a Teardown of your deck to improve before pitching. Over $100M in verified investor commitments.\",\"maker_name\":\"Martin Tobias\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@martingtobias/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"martingtobias\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/investormatch/Screenshot-2026-06-26-at-8.27.55-AM.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-27\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18489,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T14:07:29.67169+00:00\",\"product_id\":18984,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://vastavik.org/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Vastavik is a blockchain-backed media authentication platform. Every photo, video, or audio file gets a unique ID and QR watermark at creation--letting anyone independently verify it's real. Built for journalists, creators, and brands to fight deepfakes and prove authenticity in the AI era.\",\"maker_name\":\"Vastavik\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/vastavik/vastavik-intro-slide-1.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743967690945871872/_1Hy_sJR_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18445,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-01T23:58:47.774315+00:00\",\"product_id\":18940,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://posts.design\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"posts.design is a hand-picked gallery of real social post visuals from leading companies and their designers. See all the biggest and new announcements but also dive into historical content - announcements, opengraph images, hiring, launches and more feed-native references.\",\"maker_name\":\"Max Based\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@baseddesigner/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"baseddesigner\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/postsdesign/posts-design-share-2x-2-.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-11\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1879214495320444928/Krqc-xbG_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18782,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-12T22:41:21.715025+00:00\",\"product_id\":19275,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://sealedrose.com/video-verify\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Sealed Rose Deepfake Video Detector is a free, privacy-first forensic tool that exposes AI-generated videos and facial face-swaps. Frame-by-frame temporal inspection analyzes Sora, Kling, Veo, and Runway artifacts directly in your browser without uploading to external servers. Built for buyers, creators, and platforms to verify genuine human media.\",\"maker_name\":\"Derek\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/sealedrose/2026-09-12-18_31_28-Greenshot.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-12\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocId7apiS66cEoC6E_F1CSo7Uv6wxhlCioDftxK4ZolydRNxMQ=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18962,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-18T08:40:18.631787+00:00\",\"product_id\":19455,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://decloak.dev\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Decloak scans any live URL across 8 layers, catching exposed API keys, misconfigured databases, and vulnerable libraries, including the specific failures common to apps built with Lovable, Supabase, and Base44. Paid tiers deploy an AI agent that investigates a whole site, run AI-powered penetration testing, and map findings to SOC2, ISO 27001, NIS2, and DORA controls, all for a fraction of what tools like AppCheck or Qualys cost.\",\"maker_name\":\"Stephen Gray\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@decloakdev/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"decloakdev\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/decloakwebsecurityintelligence/hero-sample-report.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-18\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19011,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-19T18:04:53.819601+00:00\",\"product_id\":19504,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://upnext.io/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Upnext is a Facebook-first publishing and traffic platform built for publishers, media teams and businesses managing multiple Facebook Pages. Schedule and distribute content across Pages, organize Pages into groups, customize and rotate branded domains, control publishing intervals, track clicks with automatic UTM parameters, analyze traffic and engagement, discover trending content, use AI-assisted content creation, and safely manage or clean up published content — all from one workspace.\",\"maker_name\":\"Abdelaziz ALLA\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@UpNextio/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"UpNextio\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/upnext/fba045bc-eb64-4188-ae92-15ae3a8d6f99.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-23\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19042,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-21T07:39:41.522326+00:00\",\"product_id\":19535,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.floorai.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"FloorAI converts sketches, photos, PDFs or text descriptions into accurate, editable floor plans with multiple 2D and 3D styles, letting you refine walls, rooms and furniture in minutes.\",\"maker_name\":\"charm Linn\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIa5ggIu8IhWHMyK3rB35k5ZhNv77JlHJ_ocM3eeVBgyacZKyI=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://www.floorai.ai/home/plans/compare-plans.webp\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19058,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T02:08:45.134826+00:00\",\"product_id\":19551,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.aimakesong.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"AIMakeSong is an AI-driven song creator that transforms text, lyrics, and style choices into royalty-safe, studio-quality tracks across dozens of genres in minutes.\",\"maker_name\":\"Faith Faith\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://www.aimakesong.com/favicon_io/apple-touch-icon.png?v=1.0.0\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19072,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T08:26:19.095168+00:00\",\"product_id\":19565,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://colorifyai.art/photo-to-coloring-pages/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Instantly convert your pictures into printable coloring pages. Upload any photo, strip away the colors, and get ready to color your own memories.\\n\\n\",\"maker_name\":\"suki\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/colorifyai-a8751c/ScreenShot_2026-09-23_142209_826.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-23\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19075,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T15:44:57.438245+00:00\",\"product_id\":19568,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://aevral.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Aevral automatically reviews GitHub pull requests and repositories to detect authorization, IDOR, and business-logic access-control flaws, then provides clear, suggested fixes that developers can apply directly in their.\",\"maker_name\":\"Tristan roth\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://aevral.com/og.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-24\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIuBfjpw0prqCMbMQBpxUnLnq2CgAcGA30g7xTSxGHJrEaL-Sl=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19102,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-25T20:24:10.496052+00:00\",\"product_id\":19595,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://captaincode.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Captain Code is a local TUI crew chief that routes each developer task to the best mix of coding and reasoning models across your existing subscriptions and open-source deployments.\",\"maker_name\":\"Romain Pellerin🇫🇷🇺🇸\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@rom1_pellerin/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"rom1_pellerin\",\"hero_img\":\"https://captaincode.ai/assets/brand/social-preview.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-26\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1853515699265671168/hSZZ_NY7_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":19092,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T16:53:09.878863+00:00\",\"product_id\":19585,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://dardaris.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Dardaris is an AI property manager for private landlords, automating rent, repairs, banking and tenant communication while escalating only the decisions that need your approval.\",\"maker_name\":\"sacha vandamme\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://www.dardaris.com/og/home.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-25\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":3605,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18240,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T14:16:49.502963+00:00\",\"product_id\":18737,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://sitely.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"It seemed impossible but we did it: Sitely AI+Visual Website Builder is now on the iPad!\\n\\nIf you already use Sitely on your Mac, you’ll feel right at home. If you’re new to Sitely, you’ll enjoy its power and simplicity, and its seamless integration with iPadOS features and UI. Everything you could do on a Mac, you can now do on your iPad—and more, with Apple Pencil and touch.\\n\\nFrom your first idea to a published website, you can now take Sitely with you wherever you go.\",\"maker_name\":\"Daniele Trambusti\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@dannyturmoils/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"dannyturmoils\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/sitelyipadaivisualwebsitebuilder/Sitely-7-iPadOS-Cover.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-27\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18251,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:32:43.267044+00:00\",\"product_id\":18748,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://cleanvector.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"CleanVector is an AI design workspace for creating professional illustrations, logos, icons, and complete visual systems from a prompt. Create a mascot once, then reuse the same character across new scenes, poses, and visual styles while keeping it recognizable. Refine colors and shapes in a focused editor, build complete logo kits, and export production-ready SVG or transparent PNG assets for websites, apps, campaigns, and products. API and MCP access are available for automated workflows.\",\"maker_name\":\"Ubeydullah\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/cleanvector/cleanvector-hero-imagegen-v2-680x340.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-27\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18296,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T02:18:57.697059+00:00\",\"product_id\":18793,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://gmplus.io/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Free Google Maps Extractor \u0026 Scraper to collect business names, phones, websites, available emails, ratings and more, then export results to CSV, XLSX, or JSON. No code, no extension required.\",\"maker_name\":\"BlingBling\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/freegooglemapsextractorscraperwithemailgmplus/2164d84f-12b7-41bd-a9b5-c61edc09c871.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-28\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18333,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T05:54:01.083877+00:00\",\"product_id\":18830,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://felix.trade\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Felix is a quant trading platform for developing, backtesting, and running systematic strategies. Research markets, test performance and drawdowns, set capital and risk limits, and monitor automated execution from one workspace. Felix Trade launches September 22 on Arc.\",\"maker_name\":\"Aditya Naidu\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@felixdottrade/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"felixdottrade\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/felixtrade/felix-microlaunch-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-17\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4205,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17846,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T19:51:39.253938+00:00\",\"product_id\":18348,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://meetmora.io/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Mora drafts your 1:1 agenda before every meeting, keeps private notes during, and writes the recap after — so nothing gets lost between one conversation and the next. No account needed for your reports. Opening access Sept 2026.\",\"maker_name\":\"Anita Cafiero\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/mora/Header.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-25\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":2,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4192,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18040,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:20:21.688212+00:00\",\"product_id\":18537,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://recoura.io\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Recoura offers manual and automatic recovery of failed payments for revenue that Stripe and Square give up on. It includes custom email templates, multi-currency support, custom recovery sequences, an AI recovery assistant (optional AI generated recovery emails, tailored to your business), and analytics to help with recovery campaigns. It supports failed payments across invoices, subscriptions, and one-off payments, and is one of the few recovery tools supporting Square.\",\"maker_name\":\"Recoura\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@recoura_io/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"recoura_io\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/recoura/screen-shot-2026-08-20-at-10.37.53.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-25\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":2,\"votes_all_time\":6,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4192,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2083968398179110912/7PuTTsQ1_normal.jpg\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17616,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T12:35:18.014942+00:00\",\"product_id\":18115,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://virtuprobe.studio\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Cross-protocol request workbench for integration and penetration testing. 11 protocols, local-first, no account needed. Put your tests together on your own or supervise your agent helping you achieve your goals via MCP. Chain your tests or script your scenarios in JS or Groovy. Free tier covers HTTP, DNS and SMTP testing.\",\"maker_name\":\"Jakub Stonavsky\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ4FovAjr_2rdK7VA_0VBiuyTToRUoaOTRWgutMhf5cbTcf9Ug=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"foobar_beer\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/virtuprobestudio/og.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-06\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":8,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.5,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":4153,\"product_points_week\":4053,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19905,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T16:58:17.949072+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"VirtuProbe Studio Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19509,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-07T17:31:31.884321+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"98bc5500-9a6e-490d-a871-1203e22c23fc\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKHGAF7JpkUteAHllGcvJsHGVy8GzC59ksN9iy0RMKiVZuP4NAfQw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"This is genuinely great idea to combine so much protocols into a single easy to use app. You can test the whole flow, over APIs, thru email sent, from DB, and much more. You can even connect LLM and have the agent help you set it up...\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19508,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-07T16:53:27.233794+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ee5c93a9-2d80-49c1-b52a-9c6e5fd2a41a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ4FovAjr_2rdK7VA_0VBiuyTToRUoaOTRWgutMhf5cbTcf9Ug=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"So far I am 100% happy with this product (which I should be). I am using it as my daily testing toolbox for all projects I am working on in both me-driven and the MCP agent mode so everything is battle-tested 24/7.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true},{\"vote_id\":19490,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-07T16:07:42.75469+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"8ec63c11-97f1-4a89-82a6-1c388b14483e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJl63HmIjaYLFFl3V03HhVwQx736tyt64sm-ZgflOChE-gcJQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Awesome product, leaving all competitors such postman and Bruno far behind from both functionalities and pricing perspectives. Data stays where you want, free tier is a bargain for all pentesters and security engineers, definitely YES.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17401,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T00:39:08.99194+00:00\",\"product_id\":17905,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://adviserry.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Adviserry give you outcomes, not just content. It reads newsletters and watches YouTube videos from the experts you follow, maps them to your goals, and delivers specific moves to take each week. Adviserry isn't a second brain that just stores what you remembered to capture. Adviserry brings you the moves you should be making on your projects this week, whether you captured it or not. It auto-ingests your subscriptions, builds a searchable archive, and remembers your work to sharpen advice over time. Get proactive daily digests and alerts, chat with your archive, and even query it from Claude Desktop or ChatGPT via MCP.\",\"maker_name\":\"Adam\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKpaMaWX33Zdtj0LrI3L-gEvWnaIgNj4-UeRlVL76ThBvch4Q=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"casson_adam\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/adviserry/Screenshot-2026-07-30-173340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":9,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.111111111111111,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":4091,\"product_points_week\":3991,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":20005,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T14:33:44.4156+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"f7ee2e15-8b53-43f5-89fc-9bae29cb0581\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKpaMaWX33Zdtj0LrI3L-gEvWnaIgNj4-UeRlVL76ThBvch4Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Using Adviserry has reduced my fomo and anxiety around keeping up with the best new advice/tips/tricks from experts while I build/launch new products. I spend less time consuming content to find the few \\\"nuggets of gold\\\" in each video/post\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true},{\"vote_id\":19930,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:06:20.033711+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Adviserry Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n  \\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17457,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-01T17:35:29.564882+00:00\",\"product_id\":17958,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://landingboost.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"LandingBoost scans any SaaS landing page, compares clarity, relevance, trust, and action signals with revenue-backed references, and identifies the single highest-leverage edit to make first. \\n\\nFounders get page-grounded evidence, a prioritized fix, and a paste-ready prompt so they can improve the page, rescan it, and measure whether the conversion signal moved. It is built for SaaS founders, indie hackers, agencies, and small growth teams.\",\"maker_name\":\"Yusuke\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990427016139812864/PB85j3Hb_normal.jpg\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"yusukelp\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/landingboost/mokkit-export-77-.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-02\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":27,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.111111111111111,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":4091,\"product_points_week\":3991,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19450,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T08:34:51.100203+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Meta note for a landing tool: the page itself has no h1 - first check on any conversion audit. Also no CSP or X-Frame-Options, so the signup page is frameable. On Cloudflare both ship without a redeploy via Response Header Transform; CSP in report-only first.\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19272,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:24:40.187117+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"LandingBoost Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19269,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-03T21:15:47.192025+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"594e44c0-1fdc-428c-9b81-641b6c066a89\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2083451081867292672/ZFll1HqA_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"I'm actually a user of this product and it's quite literally the #1 tool for assessing whether your landing page will convert or not. Def worth giving it a try.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"62fa63ec-7201-4d38-a7ed-2447a7ac1d69\",\"user_id\":\"aa2b9a70-c929-4b64-879b-9715f15a81e0\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990427016139812864/PB85j3Hb_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Yusuke\",\"text\":\"Hey thanks zid!! means a lot coming from you!!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T19:06:20.363Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19261,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-03T14:23:01.621784+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"2fa410ff-57ac-403b-a4cb-acb9362ef7d0\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwq9yJUjtSd4d0xtCmm3w5jZIX59wEf0TIWjN1dE1ahooaVS4O=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Landing boost has helped me grasp the fundamental of landing pages and learn what to fix to increase conversions. It's a tool I now don't want to go without. Yusuke is excellent at always improving and there for you anytime!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"57d4db2e-0905-40ae-a1a7-dca4efed23ae\",\"user_id\":\"aa2b9a70-c929-4b64-879b-9715f15a81e0\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990427016139812864/PB85j3Hb_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Yusuke\",\"text\":\"thanks lot Tom!! your support always keep me pushing. if you have any request, feel free to ask me anytime! thanks again!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-03T15:34:54.431Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19259,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-03T14:22:20.059723+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"5813dccb-ac3a-48e0-a591-0124dfa83c55\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1311248024287371264/HLoHrb9O_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Going great, all the best!! \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"7b0e725c-cf89-4c5d-b4c6-1e57f909ade5\",\"user_id\":\"aa2b9a70-c929-4b64-879b-9715f15a81e0\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990427016139812864/PB85j3Hb_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Yusuke\",\"text\":\"thank you brother! it really means a lot!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-03T15:33:47.384Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19217,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-02T04:27:59.990471+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Strong concept for conversion optimization. Clear prioritization approach helps founders focus on highest-impact changes. Suggestion: showcase more case studies with before/after metrics to build trust with non-technical founders who might \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"2f0b292b-f68f-4029-a244-4329f8322d3b\",\"user_id\":\"aa2b9a70-c929-4b64-879b-9715f15a81e0\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990427016139812864/PB85j3Hb_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Yusuke\",\"text\":\"Thank you for reaching out! and totally agree.  We’re planning to put verified before/after rescans in the header, so improved pages get real visibility too. Feels like a double win.  Curious what you think of that?\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-03T08:21:04.123Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17694,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-09T13:30:21.741578+00:00\",\"product_id\":18196,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://seobeast.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"SEOBeast automates your SEO from keyword research to published, search optimized articles. Create and publish content consistently, discover backlink exchange opportunities, and connect Google Search Console to track performance and uncover new growth opportunities. Built for startups and businesses that want to grow organic traffic without spending hours managing SEO.\",\"maker_name\":\"Costin Gheorghe\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKWJXaV5vg7bjQKV3O4ZOj4oiNCeSo4peEkntufPd-JawtDaA=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"costin_gh07\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/seobeast/og-seobeast-autonomous.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.142857142857143,\"score_execution\":4.333333333333333,\"product_points\":3936,\"product_points_week\":3836,\"is_boosted\":false,