ycle unattended: research, strategy, writing, authority links, images, a 20+ point SEO protocol, and publishing. Output is real Gutenberg blocks, not pasted HTML. Publishes to WordPress natively or to any stack via a Content API.\",\"maker_name\":\"Structura\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/structura-e4187d/c7dc53a3-b355-488e-9187-2f6da3d82d00.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-26\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":3705,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891564978177454080/YzRSDzkw_normal.jpg\"],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17709,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-10T08:10:46.850293+00:00\",\"product_id\":18211,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://minimax-h3.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Minimax H3 AI Video Generator helps creators, marketers, designers, and ecommerce teams generate short 2K AI videos from text prompts, images, video clips, audio, and first or last frame references.\",\"maker_name\":\"Neely\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/minimaxh3-b4a6b7/minimax-h3-home.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":1,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":3705,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp4Z49IeByLRz22epHlCf7CWSoAvqls-JIQRu4Egqe9NGODgsA=s96-c\"],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19895,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T16:54:22.455772+00:00\",\"user_id\"