t I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17226,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-23T09:01:53.787656+00:00\",\"product_id\":17730,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://hyperfocus.in\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Most productivity tools start with an inbox, helping you collect, process, and organize work. That can make you feel in control without moving your most important work forward. Hyperfocus is a goals-first planner for macOS. It helps you choose a few outcomes that matter most for the next few months, plan your weeks and days around them, and make consistent progress through focused work.\",\"maker_name\":\"Dmitrii\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1961665128136331264/PzKymQsI_normal.jpg\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"dmtsepelev\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/hyperfocus/heromicrolaunchv2.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-30\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":13,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.538461538461538,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3659,\"product_points_week\":4059,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19441,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T07:57:29.032944+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"The long-term-goal to daily-task breakdown is where every planner app falls apart. Does it replan automatically when I miss a day, or does the streak guilt pile up?\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"2bbd9e6a-281b-46bd-bf8f-a331ede062ab\",\"user_id\":\"cc3d3c37-565f-47cd-a3cc-2d61a9ea9129\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1961665128136331264/PzKymQsI_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Dmitri Tsepelev\",\"text\":\"good question! every new day \u0026 week starts fresh to make sure stuff does not pile up, but you can always bring tasks from the previous one if you want\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T19:38:00.561Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":19276,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:26:02.477042+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"HYPERFOCUS Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19160,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T10:45:48.701113+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"724903a1-42a9-4612-868f-c2b732547027\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLpKiAiJLg-GVZSHxploEmbzqGijaucpW74Xs7OL9D8iUNm4h_L=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Really helpful app!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19159,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T10:10:29.142601+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"c25d6a58-4ae0-49ed-8f25-3e48901bb04c\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIxI9ZNlgaFkh2RSydfOn8gk0el6XmjEVk3W4SrCp7pfd-Oj5qo=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Cool idea\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19158,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T10:09:02.270547+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"d3aec8f9-a8b8-40f7-b6e7-0fbed1075032\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLvLGL1QW9hAGDbsfA-C6X3ekWjwRJ6EEL5TXeXkzJSqWBiKw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"It’s very timely for me\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19153,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T07:27:35.076414+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"042ad64e-b351-41a8-a0de-6f848521ef28\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZoc82dgLQ50_fTB4_Ka2By6K4LGeJ7FeDjul4JyPP8CrM1m76=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great, smart, simple\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19151,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T05:44:44.08858+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"c848146b-6e00-4a2d-9093-e353a364e1a1\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJfOFOK0Xglta4hHN9z0vfOytRvqfuhLuA1zRilot5shhqnImJ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"simple and well-structured! AI Buddy is very useful. it gave me helpful feedback and asked questions that helped me move forward.\\n\\nWishing the product and its founder the best of luck!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16683,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T21:24:29.985646+00:00\",\"product_id\":17191,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://applybtn.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"ApplyBtn is an AI Chrome extension for job application autofill. It fills real-world application forms directly on the page using your CV and the job description, generates tailored answers and cover letters, and keeps you in control before manual submission.\",\"maker_name\":\"Marina\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIz65PFRLQkkDdgFM5J19SUMt_UWNYU5ECKgM03LAy4J66JWA=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/applybtn/poster.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":37,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.54054054054054,\"score_execution\":4.933333333333334,\"product_points\":3644,\"product_points_week\":4044,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19438,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T07:56:17.126578+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Autofill that handles real-world forms (not just greenhouse) is the actual pain. Curious how you deal with Workday's multi-step flow - that's where every autofill I've tried dies.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19287,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:30:06.154751+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ApplyBtn Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19162,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T20:13:37.987297+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"40b767e2-b3e1-4309-bdd9-0f8d862b1eb2\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJFBEeJX8d7mh7V8NkPch33cKSYlY-kmHM9OMBxvbW953NWbqh4=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great idea!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19157,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T09:40:12.538492+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"cb3b45ae-0b9d-48a0-aa41-756b070d407a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ2Kxkpcp8dc-EL1QSCPA8yvD_qOwMZhAZgtOYdi6OPufW3ZA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"An AI assistant that actually earns its keep. It fills out job applications and drafts custom-tailored responses for you, cutting hours off your job search. You stay in the driver's seat the whole time ❤️.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19102,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T15:16:13.38137+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"da17e30f-871a-4e12-bb6e-9e821794c5c5\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLEU00Sl_k7G2OnTfkMq47zKaMY8xfMgl13ERtxXbcnND1Yezsn4g=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Just 👍\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18941,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T13:51:59.845184+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ApplyBtn has great potential and offers some useful features, but I encountered a few issues that could be improved. Please contact me so I can share detailed feedback and suggest the changes I'd like to see.\\n\\nEmail: contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18929,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T08:58:21.978107+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"4429e453-151e-42a2-9bb9-35960da12d7c\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLagBu-0RuzDCFdzXcueDusfkrikp7jpFyywRSCY4mwJW4oDMbzDQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great product and ideea. A real time saver! \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18878,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T08:48:59.276005+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ApplyBtn has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nEmail: contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18872,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-24T20:46:25.956732+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3af9f837-7bfd-43d7-838b-67c9eed51233\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKi1VMUs0fVNRXBmh0i70vyysotAUplVslwUyB7Xyk13mlSIPWt=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"very useful, speeds up applying by a lot. recommended\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18866,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-23T10:16:12.806265+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"0cd613cc-786c-41b1-b3b0-da9a53a13209\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLnZQCab60ILZWKJZumBR00b8ADyeUSVtmj1wQ68vDmSdvhB4zasQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I like how simple it is to use. Applying for jobs is rarely a fun experience but this tool makes it effortless and increases your chances to hear back. \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18831,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T17:17:05.968257+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"f7f3ba0d-9754-4f2f-a86d-54924b64c6d0\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAIek0dQbIeIEM2sQjhdBbFoDxgvGNnnodfIaoiL5xgaP1Css=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"this product is different than other looking similar to it, mainly because of little attentions to details in the whole flow that was definitely done with a user in mind! \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18828,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T15:04:33.677863+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"a93d6761-f03d-435a-a485-f7ea2af23392\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1617187851703140353/fzJGsTab_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"A genuinely useful AI tool that saves job seekers hours by autofilling applications and generating tailored answers without taking away user control ❤️.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18827,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T14:38:07.905212+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"44b235f0-5fe9-4639-8ca4-e3e6f867a5dc\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLO0rTpPTZNJsrRus_ypGtAy2BZDiackvquSWWVWG5uM_Y06A=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"This extension autofills the job forms that other apps just can't! 10 of 10!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18826,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T14:28:55.031042+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e121a018-5f45-4326-88cd-b7760eb559d8\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKB38HF1sMqh0JSNGZIf5FVO7z_znHcOU8hh1AqOtvk9lOMtg=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great product that saves a lot of time.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18792,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-21T02:49:26.056584+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"c0e4f59f-5f2e-4ba2-a0d3-10fbfc6497a5\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIz65PFRLQkkDdgFM5J19SUMt_UWNYU5ECKgM03LAy4J66JWA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ApplyBtn tries to fill every single form, not only limited amount of known ATS forms - this is the great advantage against other autofill apps\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17083,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-19T01:48:04.004229+00:00\",\"product_id\":17588,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.verstage.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Verstage is a lightweight status tracker for your work. You know how you can watch a pizza go from the oven to out-for-delivery to your door? Verstage does that for your projects. Your clients and teammates watch progress happen, stage by stage, in real time — no more juggling status emails, calls, and “any news yet?” messages.\",\"maker_name\":\"Mark\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/verstage/verstage-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-20\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":9,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3627,\"product_points_week\":4027,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19297,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:39:58.001354+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Verstage Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18966,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T14:28:53.849037+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Verstage Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18789,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T13:10:30.928246+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"58da0833-aea9-43ca-88a8-db77cdd00d72\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfZK4CTAq1lU8qFRV-wBH2RhVPLyUPf9HZoOEv9yAGbi5UiA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Quick and snappy. It does exactly what it is supposed to do. Looks great!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18787,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T11:53:40.248768+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"0823e8d4-04e2-4c3b-bc86-1c014ddac4f0\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNtcAZcbfcbIvJ8iPK72zDhtsafqHgN5xI2meK-bIiVBEiGw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great UI, easy tool to learn and use! \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17236,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-23T15:28:33.25716+00:00\",\"product_id\":17740,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.apeirocraft.tech/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Freelancers and agencies send proposals and hear nothing for days. ApeiroCraft adds read receipts so you know exactly when clients open it — then e-signature and one-click invoice generation from the accepted proposal. Free plan, flat rate, works globally.\",\"maker_name\":\"Shaish Guni\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKarQJsNU70QthyW8PM4Zxe1WdpVK-uwTNZ3VgYfl023A1j8OZ5=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"shaishg87031\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/apeirocraft/Capture-2026-07-23-90145-PM.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":12,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3627,\"product_points_week\":4027,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19434,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T07:54:38.89909+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Open-tracking on proposals changes follow-up completely - a client who opened it 3 times before the call is a different conversation. Does it track per-section dwell? Knowing they reread pricing twice is gold.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19278,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:26:37.140928+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"APEIROCRAFT Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19187,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T11:26:33.615507+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"2394b724-1bfd-4edc-81ad-88b7f09a852f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJi82xe46t8paEBhJUJSPGG0qzIc9Ud2FY6QDn-wk1tXEwQbQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"This is a very fascinating product and is a useful tool to have especially as a small to medium business owner.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19167,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T04:02:00.415118+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"29cc5e51-f94f-4cdf-8c2c-1b80d39f85ad\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9xGLpBnmbqsL4ZjIP9NEuO5aLgaun269IeAMTRtWpNkgRYg=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I really liked this platform. ApeiroCraft's proposals features was exactly what a business or an agency expects to have the one click convert to invoices its really lit love it.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19166,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T01:29:07.058861+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"70bf55c0-e4df-48f6-91a2-b9bae1093dc0\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKarQJsNU70QthyW8PM4Zxe1WdpVK-uwTNZ3VgYfl023A1j8OZ5=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Hey ,founder here. Built this after watching freelancer friends send proposals and hear nothing back for days, not knowing if the client even opened it.\\nThe read receipt was the first thing I built. Everything else — e-signature, one-click\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17546,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T16:57:44.935624+00:00\",\"product_id\":18045,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://thereflection.io/growing-teams-package\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Most corporate training platforms are built for large companies with dedicated L\u0026D teams. The Reflection brings the same AI roleplay simulations and knowledge base to teams of 3-20, without the setup time or enterprise price tag. New hires practice real sales calls, objection handling, and difficult conversations with an AI coach that gives structured feedback after every session, using a knowledge base built from your own docs and playbooks. Live within 24 hours, from €350/month.\",\"maker_name\":\"Petr\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@TheReflectionio/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"TheReflectionio\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/thereflection/thereflection-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3627,\"product_points_week\":4027,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19934,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:08:09.88676+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"The Reflection Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16713,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T22:31:53.260672+00:00\",\"product_id\":17220,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://ipcheckly.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"IPCheckly delivers fast, reliable IP intelligence through a powerful API that helps identify locations, networks, VPNs, proxies, Tor nodes, and potential security risks. Designed for developers and businesses, it enables smarter fraud prevention, geolocation, access control, and analytics with accurate, real-time data and seamless integration into modern applications.\",\"maker_name\":\"Alexander\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/ipcheckly/Screenshot-2026-07-02-at-01.00.30.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-02\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":14,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.285714285714286,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3619,\"product_points_week\":4019,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19443,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T07:58:15.992443+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"IP intel tools are only as good as data freshness - what's the threat-feed update cadence? A 'last updated' timestamp per lookup would be a nice trust signal.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19299,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T09:19:43.091532+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"IPCheckly Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18958,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T14:08:53.79435+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"IPCheckly Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18740,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T21:51:07.433886+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"1c70f0dc-90d4-493d-ac26-9e230886e1d5\",\"voter_avatar_url\":null,\"feedback\":\"Useful service to detect VPN and fraud prevention for own business\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18525,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-10T20:51:45.168625+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"d70759b6-dce2-462a-865d-2e64033b2944\",\"voter_avatar_url\":null,\"feedback\":\"We've used their API in the past before we've created our own\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18474,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T10:29:27.620981+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"IPCheckly has great potential! I have a few suggestions that could make it even better. Feel free to reach out for detailed feedback.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nEmail: Contact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18325,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-02T19:46:46.937158+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"22493ddf-51dd-409b-b66d-2f16b8b8a4b6\",\"voter_avatar_url\":null,\"feedback\":\"Great to check geolocation of customers\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17204,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:21:03.705604+00:00\",\"product_id\":17709,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://getreelyze.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Reelyze is an AI video analytics tool for content creators. Paste any Reel, TikTok, or Short, and it analyzes your video frame by frame, showing your hook score, retention map, and the exact second viewers drop off. It also tracks your competitors automatically and writes your next script using your own performance data. Built for creators who want to stop guessing why their videos flop and start growing with real insights.\",\"maker_name\":\"Usama Latif\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@OrdinaryWeb3Dev/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"OrdinaryWeb3Dev\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/reelyze/Reelyze-Logo-Banner-1500x500.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-22\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,