:\"live\",\"description\":\"SoloUno helps people take control of body-focused repetitive habits like hair pulling (trichotillomania), skin picking, and nail biting. Because these habits tend to come and go rather than disappear, SoloUno focuses on real progress over quick fixes - affordable, daily, built for long-term habit change. It also supports behavioral therapy \\\"homework\\\" for those in treatment.\",\"maker_name\":\"Omer Bialer\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@SoloUnoApp/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"SoloUnoApp\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/solouno/SoloUno-Cover.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-14\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":27,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.407407407407407,\"score_execution\":4.8,\"product_points\":3591,\"product_points_week\":3991,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19306,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T09:30:33.200924+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"SoloUno Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18945,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T13:58:04.571153+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"SoloUno has great potential and offers some useful features, but I encountered a few issues that could be improved. Please contact me so I can share detailed feedback 