and fraud detection is increasingly critical as attacks sophisticate. The 0-100 abuse score and geolocation capabilities are table stakes for security teams. Consider: real-time threat\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18526,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-10T20:53:39.430846+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"22493ddf-51dd-409b-b66d-2f16b8b8a4b6\",\"voter_avatar_url\":null,\"feedback\":\"We know the developer and the API, it's a good service\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18163,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T10:23:58.781567+00:00\",\"product_id\":18660,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://strew.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Strew is a simple home education app that helps parents capture learning without the paperwork. Quickly log activities, projects, books, trips and everyday moments, while optional AI identifies learning outcomes and helps organise your records. Over time, Strew builds a clear picture of your child’s education and turns it into professional, ready-to-share PDF reports in minutes, leaving you more time for the learning itself.\\n\",\"maker_name\":\"Woody\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@woodyhayday/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"woodyhayday\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/strewhomeedtrackingapp/strew-home-education-app-for-home-ed-parents.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":2,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":3373,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18341,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T10:37:09.189795+00:00\",\"product_id\":18838,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://polydraft.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"PolyDraft is an AI website builder that turns a business brief or existing URL into a researched, responsive, production-ready site. After launch, it keeps finding SEO, GEO, internal-linking, content, and localization opportunities, prepares improvements in context, and lets you review every change before publishing. Build and preview for free, deploy to your own domain and cloud, and grow across up to 100 languages without juggling separate website, SEO, and localization tools.\",\"maker_name\":\"Vincent\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@polydraft/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"polydraft\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/polydraft/polydraft-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":3373,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18310,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T11:28:02.220317+00:00\",\"product_id\":18807,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://tapvid.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"TapVid turns the materials you already have into a video that explains things clearly and accurately, with shot-level editing, batch production, REST API, and MCP access.\",\"maker_name\":\"Kenneth Chen\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/tapvid-49ead3/Shou-Ye-Wang-Zhan.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":3373,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_booste