com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18743,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-17T10:40:02.083728+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"b51a3599-c3fe-4892-9c6c-151ca8eff3eb\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocII7uhM2-5LdyYRg1t-fCtDL4yYRHN9LQIJ9oaNKZFXffsefw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great product! I'm gonna trying for a next week, with scheduled reviews\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18742,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-17T10:08:44.026043+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"699977ac-e699-4931-8eb1-2dbfa0204218\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL9Ly5t9nUEn7Vs4BvYaI1hLg4OC5nq4CVENOVRvTmLp6B85Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I tested it. I found it very interesting overall because I imported an infographic and the parser return me coherent questions about the content.\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18731,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T15:29:06.008103+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"efcbb7d5-7e70-4403-9ee4-28b9ad48b6cb\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI2L67ex7-BAUGy_lmyqZ0_MdUAyOJ50Qk3mamQ8EQxvb8Facw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I tried it, very usefull for his semplicity and fast setup. No manual flashcards writing like other famous tools\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16706,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T16:13:30.32268+00:00\",\"product_id\":17214,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://seedance25.tech\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Seedance 2.5 is a production-grade AI video generation platform accessible at seedance25.tech. Built for creators, brands and film studios, it delivers native 30-second single-pass cinematic footage with zero stitching, supports up to 50 multi-modal references for consistent visual identity, and offers precision local editing without full re-renders. With native audio-video sync and 4K output, it turns creative concepts into publishable studio-grade vid