or 3D printing, games, AR, and design work.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16360,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T18:31:23.973527+00:00\",\"product_id\":16870,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://conversion.business\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"conversion.business provides free, open-source starter templates for React, Svelte, and Vue that replace boring CAPTCHAs with interactive, zero-telemetry mini-games. Built for developers who want to stop bots without ruining their user experience, these templates are ready to drop into your next web project. The code is completely free to clone and use, with pre-configured components and fully localized documentation to help you build faster.\",\"maker_name\":\"Kate\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKi1LAiU-NL3bAWEhiidD5S7Nij4lZxZxrhy0JkIyP1WWpyiw=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"kate4cconversion\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/conversionbusiness/1-Screenshot-2026-05-01-161715.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-18\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":6,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3127,\"product_points_week\":4027,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19052,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:41:23.010902+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"conversion.business Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18650,\"created_at\