ers running pre-seed and seed rounds. It combines your fundraising context with a live investor database: fund profiles, partner and analyst contacts, investment focus, recent news, portfolio signals and warm intro paths. It helps founders prioritize the right investors, prepare personalized outreach, draft follow-ups and keep every investor conversation moving without losing context.\",\"maker_name\":\"Dmitry Abramov\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@d_abramov/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"d_abramov\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/roundos/IMG_20260628_142639_890.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-29\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.285714285714286,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3119,\"product_points_week\":4019,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19320,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T09:42:01.892484+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Round OS Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19036,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:36:02.565262+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Round OS Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18640,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T14:13:32.640006+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Round OS has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18215,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-29T09:57:47.909533+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"f92d9234-41ed-473a-8832-f6b3c0cf784c\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056496596464881665/l5A18DKC_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Simple, yet powerful idea. Especially that they found a way to crawl updates from my linkedin messages. The fundraising process has become MUCH easier\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16124,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-03T20:25:32.511332+00:00\",\"product_id\":16636,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://aurumapp.org\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Aurum is a privacy-first personal finance app that lets you track income, expenses, and net worth without ever connecting a bank account. You stay in control, manually log transactions, set budgets, and see your full financial picture in one clean dashboard. No data sold, no third-party access, no subscriptions to your banking credentials. Built for people who want financial clarity without sacrificing privacy. Free to start. Aurum Pro at $9/month.\",\"maker_name\":\"Jason\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkzxjKi15n5qz5CeNdUAjFRw8Rl7ZcQchkuSsTAVXVg14nApU=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"JasonMBrownPF\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/aurum-06abe5/aurumhero2x1clean.jpg\",\"batch_nu