ent than any other planner I have come across. In an age of digital fear, not having to link bank accounts makes me feel safe and secure using the app. I appreciate the different modes to tackle debt.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16638,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T21:57:40.669554+00:00\",\"product_id\":17146,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://daily-tube.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"DailyTube monitors your YouTube channels, subreddits, X accounts, and TikTok creators overnight and delivers one AI briefing every morning to WhatsApp, email, or Telegram. No app to open, no feed to scroll — it just arrives. Each briefing goes through 14 refinement stages.\\n\\nAsk Max, the built-in AI assistant, follow-up questions with answers cited back to the exact source. Free forever, no card required.\",\"maker_name\":\"Ryan\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/dailytube/screenshot-from-2026-06-28-08.32.46.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-29\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":11,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.181818181818182,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3102,\"product_points_week\":4002,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19321,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T09:42:26.099151+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"DailyTube Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19025,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:26:32.845836+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"DailyTube Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18708,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:24:59.47749+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"DailyTube has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18502,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T10:50:12.439483+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"DailyTube has great potential! I have a few suggestions that could make it even better. Feel free to reach out for detailed feedback.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nEmail: Contact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18210,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-29T09:29:11.136827+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Love the consolidation idea! Free forever is great. One suggestion: bulk categorization/filtering for digests would help users manage overload. Also, more transparent about data retention. The WhatsApp/Telegram integration is smart though!\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":15869,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-20T19:22:02.264023+00:00\",\"product_id\":16383,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://helloaeterna.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Aeterna is a secure digital vault that turns your life stories, photos, and voice notes into an interactive AI Digital Twin. Don't just leave behind a static box of photos—give future generations the ability to converse with your memories forever.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n\\n🎙️ AI Biographer: Effortless weekly storytelling prompts.\\n\\n🧠 Zero-Hallucination RAG: Stays 100% true to your actual words.\\n\\n🔒 Bank-Grade Privacy: AES-256 encrypted, never sold.\\n\\n📦 Media Vault: Add photos and letters for context.\\n\\nFree Account!\",\"maker_name\":\"Roy Heller\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGFPrMWW4WihdwCQTipYD5KjJKgDnpnv2CSILTrk4Jgj4L=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/aeterna/ban.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":12,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.166666666666667,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3100,\"product_points_week\":4000,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":18153,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T13:00:03.365932+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Beautiful concept addressing a real emotional need - preserving family stories and voices. The AI digital twin idea is innovative. To expand reach: 1) Simplify onboarding for non-tech families, 2) Add family collaboration so relatives contr\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17652,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-02T09:48:22.570672+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"621da0aa-857c-4972-abc4-d29e6e216279\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976238128609341440/YM3RuuJQ_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"This is a beautiful application of AI. Technology is at its best when it helps preserve the things that make us human: our stories, memories, and connections.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"fee52404-c4bb-4b19-837d-f26594988d7c\",\"user_id\":\"6139c754-af87-48d1-bce0-470e12df3770\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGFPrMWW4WihdwCQTipYD5KjJKgDnpnv2CSILTrk4Jgj4L=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"unit 500\",\"text\":\"Thank you ! We hope this is a start of something new \u0026 awesome using A.I\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-03T09:35:16.459Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16392,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T23:35:30.996999+00:00\",\"product_id\":16902,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://zapnote.io\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Zapnote turns a cold prospect's domain into a personalized, co-branded microsite in under a minute. Instead of reading a wall of cold email text, your prospect opens a page built about them. Paste a domain on the homepage, watch the page generate live, and drop the link into your outreach. Built for sales teams and founders who want replies, not unsubscribes. No signup needed to try it. Be notable.\",\"maker_name\":\"Michael\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@yakitorigambit/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"yakitorigambit\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/zapnote/hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-17\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":13,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.153846153846154,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3098,\"product_points_week\":3998,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19061,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:44:13.002247+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Zapnote Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18660,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T15:43:37.744216+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Zapnote has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"58a26aa5-3672-46ba-86ee-0b4c4b35f18b\",\"user_id\":\"424cb6d5-7dd7-4cae-9058-8da29e1238e1\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"\",\"user_name\":\"Michael McCormack\",\"text\":\"Thank you for taking the time!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T17:16:44.431Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":18452,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08T14:51:29.464897+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Smart targeting of cold email pain. Personalized pages are clever. Consider: mobile preview on setup, A/B test templates for buyer personas, built-in domain warmup guides, usage analytics dashboard. Pain points: domain reputation takes time\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"4131f8ad-ad16-41ec-ac37-63faa3b0c9be\",\"user_id\":\"424cb6d5-7dd7-4cae-9058-8da29e1238e1\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"\",\"user_name\":\"Michael McCormack\",\"text\":\"Thank you for the feedback!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-16T17:16:20.641Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":18022,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T21:29:28.58593+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"006fc6e0-4321-4b1d-81f3-06034fe8d89e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFMf2hOTYUTNUyHLrlTrq3Qu8a7ebj5F7H307KgE0vTNa6lg=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"This product is a great outreach tool!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"09895436-fefe-41d5-b459-3d733d58c426\",\"user_id\":\"424cb6d5-7dd7-4cae-9058-8da29e1238e1\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"\",\"user_name\":\"Michael McCormack\",\"text\":\"Thank you for giving it a go!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T22:07:15.835Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":17991,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T04:26:59.957021+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"8556a926-b863-4ff3-a649-a75916243515\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJly16Kvpl-5Mk309TD7nptSM1CDx-T2BMgHgK8g43igz71=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Really smart approach to outreach. Cold emails are so easy to ignore, having a personalized page to send instead feels way more engaging. Clean execution too.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"5971ad3f-13ef-4648-8bfd-461b934b2ef6\",\"user_id\":\"424cb6d5-7dd7-4cae-9058-8da29e1238e1\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"\",\"user_name\":\"Michael McCormack\",\"text\":\"Appreciated!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T04:30:51.105Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16682,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T21:21:26.230641+00:00\",\"product_id\":17190,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://fluorly.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Fluorly is a voice-first AI communication triage platform designed for busy entrepreneurs. It tackles message overload by consolidating incoming communications across channels like email and Slack into one simple, easy-to-view dashboard. By keeping tabs on your messages and highlighting priority items, Fluorly reduces the noise so you can focus on deep work. Simply chat with your smart assistant to triage your daily communications and take back control of your time.\",\"maker_name\":\"Ben\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/fluorly/focus_dashboard_desktop.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-02\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":9,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":3,\"product_points\":3093,\"product_points_week\":3493,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19322,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T09:43:12.722497+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"fluorly Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18970,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T14:31:44.841437+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"fluorly Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18480,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T10:35:15.373423+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"fluorly has great potential! I have a few suggestions that could make it even better. Feel free to reach out for detailed feedback.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nEmail: Contact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18421,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-06T10:48:33.361745+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Attention gatekeeping for Gmail solves real email friction - killer niche insight. Clean UI promise is strong. Consider: cross-email platform support (Outlook, Yahoo), calendar sync to block focus time, team collaboration to share rules, Sl\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16381,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T17:49:59.363838+00:00\",\"product_id\":16891,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://secureintent.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Secureintent.ai is a free chrome extension that protects vibe coders and developers from pasting sensitive tokens, keys and 16-digit credit card details by alerting the user when they paste. Our unique zero retention architecture means the data is never stored or logged and it only ever resides in the local RAM.\",\"maker_name\":\"Julia Wright\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@Secureintent_ai/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"Secureintent_ai\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/secureintent/secureintent-waitlist.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":6,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":3,\"product_points\":3093,\"product_points_week\":3493,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19323,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T09:43:38.595601+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Secureintent Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18993,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T06:57:34.655916+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Secureintent Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18658,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T15:38:31.157855+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Secureintent has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18543,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11T21:59:38.742246+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Smart positioning on a real security gap - preventing credential/token exposure in LLM workflows is increasingly critical. The zero-retention architecture is a strong differentiator. Consider: multi-workspace/team collaboration, usage audit\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16517,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-22T18:26:34.326777+00:00\",\"product_id\":17026,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://maximem.ai/synap\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Maximem Synap is an AI memory and context management solution designed for developers and teams building AI agents. It offers ultra-fast retrieval with 15ms P50 latency, ensuring seamless interactions while integrating natively with 18 popular frameworks. Synap simplifies context management, enabling agents to maintain continuity and learn effectively across sessions. The SDK is open-source, available at https://github.com/maximem-ai/maximem_synap_sdk, while the product itself is not, ensuring comprehensive support for its users. With a free tier and transparent pricing starting at $19/month, it's accessible for startups and organizations across various sectors. Enhance your AI applications with Synap's custom memory architectures and anticipatory retrieval features for improved responsiveness and accuracy. For inquiries, contact us at gaurav@maximem.ai, and for a hands-on experience, visit our demo at https://synap.maximem.ai/playground.\",\"maker_name\":\"Gaurav Dadhich\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcY0VU_DGruF_bsVUyhyn-2zKV-k2pIvo4nMk9udctVF_yDw=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"gaurav_ships\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/maximemsynap/Screenshot-2026-06-21-at-10.34.47-PM.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-23\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":10,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.1,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":3089,\"product_points_week\":3989,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19035,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:35:45.80728+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Maximem Synap Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18685,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:12:49.386679+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Maximem Synap has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18209,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-29T09:27:28.55576+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great technical foundation! The 15ms P50 latency is impressive. One suggestion: the docs could better explain integration complexity with custom frameworks. Also, pricing model would benefit from clearer tier breakdowns for early-stage star\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18117,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T22:54:32.801555+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"450609f5-c7c6-4e5e-995b-a2fd5cb4b60b\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcY0VU_DGruF_bsVUyhyn-2zKV-k2pIvo4nMk9udctVF_yDw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Great product\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16262,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-11T22:34:13.704805+00:00\",\"product_id\":16774,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.phinite.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Most AI agents are one-off scripts. No identity. No version history. No governance. They work in a demo, then break in production. Every team rebuilds the same plumbing from scratch. Nothing reusable. Nothing composable.\\n\\nPhinite fixes this. One platform to design agents, evaluate behavior, deploy anywhere, observe every run, and govern every action. Agents as durable, reusable units of intelligence. Not disposable code.\",\"maker_name\":\"Swapnil\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKdUOsahx-57K_J63BCCev_BYqgRsRWe5OvqEhqUFQFdLM8cg=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/phiniteai/design.jpeg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-12\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":19,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.315789473684211,\"score_execution\":4.833333333333333,\"product_points\":3084,\"product_points_week\":3984,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19055,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:42:23.694422+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Phinite AI Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18652,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T15:35:13.208189+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Phinite AI has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18239,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T21:36:56.459689+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Governance + version control for agents is a genuinely smart approach. \\\"Reusable units of intelligence\\\" solves real DevOps friction. Consider: explicit LangChain/CrewAI compatibility matrix, token cost dashboard, library of battle-tested ag\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18128,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-24T14:18:10.521334+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Excellent OS approach to multi-agent complexity. The abstraction layers for agent orchestration, memory, and coordination are exactly what's missing from current AI frameworks. Product UX is clean. To amplify traction: 1) Bundle pre-built a\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17963,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T19:33:01.709828+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"829d8a9b-f61c-4b83-821a-c1bd71efcd0d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKL_lOsBZv85Pb23qy4Hj0Nb_b9Om9qovJ_Qg3GjQsMLg960Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Phinite is way ahead of most products in this space. While others are still talking about reusable agentic graphs and skills, Phinite has actually built it — and made it reusable across organizations.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17875,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T06:00:59.012792+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"932ed470-560a-417b-a5f9-aa23689fb66a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIp-8hKvOiW7ycNUw8tUN8PVNvrhXSM5PFVgu1LF1-vqFq23Qo=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Phinite AI manages agent pipeline execution smoothly without runtime latency flags. For optimization metrics across similar automation scripts, our core development data framework is fully documented over at https://ytmusicpremiumapk.net/\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17873,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T05:52:28.491253+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"d5732226-6213-4c62-bcb0-5b465006a74e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUrl5-5_K2l5WR3leHq1a7HWVPW8SrkJe_RIkfnJc9J32BBJJv=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Phinite AI manages agent pipeline execution smoothly without runtime latency flags. For optimization metrics across similar automation scripts, our core development data framework is fully documented over at https://ytmusicpremiumapk.net/\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16342,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-15T13:58:33.030676+00:00\",\"product_id\":16852,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://submitator.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Submit your startup to 100+ directories. Cheap, fast, and good.\\n\\nNot your regular \\\"we'll manually submit your startup\\\". We built real automation like back in the pre-AI era. Not \\\"AI assistants\\\". Not overseas teams clicking buttons. Just custom browser automation that actually works.\\n\\nOther services charge $200-500 because they pay humans and AI to do the work. We charge $29-79 because our robots do it better, faster, and 24/7. Simple as that.\\n\\nAnd you stay in control. You pick your directories after you pay. They're all hand-picked, with real traffic and domain authority. No spam sites. No dead links. You watch every submission in a real-time dashboard and get a full report with all your links.\\n\\nQuality backlinks. Better SEO and DR. Done in 24-48 hours. One-time payment, no subscriptions, 30-day refund.\",\"maker_name\":\"Vlad\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTZhCGNmY2vxsNVgysPWtK_JuLZdwf4R3MEHSQe9Xbu0pYURE=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/submitator/Screenshot-2026-06-01-at-22.30.13-2.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-16\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":19,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.315789473684211,\"score_execution\":4.8,\"product_points\":3076,\"product_points_week\":3976,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19034,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:35:24.58987+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Submitator Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18637,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T14:10:33.125933+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Submitator has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18555,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-12T16:23:03.596498+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Smart positioning on content submission and viral distribution. The 100+ directories strategy is solid for indie content creators. Consider: batch submission scheduling, performance analytics for each directory, pricing tiers for agencies, \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18138,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-24T21:55:04.057979+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Solid differentiation with real automation instead of manual labor. Perfect for indie hackers who want to submit without paying hundreds. A few wins would help: 1) Show ETAs per directory so founders know timing, 2) Real-time progress track\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17989,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T00:00:07.189841+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"424cb6d5-7dd7-4cae-9058-8da29e1238e1\",\"voter_avatar_url\":null,\"feedback\":\"Early days, but seems awesome! Only feedback I'd give is it'd be nice to see something next to \\\"processing\\\" status. Even a typical ETA for each directory for expectation setting!\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"7e053873-4a2c-4cf0-8e29-044b7196f2fd\",\"user_id\":\"87046550-4501-40ff-b0a3-606b76603b62\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTZhCGNmY2vxsNVgysPWtK_JuLZdwf4R3MEHSQe9Xbu0pYURE=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"Vladislav Dyachenko (wowinter13)\",\"text\":\"Hi, thanks a lot! TBH the ETA is 1-2 days, but right now, due to extremely high demand, my partner and I simply don't have time to scale the infrastructure :) So soon everything will be stabilized\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-22T11:07:42.213Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":17954,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T10:32:25.639064+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"43b77481-2309-4335-97a6-d472cd6393c1\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIb8_0C3r-gLDcTxdThxSV_N9Qi0OemjnXtPSBsPCGOSLJTn8o=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Really interesting approach, Vlad. I like the fact that Submitator focuses on real automation, transparency, and letting founders stay in control instead of paying high fees for manual work.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17953,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T10:06:33.026602+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"f2f42331-7d0e-4d20-b8a6-9078f7be224a\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLp9Giz9E1W_O1z5_pqEGPUAr_Xh6j0EgYT9bugyy7f_vAUi1E=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"nice approach\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17947,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T07:45:41.230747+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"87046550-4501-40ff-b0a3-606b76603b62\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTZhCGNmY2vxsNVgysPWtK_JuLZdwf4R3MEHSQe9Xbu0pYURE=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\":)\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16100,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-02T15:44:26.910119+00:00\",\"product_id\":16612,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://dessence.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"dEssence is an AI memory for everything you save. Save links, articles, and videos from the web, Telegram, or the Chrome extension, and it all lands in one library. Later you just ask in your own words, like \\\"that sleep article I saved\\\" or \\\"what can I cook tonight from my recipes.\\\" dEssence answers from your own saved material and shows the original sources behind every answer. Group saves into boards. Free during beta.\",\"maker_name\":\"dEssence team \",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKtNJtqMowJ1Ys_vaVfKZs1I1kY3osC-WTdCzfyXOWlZbo48g=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/dessence/dessence-hero-2720x1360.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-03\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":24,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":4.75,\"product_points\":3067,\"product_points_week\":3967,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19033,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:35:04.250687+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"dEssence Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18707,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:24:20.795761+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"dEssence has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18503,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T10:50:28.294107+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"dEssence has great potential! I have a few suggestions that 