:\"2026-07-11T08:41:45.573558+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Social listening tool for B2B prospecting. High-intent leads = solid pain point. Clean positioning. Consider: real-time alert system for when prospects mention pain points, integration with CRMs, team collaboration features, win/loss analys\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16466,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-19T22:29:52.703702+00:00\",\"product_id\":16976,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://forthwrite.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"ForthWrite is an AI email writing assistant for Gmail and Outlook that learns your writing style from your real sent mail. The more you use it, the more it sounds like you. \\n\\nGet smart drafts in seconds, auto-draft replies before you open your inbox, and maintain your personal voice at scale. \\n\\nFree to start, no credit card required. Works inside Gmail and Outlook on the web.\",\"maker_name\":\"Curtis\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIb2cQNdsCirhTPevTN8G53QEAuaF7IVCWG2ryNOozJYWMtQ=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/forthwrite/www.forthwrite.ai.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-23\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":12,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":4.666666666666667,\"product_points\":3047,\"product_points_week\":3947,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19056,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:42:44.930477+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ForthWrite Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18653,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T15:35:49.410535+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ForthWrite has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18069,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T14:22:25.38889+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Strong execution on voice-learning concept. Great UI/UX. Consider adding tone/style presets for different contexts (formal, casual, creative). Integration with more platforms would increase utility.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"9d804f59-ff97-4eba-bee5-ad393f13e456\",\"user_id\":\"0a00f974-5fda-45d0-8a8b-44dd5aa3600f\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIb2cQNdsCirhTPevTN8G53QEAuaF7IVCWG2ryNOozJYWMtQ=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"Curtis Boortz\",\"text\":\"I appreciate you taking the time to leave some feedback! To confirm, we do have tone presets on the widget UI. You can select between Professional, casual, brief, etc. to fit the situation.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T14:55:05.185Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":18054,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T00:25:11.671626+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"0f0a8906-7bd4-41a2-86a0-5fd313aee9fb\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocInp-WMplmM2sfqDmKqltI9fRkXR26zVKTGu159EIjEmxWvuA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Does a great job imitating the users voice\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18051,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T00:18:48.797152+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"0a00f974-5fda-45d0-8a8b-44dd5aa3600f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIb2cQNdsCirhTPevTN8G53QEAuaF7IVCWG2ryNOozJYWMtQ=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I’m the founder, so biased, but ForthWrite is the email tool I wanted: quick drafts that sound like me, not generic AI. Built for busy professionals trying to buy back time.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16089,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T20:10:33.857343+00:00\",\"product_id\":16601,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.evalyze.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Most founders raise blind. You send your deck out, hear nothing, and never find out what went wrong. Evalyze gives you the investor's view before you hit send. Upload your deck, get a VC-grade score in about a minute, and see the exact gaps a real investor would flag. Then match with the right people from 10,000+ verified investors. Built by an ex-VC, trained on 8,000+ funded raises.\",\"maker_name\":\"Vee\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcYKe8A7jrFCNkdYzMD_3y6RAyKgy2P3rck2TYaZk-F-rr1PKQ=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"vahidf24\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/evalyze/680landing.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-08\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":33,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.363636363636363,\"score_execution\":4.6,\"product_points\":3036,\"product_points_week\":3936,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vot