levant founders. Great execution on the platform UX.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17986,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T11:41:36.117543+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"621da0aa-857c-4972-abc4-d29e6e216279\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976238128609341440/YM3RuuJQ_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Good product.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17879,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T06:45:36.638228+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"1187c61f-021e-4fc6-97f2-9ffe63a33561\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL3B1PA7cOo4yCpJk5FL15h47Q82rAOZvQHfT3_ENeRxGKi8SoP=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Fast way to spot your pitch deck errors and how to fix them\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17872,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-12T05:12:54.867923+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"a9ff5445-d74d-4e1a-a8ee-f7b826206c3b\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL_zXsZSLXSCJUgKk-5YAEZgazZM-nj8mK-vRwA0g--e--LKOp7=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Perfect 👌 \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17773,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-08T05:01:43.195623+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"2930619a-2d84-4970-b4fc-6cd391a00b15\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI0uC6f_CimmSl6wKEiICWZa90F6sYOEKV7Dgbz4xjUMW973gM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"We used it for pitch deck analysis, and it was great. The feedback was excellent, and we’ve also started connecting with investors, which is a perfect match for us. The best part is, it’s fast and doesn’t require a lot of processing\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":17770,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-08T03:41:46.283554+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"6c787fa5-8173-4c40-8668-407e484f8ccf\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIMEE0cfnFF9yzK7yH4gj9n7EhQ80P05JLvodj6vxlZu0uq3ro_=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Evalyze is an absolute game-changer! The UI is incredibly sleek and professional, and the features are top-notch. It’s the complete package. Kudos to the team! 🚀👏\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16251,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-11T12:49:48.978122+00:00\",\"product_id\":16763,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://mapscout.net/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"With MapScout you get data and leads from Google Maps in one click.\\nFilter all businesses on Google Maps by keyword and extract results into easily usable spreadsheets.\\nZero time waste, zero unreliable results.\",\"maker_name\":\"Alessandro Lazzarin\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/979368059201781765/buUJ058D_normal.jpg\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"acidsoft\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/mapscout/hero-mapscout.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-11\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":21,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.190476190476191,\"score_execution\":4.666666666666667,\"product_points\":3024,\"product_points_week\":3924,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19003,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:17:29.331292+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"MapScout Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18713,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:29:09.833363+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\