ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Immigranta has great potential! I have a few suggestions that could make it even better. Feel free to reach out for detailed feedback.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nEmail: Contact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18408,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-06T04:10:36.518073+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"76515f90-77a1-459d-83f4-fa11bf5e57a9\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL4_YOD_2XDFUSjxRX8eFooD-pzwjNTf2TdKFL5JRoN4bWW-44=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Answering your indispensable question: a clear story on what happens to the case details people type in. Visa status, refusal history, that's client data under UK GDPR, and firms will ask where it lives before rolling this out.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18304,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T21:00:56.705976+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3f306b6b-b93f-4230-a56d-06a39fdb7fa4\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdUlFsH-h9wyFcyxS0wDNv1N2FnXb_Hl2U6SbyDkg33cRUEA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Really good product. I had questions about a new entrant skilled worker visa and it brought useful information for me and signposted me to the right gov.uk link. Thank you so much for the product.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18140,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T05:28:53.465978+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Solves critical pain - complex UK immigration rules grounded in official sources. Smart multi-user angle. To scale: visa pathway comparisons side-by-side, UK Visas portal integration, case law citations. Could be the standard for immigratio\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16822,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-07T15:29:38.966802+00:00\",\"product_id\":17329,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://purasim.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Travel eSIMs without roaming fees\",\"maker_name\":\"Marc Gonzalez \",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@soypurasim/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"soypurasim\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/purasim/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-07-06-231939.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-19\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":2,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.5,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2953,\"product_points_week\":2853,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19900,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T16:56:23.289756+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"purasim Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17774,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T16:46:38.001032+00:00\",\"product_id\":18276,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://clatree.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Clatree provides continuous, automated testing of your entire e-commerce checkout process, simulating real customer behavior around the clock. This ensures that every step, from adding items to the cart through to the final place-order button, is functioning correctly.\",\"maker_name\":\"Aleksander\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\