 contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18678,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:09:37.406885+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"HiBot has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18202,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-27T23:16:38.300625+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Genius solution for brand visibility in AI. Solving a real blind spot - most brands don't know how AI describes them. The ANSWER methodology is smart. To scale: 1) Automated alerts when AI descriptions change, 2) Competitor benchmarking das\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16520,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-22T21:02:13.994639+00:00\",\"product_id\":17029,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://businessideasdb.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Business Ideas Database (BID) is a research tool for indie hackers and solo founders who want to build something people already want. Instead of AI generated listicles, every idea is sourced from real demand signals: Reddit threads where people describe problems they would pay to solve, and App Store reviews exposing gaps in existing apps. Each idea is scored across opportunity, problem severity, feasibility, and timing, then enriched with monthly keyword search volume and competitor mapping.\",\"maker_name\":\"Omar\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI60spElL8hVn0_6jux8eS7r9uyIAJOwvsOqMRsGoq5s1m7cZc=s96-c\