premium tier. Great execution overall.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18049,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-22T21:08:42.412552+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"849bec0e-8f5d-46ef-93d6-c21067631e21\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI60spElL8hVn0_6jux8eS7r9uyIAJOwvsOqMRsGoq5s1m7cZc=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Find you're next business idea using businessideasdb :)\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":true}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18022,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T10:05:47.98424+00:00\",\"product_id\":18519,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://coding.tuya.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Tuya AI Coding is an AI-powered platform that turns natural language into fully functional, cloud-hosted apps. Simply describe what you want to build, and it generates working code in real time — supporting Web, H5, Mobile App, and Tuya Applet. With multiple leading AI models, production-ready templates, and conversational iteration, go from idea to live preview in minutes and refine through natural dialogue.\",\"maker_name\":\"Elina\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@Elinat925/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"Elinat925\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/tuyaaicoding/Tuya-AI-Coding-App-1x1-1200x1200.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19894,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T16:52:57.058295+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Tuya AI Coding Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18159,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T09:48:56.380474+00:00\",\"product_id\":18656,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://hushscript.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Hushscript is privacy-first, audio and video transcription service without a subscription. Video stays on your device, audio isn't kept after processing, and transcripts are stored encrypted. Free speaker identification with labels, AI insights, and transcript cleanup. Transcribe in 99 languages with top-tier accuracy, and handle specialist recordings with dictionaries, keyterms, custom prompts, medical mode, and multichannel support. Translate the result and export it in 21 formats.\",\"maker_name\":\"Vasilii\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@hushscript/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"hushscript\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/hushscript/github-1280x640.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-24\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":14024,\"created_at\":\"2026-02-18T11:25:14.947793+00:00\",\"product_id\":14539,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://nanobanana-pro.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Nano Banana Pro is an innovative AI tool designed for creating stunning 3D caricature portraits in a captivating Pixar style. Its advanced technology allows users to transform photos into eye-catching digital art with ease. Whether you're looking to enhance your personal projects or create unique gifts, Nano Banana Pro delivers high-quality, customizable results. Perfect for artists, designers, or anyone who loves creative expression, this tool combines simplicity and sophistication to bring your artistic visions to life. Elevate your digital art game with Nano Banana Pro and impress your audience with vibrant and playful designs.\\n\",\"maker_name\":\"Nano Banana Pro\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/nanobananapro-7dc0e1/1766397561739-k4q6744jpsr.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-03\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19281,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:27:47.360993+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Nano Banana Pro Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16801,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-06T17:43:20.632566+00:00\",\"product_id\":17308,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.directree.io\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"directree is an honest software directory and launch platform. Paste any product URL and get a full structured listing in about 30 seconds. Every field is clearly labelled Verified or AI-inferred, so you always know how we know it. Founders can claim their listing and get a do-follow backlink.\",\"maker_name\":\"Henrik Åberg\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2073549445757652992/1mjbPdOV_normal.jpg\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"directree_io\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/directree/directreelandingclose.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-04\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19468,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T09:35:13.14412+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Love the 'every fact labelled' premise. Honest label back: the site ships no CSP, X-Frame-Options, or nosniff - on Vercel that's a 6-line headers() block in next.config.js. Also ~1.4s TTFB will hurt launch-day bounce, and robots/sitemap 308 instead of 200 - some crawlers won't follow.\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19291,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:31:17.948465+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"directree Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17823,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-14T07:33:29.074141+00:00\",\"product_id\":18325,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://chartsy.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Chartsy helps