o API Gateway Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17395,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-30T14:19:13.135308+00:00\",\"product_id\":17899,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://claritrix.io/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Claritrix is a browser-based weighted decision scorecard tool for consultants, procurement managers, HR teams, and finance professionals. Pick from 18 templates across Business \u0026 Finance, HR \u0026 People, and Vendor \u0026 Risk, add your options, set weighted criteria, score, and get ranked results with a recommended winner. Export a branded PDF, live-formula Excel workbook, or plain CSV. Everything runs 100% client-side; nothing is uploaded. One-time lifetime purchase, not a subscription. Built solo, still early, shipping based on real feedback.\",\"maker_name\":\"Monaf Elsayed\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKN8KespVYk-EE7f75_pyrrZkFOtYhkaoCtEXHG-glUoCEgbc=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/claritrix/claritrix-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19922,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:03:53.377443+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Claritrix Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17481,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-02T14:50:49.143894+00:00\",\"product_id\":17980,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://fiuto.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Fiuto runs your full research loop: writes the study, runs it with AI testers and real people, and turns what happened into findings and a deck you can share.\",\"maker_name\":\"Dario from Fiuto\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/fiuto/coverfinal.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19925,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:04:50.202209+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Fiuto Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17487,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-02T20:46:27.052882+00:00\",\"product_id\":17986,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://seevio.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Seedance2.ai has officially migrated to Seevio.ai. Continue using Seedance 2.0 to generate high-quality AI videos from text prompts, images, videos, and audio references. E