me Lite runs 10,000 Monte Carlo simulations per game to generate win probabilities and player prop projections across MLB, WNBA, and CS2. Built-in NexBet compares model output against de-vigged Kalshi market pricing to surface real edges. Every prediction is publicly tracked and verified on Veri.bet — no cherry-picked results. Free daily pick via newsletter, paid tiers unlock full slates and player props.\",\"maker_name\":\"Clinton\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@NexGameLite/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"NexGameLite\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/gamblingdegen/Screenshot-2026-08-08-001929.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-08\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19935,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:08:29.960087+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Gambling_Degen Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17665,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-08T15:30:43.918194+00:00\",\"product_id\":18164,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://lightningapply.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Applying to 20 jobs shouldn't mean writing 20 resumes. Paste any job posting and LightningApply gives you a tailored resume and cover letter in minutes, formatted, polished, and ready to send.\\n\\nIt works from your real experience, so nothing gets invented and no job title you never held ends up on the page. Pick from different layouts and color themes, edit anything, and restyle without starting over.\\n\\nAny industry, any role.\",\"maker_name\":\"Neal T.\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/lightningapply/lightningapply-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-08\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19928,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:05:42.815179+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"LightningApply Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17800,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-13T15:35:02.457067+00:00\",\"product_id\":18302,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://crawlpanel.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"CrawlPanel monitors more than whether your website is online. Track uptime and APIs, then run real browser journeys through critical flows like forms, logins, carts and checkout. When something breaks, CrawlPanel shows you the exact failed step, screenshot and technical context you need to investigate quickly. Built for developers, freelancers and agencies managing websites where “up” doesn’t always mean “working.”\",\"maker_name\":\"Valentin Marin\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"h