0x630.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-14\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19924,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:04:29.654324+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"find-right-plugin Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17892,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-16T10:58:24.074995+00:00\",\"product_id\":18392,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://shieldlabs.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Fraud detection and prevention with traffic quality scoring, using visitor identification and anonymity detection with up to 99% accuracy. Stops multi-accounting, account sharing, fake signups and ad fraud.\",\"maker_name\":\"Jeff Milligan\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@Shieldlabs_ai/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"Shieldlabs_ai\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/shieldlabs/ShieldLabs-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-17\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":2,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19933,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:07:26.183249+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"ShieldLabs Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17944,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T08:32:07.769503+00:00\",\"product_id\":18442,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://telvio.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Calling an ordinary phone number in another country is still a rip-off. Telvio is a small iPhone app for cheap international calls to real landlines and mobiles over WiFi or data - the other side just answers their normal phone, no app needed. There is no sign-up at all: no email, no password. You buy minutes once, they never expire, billing is per second, and the first minute is free.\",\"maker_name\":\"vastflowhello@gmail.com\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/telvio/Frame-1.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16532,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T12:36:05.441814+00:00\",\"product_id\":17041,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://docstoaudio.online\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"DocsToAudio converts PDF, EPUB, DOCX, and TXT into MP3 or M4B audiobooks using AI voices—or your own cloned voice. The free tier offers 300+ voices in 30+ languages, with no account or file-size limits; documents are parsed in-browser and the original file is never uploaded. Premium is pay-as-you-go with no subscription, offering 800+ ElevenLabs voices, Gemini narration, background conversion with email alerts, 7-day re-downloads, and voice cloning from a 10–30 second recording or authorized upload.\",\"maker_name\":\"Sya\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3may2Y9QdRBM_TtDg5MUFaMOjbp_I1BfQfvlM5I-Yj4EVlQ=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/docstoaudio/docstoaudio-hero-2x1-under-512kb.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-23\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":9,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.222222222222222,\"score_execution\":4,\"product_points\":2869,\"product_points_week\":3769,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19031,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:34:21.535658+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"DocsToAudio Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18706,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:23:40.448334+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"DocsToAudio has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18115,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T21:45:08.693388+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Solves accessibility problem elegantly. Converting documents to audio expands reach for people with visual impairments. Free-forever model is refreshing. Quality of audio output will be key differentiator. Works with common formats which is\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"13cc8872-c65e-49d7-9022-ed731b7473ba\",\"user_id\":\"f8cbf701-736b-4f33-bfb9-1697e7311023\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3may2Y9QdRBM_TtDg5MUFaMOjbp_I1BfQfvlM5I-Yj4EVlQ=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"戚明明\",\"text\":\"Thank you so much for the thoughtful feedback!  Accessibility is definitely one of the reasons we built DocsToAudio — we want to make documents easier to consume for more people, including those who prefer or need audio.  You’re absolutely right that audio quality is a key differentiator. We’re actively working on improving the listening experience by integrating better TTS voices and refining the conversion flow.  Really appreciate you taking the time to try it and share your thoughts!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-24T13:37:09.510Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16587,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T18:37:14.495264+00:00\",\"product_id\":17095,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://fiveminutebrief.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"fiveminutebrief creates personalized daily 5-minute podcasts and newsletters for any topic you want to follow.\\n\\nCreate custom topics or follow public ones for free, then listen through your favorite podcast app using a private podcast feed.\",\"maker_name\":\"Daniel\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIi-2owyOCfwOIsA2mCaY_EV5Qx0D2KmQ1fsEZaP1dmlTjujVXe=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"DanielShinall\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/fiveminutebrief/Screenshot-2026-06-25-at-2.34.53-PM.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-25\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":10,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.2,\"score_execution\":4,\"product_points\":2865,\"product_points_week\":3765,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":18973,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T14:33:09.390539+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"fiveminutebrief Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18689,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:15:04.758027+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"fiveminutebrief has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18168,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T20:58:47.631314+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Excellent concept for busy professionals. Audio-first learning is smart. To scale: 1) Custom topic imports so users create personalized daily briefs, 2) Playlist sharing for teams, 3) Integration with calendars to auto-brief before meetings\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"96128d46-7bcb-4e32-a0be-64f68258a0bc\",\"user_id\":\"c12ff7fe-4fc4-4668-a1a2-5e1b28770d9c\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIi-2owyOCfwOIsA2mCaY_EV5Qx0D2KmQ1fsEZaP1dmlTjujVXe=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"Daniel Shinall\",\"text\":\"Thank you, friend! Great ideas!! Appreciate the review!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T00:24:34.216Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16581,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T15:05:37.339072+00:00\",\"product_id\":17090,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://cuecue.im/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"CueCue helps creators, coaches, small businesses and event hosts create interactive web cards for link in bio pages, digital business cards, RSVP links, service offers, bookings and lead capture.\",\"maker_name\":\"brooks\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5QGSRkmTSCz9xBqrBAVUliovgU3RqgOc_-d8g7CdUrQMTFg=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/cuecue/Screenshot-2026-06-18-at-09.56.48.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-25\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":13,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.153846153846154,\"score_execution\":4,\"product_points\":2858,\"product_points_week\":3758,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19014,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:22:40.068566+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"CueCue Your product has strong potential, but I fo