":\"live\",\"description\":\"AutomateNow connects n8n directly to QuickBooks, Xero, and FreshBooks to audit past-due receivables automatically. The engine categorizes aging invoices by urgency, triggering polite nudges or firm notices. For high-dollar or sensitive accounts, an interactive Human-in-the-Loop Wait Node emails owners a tap-to-approve gate before sending follow-ups to clients. Reclaim your trapped capital, eliminate weekly collection admin, and keep 100% operational control. Purchase turnkey blueprints at AutomateNow.app.\",\"maker_name\":\"Thai\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/automatenow/gpt-image-2_A_sleek_modern_2D_graphic_design_banner_with_a_680x340_aspect_ratio_set_against_-0.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":10,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":3.9,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2857,\"product_points_week\":2757,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19440,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T07:57:05.009894+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Human approval on automated dunning is the right call - fully-auto collections emails torched a client relationship for me once. Is approval per-invoice or per-rule?\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19274,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:25:16.468369+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"AutomateNow Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19202,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-01T12:05:25.303587+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Strong concept targeting a real pain point (invoice recovery). The human-in-loop approval control is a smart differentiator. Suggestion: clearer pricing transparency and more visible case studies with specific recovery rate results would he\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16055,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-30T22:31:17.10965+00:00\",\"product_id\":16567,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://improvemypage.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Improve My Page turns any SaaS landing-page URL into a prioritized audit report. It checks conversion structure, copy, pricing clarity, SEO, speed, accessibility, security, trust signals, links, and images, then shows what to fix first. Founders, marketers, creators, and agencies can start with a free limited audit, unlock one full report, or use a monthly plan for repeated page reviews.\",\"maker_name\":\"Lucas\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056534277282545665/kObWSuC5_normal.jpg\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"improvemypage\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/improvemypage/improve-my-page-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":21,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.095238095238095,\"score_execution\":4,\"product_points\":2849,\"product_points_week\":3749,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19026,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:26:51.770234+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Improve My Page Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18711,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:27:30.971014+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Improve My Page has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18500,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T10:49:21.54137+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Improve My Page has great potential! I have a few suggestions that could make it even better. Feel free to reach out for detailed feedback.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nEmail: Contact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18332,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-03T13:27:24.669648+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Landing page audit niche is underserved - strong product-market fit. Prioritized findings are gold for busy founders. Consider: API for monitoring over time, Figma/WordPress integration, competitive analysis vs similar pages, multi-page aud\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"194f2413-3abe-4fbd-9f73-5e917d2a1d69\",\"user_id\":\"b8213cca-df92-45bd-b6ca-006ca35a3d7a\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056534277282545665/kObWSuC5_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Lucas\",\"text\":\"Hi there ! The API and MCP have been implemented already, looking forward to hear your thoughts\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-05T20:04:22.927Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":18151,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-25T12:58:33.247806+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Strong execution on conversion rate friction. Heatmaps + session replay solves a real pain point. To expand impact: 1) A/B testing integration so teams test fixes immediately, 2) Competitor analysis showing high-converting page patterns, 3)\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"862f4438-d99b-4573-b572-3ca427e5f7b0\",\"user_id\":\"b8213cca-df92-45bd-b6ca-006ca35a3d7a\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056534277282545665/kObWSuC5_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Lucas\",\"text\":\"Thank you for your feedback. I appreciate it!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-26T17:07:22.395Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":17781,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-08T16:49:24.018509+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"22896ab0-be56-413a-9444-3b38f2617b33\",\"voter_avatar_url\":null,\"feedback\":\"I paid to unlock the report, but nothing unlocked. Every time I refresh the page or click on \\\"Unlock this report\\\" it just brings me to the payment screen again.\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"e58b1261-d911-4802-9335-271a4e386efa\",\"user_id\":\"b8213cca-df92-45bd-b6ca-006ca35a3d7a\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056534277282545665/kObWSuC5_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Lucas\",\"text\":\"Hi there! Thank you for reaching out. I have checked and all the customers who have paid so far have unlocked their audits. Can you please confirm if you have been charged? If yes, please contact me at: contact@improvemypage.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-21T23:29:11.052Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":17702,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-04T07:33:20.496691+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"621da0aa-857c-4972-abc4-d29e6e216279\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976238128609341440/YM3RuuJQ_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"Amazing product, love seeing tools that save time.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"d7c48b13-3d94-47a8-8cc8-6f500b7e62fd\",\"user_id\":\"b8213cca-df92-45bd-b6ca-006ca35a3d7a\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2056534277282545665/kObWSuC5_normal.jpg\",\"user_name\":\"Lucas\",\"text\":\"Thank you for your feedback, I am glad you liked the tool 🤝 The purpose of the tool was to help SaaS founders gain time and money to optimize their conversions. A CRO agency would take hours if not days to give a feedback, and would cost thousands of dollars\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-06T10:17:53.728Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16365,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T01:22:51.568135+00:00\",\"product_id\":16875,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://favors.dev\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Favors.dev is a community-driven marketing platform designed for founders to trade verified growth actions. Instead of relying on traditional ads or content grinds, founders use a point-based system to request and perform tasks like launch-day shares, product feedback, directory listings, and newsletter mentions. The platform ensures quality through a verification system where every action is checked before points are released, preventing freeloading and ensuring that marketing efforts compound over time.\",\"maker_name\":\"Mark Fulton\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKvKFI5yffjcBTAz0jhySI-ykVc0ILBMMp8A4ySWa8b1vRHQMVQNQ=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"favorsdev\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/favorsdev/favors-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-23\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":11,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.090909090909091,\"score_execution\":4,\"product_points\":2848,\"product_points_week\":3748,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19054,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:42:03.350546+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Favors.dev Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n \",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18647,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T14:21:04.805689+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Favors.dev has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18530,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11T08:40:59.348191+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Innovative marketplace connecting founders for growth hacking. Smart pairing of complementary services. Consider: verification system for successful trades, case studies/success stories, API for integration with growth platforms, risk manag\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18111,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-23T21:38:54.562897+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"ffbc7dee-ef7f-46c7-b8b8-31ba26ae538d\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuE6n1MpXL5Mc0G7DB88HT7GrwszyEAy4wWbRNEEb8U6ir4SQe1Q=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Concept is solid - verified growth actions solve credibility problems. Adding industry/stage filters would help match tactics better. Featuring top-performing trades on maker profiles could accelerate trust-building for new traders.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16178,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-06T15:14:58.425959+00:00\",\"product_id\":16690,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://darkreelstudios.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"The Film Room is the world's first football intelligence game — a new category beyond simulation, fantasy, and betting. Eight game modes, including Survival, Higher Lower, Stat Pad, Career Path, and Connections. AI-powered Film Notes after every answer give you a coach-level breakdown of why it matters. Built by a solo founder with real NFL industry credentials. Free on iOS and Android. 4x nominated at the Mobile Games Awards 2026.\",\"maker_name\":\"Pete\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqVY6VtcH9NdgkHN_Ba29Gyh_hm_7bxnShDM4J_plGqlu1r-dGLg=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"darkreelstudios\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/thefilmroomnfltrivia/FilmRoom_Hero_680x340.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"