id\":17181,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.pagesifter.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"PageSifter is a completely free aggregator of hand-picked tech news. A human editor sifts through the web to select the best articles. No algorithm decides what you see.\",\"maker_name\":\"Andrey\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6KLS76rgCHld6zdmcYMDcJhhxEnTOd-9MgA0MNzN2vAULXxLH=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"pagesifter\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/pagesifter/microl-pagesifter.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-30\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":15,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":4,\"product_points\":2833,\"product_points_week\":3733,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19340,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T10:10:06.422076+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"PageSifter Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18971,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-28T14:32:33.18095+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"PageSifter Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18475,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09T10:31:45.682164+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"9b5f3216-95e6-4dad-8109-45874ac1ac7f\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYdNFGzUwuARzutJazH7r3Dilv-gK6nEz_n6vNIHjvD5WhcM=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Mentio has great potential! I have a few suggestions that could make it even better. Feel free to reach out for detailed feedback.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nEmail: Contact@RforRank.com\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18288,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T15:38:17.531726+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"82c7ff5d-15c5-4802-a565-4eeffa5af810\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8IwRbmgwTQjAnO4wuo7MtoZuaNfoF8tZduqDeUuav91NnCg=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"A really great and useful idea for everyone. The website is very fast and well-organized, and the iOS app is well-designed—I use it regularly (the Android version is probably good too, but I haven’t tried it).\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18246,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T04:12:08.836416+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Humans curating tech news beats algorithms - anti-algorithm stance resonates. Clean design, free model are huge wins. Add: topic categories, search, save-for-later, weekly digest, web/desktop versions. Growing audience = quality signal. Sca\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"5dbe062d-6d4a-4b4e-96d6-dec518d3c771\",\"user_id\":\"0c66a544-5144-43d5-a099-16e52fe75d99\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6KLS76rgCHld6zdmcYMDcJhhxEnTOd-9MgA0MNzN2vAULXxLH=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"Andrey Hristov\",\"text\":\"Thanks for taking the time to share your thoughts! I'm glad you brought up these ideas, because they are so important that... they are actually already built into the product.  Everything you suggested adding (except for the weekly digest) has been live on both the app and the website since day one. It seems you might have missed these features during your quick run-through — I highly recommend taking a closer look and actually testing them out!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T07:35:39.621Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}},{\"vote_id\":18243,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T22:06:20.644806+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"4121f6ef-7a20-4386-918f-a4f4e9a7c341\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtVyZqKpxRF1drIyDM7k9TiNxNZKzBe8cJcXy16NDYs93Lflrx=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Excellent curation concept - humans beating algorithms is compelling. Clean, minimal UI. Consider: category filtering/preferences, save/bookmark functionality, daily digest emails, reading time estimates. Mobile app design is intuitive. Str\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false,\"event_value\":{\"replies\":[{\"id\":\"a821bfdd-64cb-48f0-8562-e740b2bcf0ca\",\"user_id\":\"0c66a544-5144-43d5-a099-16e52fe75d99\",\"user_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6KLS76rgCHld6zdmcYMDcJhhxEnTOd-9MgA0MNzN2vAULXxLH=s96-c\",\"user_name\":\"Andrey Hristov\",\"text\":\"Thanks for the feedback! Almost everything you suggested has actually been included since day one. It seems you missed these features — I highly recommend actually testing the product out!\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T07:36:28.985Z\",\"edited_at\":null,\"depth\":1,\"children\":[]}]}}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17423,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T16:15:11.53413+00:00\",\"product_id\":17926,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://filechanger.io\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"FileChanger is a file conversion API that actually speaks technical formats. Convert Typst, Org-mode, AsciiDoc, DocBook, Jira markup, LaTeX, reStructuredText and Markdown in any direction, plus DOCX, PDF, EPUB, images, audio and video, across 40+ formats. One POST with a from and to format returns the converted bytes, no SDK to learn. Large files run as async jobs, and a built-in MCP server lets AI agents convert files for you.\",\"maker_name\":\"Sean\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@seanparsons/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"seanparsons\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/filechanger/filechanger-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":3.75,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2833,\"product_points_week\":2733,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19916,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:01:46.402152+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"File Changer Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\\n\\n\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19449,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-06T08:34:09.588033+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e186ec02-0cfa-4cd0-aad6-d86ced7adc4e\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLLOrHZBYj-4KrFvKQkPAVKBJcdYIbiYsrJAP6p6KeoUd78hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Nice format breadth. Two launch-risk gaps: no HSTS and no CSP - for a tool rendering user files, a missing CSP lets injected scripts run with full page trust. On nginx both are a 2-line add_header fix; use `always` or the header drops on error pages.\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18469,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-02T21:51:10.375412+00:00\",\"product_id\":18964,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/AddCarWidgets\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Add Car Widgets makes Apple CarPlay yours. Add eleven home-screen widgets — photos, weather, music, a GPS speedometer and more — swap the default connection chime for a custom startup sound, and see time-synced lyrics from Apple Music and Spotify. No CarPlay in your car? Mount Mode turns your iPhone into a big-tile driving dashboard. Built for iOS 16.2+, tuned for iOS 26. Free to try; on the App Store as Car Play Connect: Auto Sync.\",\"maker_name\":\"Valery\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@AddCarWidgets/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"AddCarWidgets\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/addcarwidgets/7.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-03\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18214,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T18:40:00.271834+00:00\",\"product_id\":18711,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://twinlylab.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Twinly Lab is a live-video AI twin marketplace. Creators, coaches, and influencers deploy an AI version of themselves — face, voice, and knowledge — that fans can book for paid 1:1 video consultations. These are real video calls, not chatbots, and they run 24/7 without the creator needing to be present.\",\"maker_name\":\"Aleks Nowacki\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@aleksnowacki_/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"aleksnowacki_\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/twinlylab/twinlylabherobanner.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18575,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-06T18:37:32.088821+00:00\",\"product_id\":19069,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://qevra.app/og.png\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Qevra is a free public directory. Paste a URL. We publish a page and a dofollow outbound link. No login. No queue. Ads are optional and labeled Ad. A homepage ad is $39.99 every 30 days. A listing-page ad is $49.99 on a specific site page, including a competitor's. Card ads renew every 30 days until you cancel. We do not promise rankings or traffic. Over 300 sites are listed.\",\"maker_name\":\"Mark\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@MarkZofMarkZ/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"MarkZofMarkZ\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/qevra/hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-06\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18614,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-07T23:30:23.647568+00:00\",\"product_id\":19108,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://irpforge.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"IRPForge generates branded, audit-ready incident response plans for nonprofits and small organizations. Answer a few questions about your team and systems, and get a Master IRP, Incident Report Form, and Emergency Contact One-Pager, built on NIST and CIS frameworks. No security background needed. Consultants charge $5,000-$15,000+ for this. IRPForge starts at $199, one-time.\",\"maker_name\":\"BH\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/irpforge/irpforge_hero_680x340-3-.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-08\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18656,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-09T04:46:07.052133+00:00\",\"product_id\":19150,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://scanr.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Scanr.ai is an AI-powered US-equity scanner that turns natural-language and technical/fundamental filters into continuously running realtime watchlists with alerts to help traders automate trade idea discovery, plus ticker research via charts, fundamentals, news, and market data.\",\"maker_name\":\"Eoin\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@scanrdotai/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"scanrdotai\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/scanrai/scanr-ai-scanner-overview.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-14\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18699,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-10T08:12:29.522476+00:00\",\"product_id\":19193,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://sociavault.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"SociaVault is a unified REST API that extracts real-time data from 25+ social media platforms, including TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, and Twitter/X.\",\"maker_name\":\"Olamide\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@sociavault/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"sociavault\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/sociavault/Screenshot-6-.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":18584,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-06T21:15:33.395774+00:00\",\"product_id\":19078,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.getitemlist.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"The stuff you own ends up in boxes inside boxes, at home and at work. Itemlist tracks it the way your spaces work: a location for each property, rooms inside, and containers nested to any depth, shared with your household or team on PRO, with insurance-ready records and CSV export. Free to start with 100 items.\",\"maker_name\":\"Damjan Dabo\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@DamjanDabo/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"DamjanDabo\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/itemlist/microlaunch-hero-1360x680.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-13\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":0,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":0,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2733,\"product_points_week\":2133,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_s