6-07-15T15:44:03.212351+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"forge has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18545,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11T22:01:28.690685+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Clever positioning on contractor onboarding pain - fast website setup is critical for service businesses to look professional. 10-minute promise is bold and resonates. Consider: mobile responsiveness showcase, SEO fundamentals guidance, lea\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16209,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-08T19:49:51.290039+00:00\",\"product_id\":16721,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.wallmockup.net/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Place your artwork into real room scenes with accurate sizing, custom frames, and HD exports.\",\"maker_name\":\"Oleksii Shyshkov\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@OShyshkov/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"OShyshkov\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/wallmockup/hero-editor.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-09\",\"is_premium\":false,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.25,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":2513,\"product_points_week\":4013,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16919,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-12T13:22:56.382241+00:00\",\"product_id\":17426,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://gettier.app/?utm_source=MicroLaunch\u0026utm_medium=directory\u0026utm_campaign=founding\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"You don't quit your projects — you slowly disappear from them. Every tool you've tried (Notion, habit trackers, accountability partners) waited for YOU to show up. Tier is an AI coach that reaches out first: it knows your goal, remembers where you left off, and tells you the one thing to do today. Daily personalized check-ins, honest weekly reviews. Built from 20+ user interviews. iOS \u0026 Android.\",\"maker_name\":\"Lumen\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLV9G9sYCAQnE1wSa_I3vTWahMfHrAgIFFgX9NDI02SxwX5WRUcQg=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/tier/ChatGPT-Image-Jul-10-2026-05_21_37-PM.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":8,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.5,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2453,\"product_points_week\":2853,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19753,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-17T06:39:37.18308+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"321f0e58-4f70-442f-9503-934d37eee6b9\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkCnZL6JVInNIK3KcsdDV0H1kB8QOdLeXAtY0quP4mhaNOYeUCZg=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"I have several projects and some are just fading away, so the idea is really great to focus on the long term and do not get distracted by life. So I think this is a realy good idea.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19342,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T10:10:39.853853+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75t