discovery-202607\u0026utm_content=launch_page\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Ember is one private place for everything you need to remember about the people in your life: birthdays, moves, hard weeks, favorite details, kids' names, and follow-ups you promised. Keeper, the AI inside Ember, understands relationships: it turns one sentence into a note, a reminder, or an answer. It works for the people you love and the people you work with. No feed, no followers, no likes.\",\"maker_name\":\"Cong Vu Dang\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ76PgwT-ennlmwEuHT1Bq03iU6qmPaJs743uAY90uBqo_ubUyOYA=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"keepember\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/emberrelationshipkeeper/ember-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-13\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.428571428571429,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2442,\"product_points_week\":2842,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19343,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T10:11:00.535031+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Ember: Relationship Keeper Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18996,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:14:05.302177+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Ember: Relationship Keeper Your product has 