otential and offers some useful features, but I encountered a few issues that could be improved. Please contact me so I can share detailed feedback and suggest the changes I'd like to see.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/44730734\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18295,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T16:07:18.538945+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"4e78d03f-07d4-406f-91b4-b3b655d39909\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2048802588137848834/9wgdk9SP_normal.jpg\",\"feedback\":\"The Deal Chaser concept-\u003e waiting, adjusting, or pushing based on live signals instead of a fixed sequence, is a smart reframe of outbound. Curious how it decides 'truly cold' vs. just needing more time\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18244,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-01T04:07:51.961164+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRbHKlkrnkJ4KAHwhENO_4w9oiOTGCCKbJ3GBnB1p1lgk-Ig=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Deal Chaser concept is brilliant - focuses on outcomes not activity. Love the multi-step approach. Consider: clearer CRM integration guides, pricing tiers for startups, sample success metrics/ROI calculator, template library. Would accelera\",\"is_roast\":true,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16305,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-14T01:00:26.443268+00:00\",\"product_id\":16816,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://cafecartographer.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Maps gives you the popular café. Not the right one.\\nCafé Cartographer finds the independent spot that fits how you want to work or hang that day — quiet with outlets, or loud and social — and shows you the details before you walk in. Even the places other apps miss.\\nTwenty seconds instead of twenty minutes. I built it for my own travel; now I open it every morning. iOS with Web coming soon.\",\"maker_name\":\"Sara\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\