 potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":17419,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T14:38:06.153963+00:00\",\"product_id\":17923,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://tradingpal.io/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"TradingPal finds wedges, trendlines, and consolidation breakouts across stocks, crypto, and ETFs—the same kinds of setups successful momentum swing traders have built strategies around. Every qualifying setup comes with its historical win rate, expected R, profit factor, and drawdown.\",\"maker_name\":\"Nate Ren\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@tradingpalhq/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"tradingpalhq\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/tradingpal/about-v2.jpg\",\"batch_num\":202607,\"start_date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2373,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19285,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-04T08:29:22.857504+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"TradingPal Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":19226,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-02T10:35:08.489959+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"3ba25be2-1faa-48a1-8e57-8f08aa4f0c27\",\"voter_a