rovements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false}],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16053,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-30T20:49:46.273938+00:00\",\"product_id\":16565,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://imqrscan.com\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"IMQRScan is an affordable QR code generator for creating branded, editable, and trackable QR codes. Businesses can generate QR codes for URLs, menus, Google reviews, WiFi, vCards, business pages, social media links, WhatsApp, files, landing pages, and lead generation. Add your logo, customize colors, download in multiple formats, and track scan performance. Plans start from only $3/month.\",\"maker_name\":\"Wasim\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.2,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":1905,\"product_points_week\":2805,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16082,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-01T09:23:51.781228+00:00\",\"product_id\":16594,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.keyapi.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Keyapi.ai: The Ultimate \\\"Moat\\\" Against AI Homogenization\\nThe biggest risk in 2026 is that your AI-generated content looks exactly like your competitor's AI-generated content. Standard TikTok data analytics tools scrape the same public data. The only way to win is by injecting Private Data into your models. This is where Keyapi.ai becomes your secret weapon.\\nHow it builds your competitive advantage:\\n1. Omnichannel Aggregation: Keyapi seamlessly pulls your proprietary data from TikTok, Amazon, Instagram, YouTube, and Shopify via a single, unified API.\\n2. Direct-to-AI Integration (MCP Protocol): It is designed to feed your specific brand context, customer CRM data, and past campaign performance directly into your AI generators.\\n3. The Anti-Commodity Engine: By grounding platforms like CreatOK in your private data, the content generated is 100% unique. It speaks directly to your audience’s distinct aesthetic preferences and buying habits, making it impossible for lazy competitors to clone.\",\"maker_name\":\"Keyapi\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/keyapi/Tu-Xiang-2026-5-8-19.00.jpeg\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.2,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":1905,\"product_points_week\":2805,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19080,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:54:29.435843+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Keyapi Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18683,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:11:52.493511+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Keyapi has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":f