plet Tools is a free collection of website diagnostic tools for checking DNS records, SSL certificates, HTTP headers, redirects, SEO basics, email authentication, sitemap issues, robots.txt files, performance signals, and common hosting problems. It is built for website owners, developers, bloggers, agencies, and small businesses that need quick technical checks without using multiple slow or cluttered tools.\",\"maker_name\":\"Mark Bimmer\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/hostdroplettools/hostdroplet-gallery-tools2.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-06\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":6,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":1873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16148,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-04T19:00:56.767973+00:00\",\"product_id\":16660,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.makko.ai/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Make 2D games with AI. Start with concept art, then create characters, backgrounds, objects, and animations - all in one consistent style.\",\"maker_name\":\"Kyle\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@makkoai/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"makkoai\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/makkoai/og-image-1-.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-08\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":1873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[],\"final_score\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":16440,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T17:07:47.527783+00:00\",\"product_id\":16950,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://vulny.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Vulny is an all-in-one cloud website scanner. One scan finds security vulnerabilities (357,755+ tests), audits your SEO for Google ranking, and checks AI-search (GEO) readiness so AI assistants cite you. It detects backdoors, exposed files and weak SSL/TLS, and ships a built-in ISMS for ISO 27001. Free 14-day trial.\",\"maker_name\":\"ARTEM SMIT\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/vulny/dashboard.png\",\"batch_num\":202606,\"start_date\":\"2026-06-22\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":1873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":[],\"feedback_arr\":[{\"vote_id\":19068,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29T07:50:23.170323+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"e62d98cb-8eb7-4a5a-b02c-24a510711aea\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr71PiMn4tP75tEjlBMyuo9Hffw7nxKEnf8vZIBCwB9PJ0hA=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Vulny Your product has strong potential, but I found a few key improvements that could make it even better.\\n\\nI'd love to share my feedback and suggestions—please contact me at contact@rforrank.com.\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_id\":18680,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-15T17:10:34.742314+00:00\",\"user_id\":\"842bddea-85e8-45f3-96c6-7a017a88a4ee\",\"voter_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-SJ9EVvJ12KS8Z7dnLU8H_luk4ec38kVCz6APK_uebKfUOw=s96-c\",\"feedback\":\"Vulny has great potential! A few improvements could make it even better. I'd love to share my feedback and suggestions.\\n\\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/447307349530\\nTelegram: t.me/rforrank\",\"is_roast\":false,\"is_feedback_by_maker\":false},{\"vote_i