te build. Data is processed in the EU by a Dutch company. Plans start at $9/month for 10,000 pageviews, pooled across unlimited websites rather than charged per site.\",\"maker_name\":\"Yevhen\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJggHv486ZZ1N1Ej8K3rzHHTi4BpKgcBQ1msKzQClWkh2YYqQ=s96-c\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"StatableCom\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/statable/hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-15\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":17,\"votes_all_time\":17,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":3.39,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.176470588235294,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":9004.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":5295,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$4fa\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$4fb\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"Statable\",\"slug\":\"statable\",\"problem_label\":\"Cookieless web analytics hosted in the EU\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/statable/logo-128.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"analytics\",\"web analytics\",\"privacy\",\"gdpr\",\"cookieless\",\"saas\"],\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":17944,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T08:32:07.769503+00:00\",\"product_id\":18442,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://telvio.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Calling an ordinary phone number in another country is still a rip-off. Telvio is a small iPhone app for cheap international calls to real landlines and mobiles over WiFi or data - the other side just answers their normal phone, no app needed. There is no sign-up at all: no email, no password. You buy minutes once, they never expire, billing is per second, and the first minute is free.\",\"maker_name\":\"vastflowhello@gmail.com\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/telvio/Frame-1.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":1,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2873,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$500\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$501\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"Telvio\",\"slug\":\"telvio\",\"problem_label\":\"Cheap international calls, no roaming, no sign-up\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/telvio/android.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"voip\",\"international-calls\",\"calling-app\",\"no-signup\",\"ios-app\",\"expats\",\"travel\",\"roaming\",\"prepaid\",\"telephony\"],\"market\":\"tech\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"One-time payments\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18398,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T12:33:00.471759+00:00\",\"product_id\":18894,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://spytrend.com/?utm_source=microlaunch\u0026utm_medium=listing\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"SpyTrend is ad intelligence for Facebook and TikTok. Instead of reviewing ads one at a time, it links the accounts, pages and landing domains behind a single advertiser into one profile, so you research a whole competitor at once: the creatives in rotation, the countries they target, and how long each ad has run. Over 1.1B ads are auto-sorted into 33 categories and 343 subcategories. Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Codex or VS Code over MCP and research in plain language\",\"maker_name\":\"Govard\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@spytrendcom/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"spytrendcom\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/spytrend/spytrend-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":3,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":5037,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$502\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$503\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"spytrend\",\"slug\":\"spytrend\",\"problem_label\":\"Competitor ad intelligence for Facebook and TikTok\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/spytrend/spytrend-logo-128.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"ad intelligence\",\"competitor research\",\"facebook ads\",\"tiktok ads\",\"ad spy\",\"ad library\",\"marketing analytics\",\"competitive intelligence\",\"mcp\",\"ai agent\"],\"market\":\"marketing\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18381,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T08:53:11.732497+00:00\",\"product_id\":18878,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.citegraph.app/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"CiteGraph measures which products AI assistants actually recommend. It asks the real questions buyers type into AI across four engines (ChatGPT family, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity), repeatedly, and reports how often you are named, who wins instead, and which pages the engines cite. Every rate carries a margin of error. Each scan ends with the specific missing sentence that would put you in the answer, drafted and ready to edit.\",\"maker_name\":\"Asif\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@akbuilds_/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"akbuilds_\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/citegraph/microlaunch-hero-680x340.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-31\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":13,\"votes_all_time\":18,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.388888888888889,\"score_execution\":4.75,\"product_points\":8815,\"product_points_week\":3976,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$504\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$505\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"CiteGraph\",\"slug\":\"citegraph\",\"problem_label\":\"Get your product mentioned by AI assistants\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/citegraph/microlaunch-logo-128.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"aeo\",\"ai-seo\",\"geo\",\"ai-visibility\",\"llm-monitoring\",\"brand-monitoring\",\"chatgpt\",\"competitor-analysis\",\"marketing-analytics\",\"seo-tools\"],\"market\":\"analytics\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18100,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-22T11:06:31.873623+00:00\",\"product_id\":18597,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://gorules.io\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Every company keeps two copies of its business logic: a document people read and code that runs. They drift. GoRules keeps one copy. Rules read like sentences, live in visual graphs or policy documents, and ship with reviews, releases, and tests. The open-source ZEN engine (MIT, Rust) answers your API, your agents, and your batch jobs in about 10 microseconds. An AI copilot builds and explains rules; people release. Cloud, self-hosted, or embedded.\",\"maker_name\":\"Stefan\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/gorules/gorules-ph-01-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-24\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":2,\"votes_all_time\":3,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":2,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.333333333333333,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":4245,\"product_points_week\":3658,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$50a\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$50b\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"GoRules\",\"slug\":\"gorules\",\"problem_label\":\"Business logic humans can read and machines can run\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/gorules/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"business rules engine\",\"rules engine\",\"expression language\",\"saas\",\"automation\",\"natural language\"],\"market\":\"ai\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18355,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-29T20:11:52.648896+00:00\",\"product_id\":18852,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/korovin-aa97/talkthrough-mcp\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Talkthrough is a local-first MCP server that turns screen recordings, audio, and long multi-speaker meetings into searchable evidence for coding agents. It indexes transcripts, exact frames, OCR, wall-clock timestamps, and optional speaker diarization, so agents can triage bugs, analyze incidents, extract specifications, decisions, and action items, and answer who said what with timestamped proof. Recordings stay on your machine, with no runtime telemetry.\",\"maker_name\":\"Alexander Korovin\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/talkthrough/talkthrough-hero.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-01\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":15,\"votes_all_time\":15,\"votes_week\":1,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":3.39,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.533333333333333,\"score_execution\":5,\"product_points\":8920.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":5353,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$50c\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$50d\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"slug\":\"talkthrough\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn recordings into searchable evidence for coding agents\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/talkthrough/talkthrough-logo.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"MCP Server\",\"Developer Tools\",\"AI Agents\",\"