10.526139+00:00\",\"product_id\":18920,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://retrek.me\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"reTrek is a mobile app that turns your everyday walking into a journey along a famous trail. Pick the Camino de Santiago, Everest Base Camp, the Inca Trail or a story-driven quest, then walk in real life. Every step moves you along the route, and each milestone unlocks a short film about the place you have reached. Walk solo, team up, or race your friends.\",\"maker_name\":\"Myko\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@_n0rdy_/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"_n0rdy_\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/retrek/en-US-1-Screenshot-1.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-02\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":7,\"votes_all_time\":7,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":5730.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$554\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$555\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"reTrek\",\"slug\":\"retrek\",\"problem_label\":\"Turn your everyday walks into adventures\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/retrek/favicon-192.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"fitness\",\"gamification\",\"walking\",\"motivation\",\"habit\",\"fun\",\"engaging\",\"social\"],\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18048,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-21T05:04:12.857462+00:00\",\"product_id\":18545,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://ripn.app\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Ripn is a grocery tracking app that turns receipts into spending data. Take a photo of your receipt and Ripn automatically reads the items, prices, categories, and dates. See where your grocery money goes, keep track of what may expire, and record what you throw away. It helps you understand both how much you spend on groceries and how much of that money ends up wasted.\",\"maker_name\":\"Kailoh Metellus\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/ripn/Know-what-you-spend-on-groceries.png\",\"batch_num\":202608,\"start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":0,\"votes_all_time\":5,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4.4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":2937,\"product_points_week\":2837,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$556\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$557\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"Ripn\",\"slug\":\"ripn\",\"problem_label\":\"Track grocery spending and food waste from receipts\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/ripn/Ripn-1024-x-2000-px-.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"Grocery Tracking\",\"Receipt Scanner\",\"Expense Tracking\",\"Personal Finance\",\"Grocery Budget\",\"Food Waste\",\"Spending Tracker\",\"Receipt Scanning\",\"Grocery Spending\",\"Food Management\"],\"market\":\"lifestyle\",\"product_type\":\"Mobile App\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"first-customers\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18472,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T03:03:10.810477+00:00\",\"product_id\":18967,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.teamslyapp.com/\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"Teamsly is AI-powered, all-in-one workforce management software for hourly, shift-based, frontline, deskless, and field teams. Build schedules, track time and attendance with GPS and geofencing, manage timesheets, PTO, jobs and crews, assign recurring tasks with photo proof, collect forms and audits, train employees, and keep teams connected through chat and announcements. Replace spreadsheets, paper timecards, group texts, and disconnected workforce apps with one web and mobile platform.\",\"maker_name\":\"Miles Belknap\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/user-avatars-002/@teamslyapp/avatar.png\",\"maker_social_handle\":\"teamslyapp\",\"hero_img\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/hero-001/teamsly/MicroLaunch_Banner.png\",\"batch_num\":202609,\"start_date\":\"2026-09-03\",\"is_premium\":true,\"votes\":4,\"votes_all_time\":4,\"votes_week\":0,\"votes_anon_week\":0,\"score_week\":0,\"score_week_penalty\":0,\"score_idea\":4,\"score_execution\":0,\"product_points\":5166.370563888011,\"product_points_week\":2773,\"is_boosted\":false,\"voters_avatar_urls\":\"$558\",\"feedback_arr\":\"$559\",\"final_score\":\"$undefined\",\"codename\":\"Teamsly\",\"slug\":\"teamsly\",\"problem_label\":\"AI workforce management: scheduling, time tracking, tasks, frontline teams\",\"logo_src\":\"https://wild-dust-0517.microlaunch.workers.dev/logos-001/teamsly/Teamsly_square_White.png\",\"all_kws\":[\"Workforce Management\",\"Employee Scheduling\",\"Time Tracking\",\"Time and Attendance\",\"Employee Time Clock\",\"GPS Time Tracking\",\"Task Management\",\"HR Software\",\"Frontline Workforce\",\"Deskless Workforce\"],\"market\":\"hr-tools\",\"product_type\":\"Saas\",\"offer_type\":\"Subscription\",\"stage\":\"growing\",\"is_favorite\":false},{\"id\":18807,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-14T07:56:23.58516+00:00\",\"product_id\":19300,\"version\":\"v1\",\"url\":\"https://www.roomai.ai\",\"status\":\"live\",\"description\":\"RoomAI turns a real photo of your room into AI-generated design options in under a minute, while keeping the walls, windows, and camera angle exactly as photographed. It covers 20+ room-specific presets — living room, bedroom, bathroom, house exterior, staging, decluttering — drawing on a shared library of 300+ styles, so each room type gets presets tuned to it instead of one generic style list. Free to try, no card required.\",\"maker_name\":\"Linn\",\"maker_avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/AC